second night in a row, more than a dozen cars were lit on fire. There have been no arrests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/01/us/cars-set-on-fire-in-los-angeles-for-a-second-night.html', 'snippet': 'For the second night in a row, more than a dozen cars were lit on fire. There have been no arrests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a night when nearly 20 cars were set ablaze in Hollywood, in parking areas under apartment buildings or beside homes while people slept, area fire stations called in extra staff and increased patrols on Friday evening, awaiting a second strike, fire officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/us/SUB-Arson/SUB-Arson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/01/us/SUB-Arson/SUB-Arson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/us/SUB-Arson/SUB-Arson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 816, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/01/us/SUB-Arson/SUB-Arson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/01/us/SUB-Arson/SUB-Arson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For a Second Night, Vehicles Are Set Ablaze in the Los Angeles Area', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Second Night Of Car Fires In Los Angeles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lo