ney.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/31/for-romney-on-new-years-eve-quirky-questions-in-sioux-city/', 'snippet': 'If a confident Mitt Romney was on display at an earlier event in Le Mars, Iowa, the voters in Sioux City got a punchy Mr. Romney.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SIOUX CITY, Iowa — Mitt Romney has attacked President Obama over the economy, the military, and their differing visions for the future of the country. But there are some areas where Mr. Romney just won’t go.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Romney on New Year’s Eve, Quirky Questions in Sioux City', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-01T02:56:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8e7c319-a230-5489-a29d-35193886d640', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8e7c319-a230-5489-a29d-35193886d640'}, {'abstract': 'More than 500 people associated with the Occupy Wall Street movement gathered in Zuccotti Park, held a general assembly meeting, chanted the now familiar slogan “We are the 99 percent” and experienced a bit of friction with police officers.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/12/31/protesters-surge-back-into-zuccotti-park/', 'snippet': 'More than 500 people associated with the Occupy Wall Street movement gathered in Zuccotti Park, held a general assembly meeting, chanted the now familiar slogan “We are the 99 percent” and experienced a bit of friction with police officers.', 'lead_paragraph': '