 West crown despite closing the regular season with a three-game losing streak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — The Denver Broncos followed a well-worn script of their recent history, collapsing at the end of the season for the third time in four years. Yet 950 miles away, the Oakland Raiders rewrote the ending.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/02/sports/ybroncos-1/ybroncos-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/02/sports/ybroncos-1/ybroncos-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/02/sports/ybroncos-1/ybroncos-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/02/sports/ybroncos-1/ybroncos-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/02/sports/ybroncos-1/ybroncos-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tebow and Broncos Win West and Go to Playoffs Despite Third Straight Loss', 'kicker': 'Chiefs 7, Broncos 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tebow and Broncos Win West and Go to Playoffs Despite Third Straight Loss', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kansas City Chiefs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tebow, Tim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Broncos', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'o