 functioning in the elderly, a study shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Higher blood levels of omega-3 fatty acids, vitamin B, vitamin C, vitamin D and vitamin E are associated with better mental functioning in the elderly, a new study has found.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nutrition: 4 Vitamins That Strengthen Older Brains', 'kicker': 'Vital Signs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nutrition: 4 Vitamins That Strengthen Older Brains', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Neurology (Journal)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin B', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin E', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin C', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dementia', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamins', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-02T20:25:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Research', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c948b0c8-18d2-521b-b28e-24055887718f', 'word_count': 245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c948b0c8-18d2-521b-b28e-24055887718f'}, {'abstract': 'With a playoff spot on the line, the teams combined to draw the best overnight rating of any Sunday prime-time N.F.L. broadcast in 13 years.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/02/giants-and-cowboys-lift-nbc-in-ratings/', 'snippet': 'With a playoff spot on the line, the teams combined to draw the best overnight rating of any Sunday prime-time N.F.L. broadcast in 13 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The combination of an N.F.L. division rivalry game between the Dallas Cowboys and the New York Giants with playoff implications for both teams and a lack of competition from other broadcast networks worked strongly in NBC’s favor on Sunday. Preliminary overnight Nielsen estimates suggest that the game — won by the Giants, 31-14 — was not only the highest-rated “Sunday Night Football” game since the program moved to NBC in 2006, but that it also had the best overnight rating of any Sunday prime-time N.F.L. broadcast in 13 years. It barely beat the ratings for this season’s Week 1 game between the Cowboys and the New York Jets. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants and Cowboys Lift NBC in Ratings', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-02T20:26:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d412176-0765-541e-81f8-eb0b63e829d4', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d412176-0765-541e-81f8-eb0b63e829d4'}, {'abstract': 'PepsiCo is introducing new “Star Wars”-themed product packaging and a mobile game app to promote Brisk tea to its target market, young men under 30.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/03/business/media/to-promote-brisk-tea-pepsi-enlists-the-aid-of-yoda.html', 'snippet': 'PepsiCo is introducing new “Star Wars”-themed product packaging and a mobile game app to promote Brisk tea to its target market, young men under 30.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PEPSICO is piggybacking on the release next month of Lucasfilm’s “Star Wars: Episode I — The Phantom Menace 3D” to promote its Brisk iced tea and juice drinks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/business/ADCO1/ADCO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/business/ADCO1/ADCO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/03/business/ADCO1/ADCO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'To Promote Brisk Tea, Pepsi Enlists Yoda', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Promote Brisk Tea, Pepsi Enlists Yoda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Containers and Packaging', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Behavior', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Unilever PLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pepsico Inc', 'ra