ondo well project.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'BP Tries to Shift Costs From Spill', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'BP Tries to Shift Costs From Spill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico Oil Spill (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Halliburton Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T01:23:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4edd8dbd-7fa2-52eb-933f-4452201150b5', 'word_count': 188, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4edd8dbd-7fa2-52eb-933f-4452201150b5'}, {'abstract': 'The cost of entering the race has jumped about $60, or 24 to 39 percent, depending on the entrant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/03/sports/new-york-city-marathon-raises-entry-fee.html', 'snippet': 'The cost of entering the race has jumped about $60, or 24 to 39 percent, depending on the entrant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Running the New York City Marathon is a great way to lose weight. It is also going to leave your wallet a little lighter this year. Largely because the New York Police Department has begun charging event organizers to recoup its costs, entry fees for the November race jumped about $60, or 24 to 39 percent, depending on the entrant.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Marathon Raises Entry Fee, Citing Police Costs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New York Marathon Raises Entry Fee, Citing Police Costs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York City Marathon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marathon Running', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Running', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Road Runners Club', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T01:25:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Belson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Belson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6f43d6f-659f-5fc8-be6e-be1b0291f6fa', 'word_count': 501, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6f43d6f-659f-5fc8-be6e-be1b0291f6fa'}, {'abstract': 'A look at advance speeches, given to caucus captains, helps reveal the essential character of the candidates.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/02/my-name-is-____-vote-for-____/', 'snippet': 'A look at advance speeches, given to caucus captains, helps reveal the essential character of the candidates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DES MOINES — They are known as caucus captains: volunteers who will deliver impassioned, seemingly spontaneous final sales pitches for their favored Republican presidential candidates on Tuesday night, moments before Iowans cast their ballots. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘My Name Is ____. Vote for ____