n going on for more than eight weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/03/sports/ncaafootball/penn-state-coaching-search-not-inspiring-confidence.html', 'snippet': 'Top assistants, not proven head coaches, seem to be the focus in the search for Joe Paterno’s replacement, which has been going on for more than eight weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When judging the quality of a coaching search, it is important to remember that it is the result of the search, and not the search itself, that matters. Two years from now, we will be in a much better position to evaluate whether Penn State’s search for Joe Paterno’s replacement, now at eight weeks, was a cunning work of genius or an abject failure. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/sports/PENNSTATE1/PENNSTATE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 863, 'width': 611, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lowered Sights in Penn State Search', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lowered Sights In Penn State Search', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paterno, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania State University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T01:35:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Thamel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thamel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '',