nts-to-help-neediest-cases.html', 'snippet': 'After enduring rape and pregnancy as a young girl, Wendolyn Colon wants to one day counsel girls who have been sexually abused.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By the time Wendolyn Colon was 20, she had no expectations about finding true love. She was a single mother raising a son, Dayon, and was determined to do it alone, having escaped abuse at the hands of men she had trusted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/03/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Abuse Survivor Wants to Counsel Girls', 'kicker': 'The Neediest Cases', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Abuse Survivor Wants to Counsel Girls', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times Neediest Cases Fund', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Community Services', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T02:18:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mathew R. Warren', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mathew', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Wa