 the Beacon in March, during a year in which it will celebrate the 40th – yes, 40th! – anniversary of its live album “Eat a Peach.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sunrise, sunset. An old year ends, a new one begins; a rock ‘n’ roll residency comes to an end, another one continues. And while Patti Smith has brought an end to her New Year’s Eve performances at the Bowery Ballroom, the Allman Brothers Band will continue its annual tradition of playing a run of dates at the Beacon Theater in March.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Allman Brothers Band Announces a March Return to Beacon Theater', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Allman, Gregg', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALLMAN BROTHERS BAND', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beacon Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T13:36:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24da813c-7922-598b-91da-1179590d96cd', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24da813c-7922-598b-91da-1179590d96cd'}, {'abstract': 'Some 60,000 volunteers have scoured the continent for birds in the 112th annual bird count organized by the National Audubon Society.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/03/crowd-sourced-science-112-years-and-counting/', 'snippet': 'Some 60,000 volunteers have scoured the continent for birds in the 112th annual bird count organized by the National Audubon Society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Crowd-source