m to Their Feet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T17:24:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a8f2fba-a53e-52bc-af22-2dec436c5891', 'word_count': 1036, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a8f2fba-a53e-52bc-af22-2dec436c5891'}, {'abstract': 'If you get everything chopped ahead of time, this hearty stir-fry comes together in minutes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/health/nutrition/rice-noodles-with-chicken-and-turnips-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'If you get everything chopped ahead of time, this hearty stir-fry comes together in minutes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Turnips are a perfect winter vegetable for a hearty stir-fry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/03/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/03/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 688, 'wid