segregation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/nyregion/robert-l-carter-judge-and-desegregation-strategist-dies-at-94.html', 'snippet': 'Before Mr. Carter was a federal judge, he played a significant role in Brown v. Board of Education, the case that led the Supreme Court to abolish school segregation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert L. Carter, a former federal judge in New York who, as a lawyer, was a leading strategist and a persuasive voice in the legal assault on racial segregation in 20th-century America, died on Tuesday morning in Manhattan. He was 94. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/04carter2/04carter2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 715, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/04carter2/04carter2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/04carter2/04carter2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert L. Carter, an Architect of School Desegregation, Dies at 94', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Robert L. Carter, 94, Leading Strategist Against Segregation and U.S. Judge, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marshall, Thurgood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 6,