ucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/03/interactive-feature-anatomy-of-a-stump-speech/', 'snippet': 'A strong stump speech is one of the most important components of a presidential campaign. Times reporters following the candidates have deconstructed and annotated four stump speeches, providing context and checking facts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A strong stump speech is one of the most important components of a presidential campaign. In an effective speech, a candidate can weave promises and attacks, lay out ambitious plans, and connect with voters on a personal level. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Interactive Feature: Anatomy of a Stump Speech', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Ron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T18:34:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54b3be60-6a20-51f2-a49a-662871f8e74b', 'word_count': 93, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54b3be60-6a20-51f2-a49a-662871f8e74b'}, {'abstract': 'A glimpse at the Republican candidates campaigning before the Iowa caucuses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/04/us/politics/PRIMARIES-IOWA.html', 'snippet': 'A glimpse at the Republican candidates campaigning before the Iowa caucuses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A glimpse at the Republic