tmaker.html', 'snippet': 'Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater, which has wrapped up its first season under new artistic director, Robert Battle, delivers hits but should also present more challenging pieces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater’s annual five-week winter season at City Center is always a phenomenal draw. As with few or no other dance companies, all parts of that theater are thronged. The audience arrives in happy anticipation; then it greets everything with joy. Each section of Ailey’s “Revelations,” the hit of all hits, is not only followed but also actually preceded by applause.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/ailey/ailey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/ailey/ailey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/ailey/ailey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trying Always to Please, Rarely to Challenge', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trying Always to Please, Rarely to Challenge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graf, Alicia J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Naharin, Ohad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AILEY, ALVIN, AMERICAN DANCE THEATER', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Battle, Robert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Rennie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'p