ators are looking into the possibility that the man accused in an arson spree acted because his mother faced the prospect of being sent back to Germany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The mother of Harry Burkhart, the suspect arrested in connection with more than 50 fires that were set in the Los Angeles area, appeared in federal court Tuesday, fighting extradition to her native Germany, demanding to know where her son was and calling him mentally ill.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Legal Fight for Mother of Suspect in Arsons', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Legal Fight For Mother Of Suspect In Arsons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Extradition', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burkhart, Harry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-03T23:41:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Lovett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c24d733-325f-5944-9efe-ff88c8850da1', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c24d733-325f-5944-9efe-ff88c8850da1'}, {'abstract': 'Readers respond to a Sunday Review article, “The Joy of Quiet,” by Pico Iyer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/opinion/easing-gently-into-a-noisy-new-year.html', 'snippet': 'Readers respond to a Sunday Review article, “The Joy of Quiet,”