ary is next week, but with Mitt Romney far ahead in the polls there, other candidates are turning their focus to the South Carolina voting 11 days later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/us/politics/new-hampshire-is-an-optional-stop-for-some-gop-candidates.html', 'snippet': 'New Hampshire’s primary is next week, but with Mitt Romney far ahead in the polls there, other candidates are turning their focus to the South Carolina voting 11 days later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, N.H. — Former Gov. John H. Sununu had come to join the phone banks at Mitt Romney’s campaign headquarters here on Monday night when a reporter asked him what effect Tuesday’s Republican caucuses in Iowa would have on New Hampshire.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/us/HAMPSHIRE/HAMPSHIRE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 898, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Hampshire Now Optional for Some', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Hampshire Now Optional for Some', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Ron', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bachmann, Michele M