lano, one of the original members of Dion and the Belmonts, who wove his backup tenor tones into the musically seamless harmonies of 1950s and ’60s hits like “A Teenager in Love” and “Where or When,” died on Sunday at a hospital on Long Island. He was 72 and lived in Massapequa, N.Y.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/04milano-obit2/04milano-obit2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1005, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/04milano-obit2/04milano-obit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/04/arts/04milano-obit2/04milano-obit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fred Milano, an Original Member of Dion and the Belmonts, Dies at 72', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fred Milano, 72, Singer With Dion and the Belmonts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T02:10:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/36c5913d-57f9-5ad8-bd6b-ac561cbb8c74', 'word_count': 499, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36c5913d-57f9-5ad8-bd6b-ac561cbb8c74'}, {'abstract': 'How much Mark Sanchez improves will be a critical factor to the Jets’ success, but it is almost secondary to how he intends to fix what is clearly a toxic situation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/sports/football/jets-sanchez-has-much-to-do-in-off-season.html', 'snippet': 'How much Mark Sanchez improves will be a critical factor to the Jets’ success, but it is almost secondary to how he intends to fix what is clearly a toxic situation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whenever Mark Sanchez finishes distancing himself from the Jets’ underachieving season, he intends to jot down his emotions so “hopefully we’re not feeling this way next year.” In the meantime, we can only imagine what must be swirling inside his head.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/JETS/JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/JETS/JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/JETS/JETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/JETS/JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/04/sports/JETS/JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sanchez’s Chore: Cleaning Up the Mess', 'kicker': 'Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sanchez’s Chore: Cleaning Up the Mess', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schottenheimer, B