nounced on Wednesday that farmers and ranchers must restrict their use of a critical class of antibiotics in cattle, pigs, chickens and turkeys because such practices may have contributed to the growing threat in people of bacterial infections that are resistant to treatment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/us/FEED/FEED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/us/FEED/FEED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/05/us/FEED/FEED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Citing Drug Resistance, U.S. Restricts More Antibiotics for Livestock', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Citing Drug Resistance, U.S. Restricts More Antibiotics for Livestock', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIBIOTICS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Livestock', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:10:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Money & Policy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gardiner Harris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gardiner', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66cfaa5b-c713-5502-b8ed-e9779222de45', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66cfaa5b-c713-5502-b8ed-e9779222de45'}, {'abstract': 'The Red Stars lost to Notre Dame Tuesday night – -their third consecutive defeat — and are hoping to end their trip with a victory Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/feoktistovs-journal-a-lot-of-miles-and-another-tough-loss/', 'snippet': 'The Red Stars lost to Notre Dame Tuesday night – -their third consecutive defeat — and are hoping to end their trip with a victory Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We heard all about the tradition at Notre Dame and were glad to be playing the Fighting Irish, ranked third in the country. But we lost another close one Tuesday night, 2-1, our third in a row, and it feels like the others — we play hard but we play unlucky.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feoktistov’s Journal: A Lot of Miles, and Another Tough Loss', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Massachusetts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Notre Dame', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:12:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nikita Feoktistov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nikita', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feoktistov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c24416e3-6ecc-5028-8273-7bbc871e3670', 'word_count': 373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c24416e3-6ecc-5028-8273-7bbc871e3670'}, {'abstract': 'If so, how did you manage to buy it while also investing in your business?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/do-you-own-the-building/', 'snippet': 'If so, how did you manage to buy it while also investing in your business?', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ve just published an interview with Barbara Lynch, an extremely successful restaurateur in Boston who has one big regret about her business: She doesn’t own any of the real estate. “My advice would be, try to own the property,” Ms. Lynch told Glenn Rifkin. “I don’t care if it’s a garage but buy it because with me, nine restaurants later, I don’t own any of my buildings. I lease. I make developers pretty successful, but I’d rather own because when you leave, after 25 or 30 years, you don’t own anything except the equipment, which ages like a car or your body.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Do You Own the Building?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lynch, Barbara', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:15:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': "By You're the Boss Editors", 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/724167a6-f91d-550f-8f77-43632bae817b', 'word_count': 137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/724167a6-f91d-550f-8f77-43632bae817b'}, {'abstract': 'News on hair transplants and eye lifts and on keeping your feet warm after a pedicure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/fashion/from-eye-and-hair-surgery-to-toasty-toes-beauty-spots.html', 'snippet': 'News on hair transplants and eye lifts and on keeping your feet warm after a pedicure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EYES WIDE OPEN A California plastic surgeon has combined blepharoplasty (eyelid surgery) and browpexy (brow lift) to create an “All-in-One Eye Lid and Brow” lift that he says is less invasive than many similar procedures. The new lift takes 30 minutes and requires two internal stitches and about five days of recuperation. The procedure costs approximately $4,500 and is available at the practice of Tancredi F. D’Amore, in Corte Madera, Calif. (damoreplasticsurgery.com).', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/fashion/05zSPOTS1/05zSPOTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/fashion/05zSPOTS1/05zSPOTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/05/fashion/05zSPOTS1/05zSPOTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beauty Spots', 'kicker': 'Skin Deep', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Beauty Spots', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nails (Body Part)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty Salons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plastic Surgery', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:17:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'origin