es as “straight” or “gay.”', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/straight-and-gay-talk-from-simon-doonan/', 'snippet': 'Simon Doonan, the author of the new book “Gay Men Don’t Get Fat,” answers readers’  questions about his theory that everyone should eat “bisexual,” mixing foods that he categorizes as “straight” or “gay.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simon Doonan, the creative ambassador at large for Barneys New York and the author of the new book “Gay Men Don’t Get Fat,” responds to reader questions about the dietary theories — serious and otherwise — that he expounds in his book and in an interview with The Times. Chiefly, he says the ideal diet is “bisexual,” mixing foods that he categorizes as straight or gay. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Straight (and Gay) Talk From Simon Doonan', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Doonan, Simon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18caf7a7-2035-5476-8881-706adf4d555a', 'word_count': 748, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18caf7a7-2035-5476-8881-706adf4d555a'}, {'abstract': 'A divided Commodity Futures Trading Commission rebuffed a request from Wall Street to delay new restrictions on speculative commodities trading.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/regulator-refuses-to-delay-trading-rule/', 'snippet': 'A divided Commodity Futures Trading Commission rebuffed a request from Wall Street to delay new restrictions on speculative commodities trading.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:44 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New Y