.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/nyregion/05state_337/05state_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/05/nyregion/05state_337/05state_337-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/nyregion/05state_337/05state_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1010, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Pushes Job Creation in 2012 Agenda', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo Pushes Job Creation In 2012 Plan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the State Message (NYS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:40:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2afad3a7-949b-55a5-9bac-89b2c72a19ba', 'word_count': 1084, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2afad3a7-949b-55a5-9bac-89b2c72a19ba'}, {'abstract': 'Stanford’s defeat in the Fiesta Bowl evoked memories of the school’s indelible loss to Cal in 1982.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/in-stanford-loss-echoes-of-elway/', 'snippet': 'Stanford’s defeat in the Fiesta Bowl evoked memories of the school’s indelible loss to Cal in 1982.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many ways to lose a football game, but you would be hard-pressed to find one as heart-wrenching as the way Stanford lost to Oklahoma State in the Fiesta Bowl on Monday night. The Cardinal did not trail until the final whistle, had six different 7-point leads in the game, had the ball for 70 percent of the clock and outgained the Cowboys by 178 total yards, including a 243-13 advantage on the ground. Yet still Stanford could not come away with the win.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Stanford Loss, Echoes of Elway', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bowl Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fiesta Bowl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elway, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Luck, Andrew', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shaw, David', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oklahoma State University', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T17:41:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacob Jaffe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaffe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c216f9ec-c7ad-5a20-be3a-bfe7e33d2c47', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c216f9ec-c7ad-5a20-be3a-bfe7e33d2c47'}, {'abstract': 'The company announced plans to close the huge military operation and eliminate jobs there by the end of 2013 to cut costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/business/boeing-to-shut-wichita-plant.html', 'snippet': 'The company announced plans to close the huge military operation and eliminate jobs there by the end of 2013 to cut costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the Pentagon pushing to cut costs, Boeing said on Wednesday that it would close its sprawling military airplane plant in Wichita, Kan., over the next two years and lay off many of the 2,160 workers. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/business/Boeing/Boeing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/05/business/Boeing/Boeing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/business/Boeing/Boeing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boeing to Shut Wichita Plant, Citing Cuts at Pentagon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boeing to Shut Wichita Plant, Citing Cuts at Pentagon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense Contracts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wichita (Kan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'r