ave been a steady presence since the 2000s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HUNTSVILLE, Ala. — Jimi Sitko gets up at 4 most mornings, works out two to four hours a day and can bench-press nearly twice his weight. He has a shaved head and a brightly colored tattoo on his left arm, and he can easily be mistaken for a Marine separated from his platoon.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/sports/05vegan_337/05vegan_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/sports/05vegan_337/05vegan_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/05/sports/05vegan_337/05vegan_337-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sculptured by Weights and a Strict Vegan Diet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sculptured By Weights And a Strict Vegan Diet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Body Building', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Foods', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T20:46:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b7c6f90-7e15-5854-b8b7-a3651668c397', 'word_count': 1070, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b7c6f90-7e15-5854-b8b7-a3651668c397'}, {'abstract': 'The “super PAC” Winning Our Future posted a campaign ad from 2008 in which John McCain slammed Mitt Romney.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/pro-gingrich-group-posts-anti-romney-ad-featuring-mccain/', 'snippet': 'The “super PAC” Winning Our Future posted a campaign ad from 2008 in which John McCain slammed Mitt Romney.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER N.H. — On the day Mitt Romney rolled out the endorsement of Senator John McCain of Arizona, a “super PAC” backing Newt Gingrich dug out an old gem and put in on the Web.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pro-Gingrich Group Posts Anti-Romney Ad, Featuring McCain', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T20:53:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/109db310-5b45-54c7-8976-a47bb0a5a367', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/109db310-5b45-54c7-8976-a47bb0a5a367'}, {'abstract': 'A new movie about the overheated world of Iowa politics and butter sculpting will have to trade more on Hugh Jackman’s smile and Olivia Wilde’s good looks than on Jennifer Garner’s parody of seemingly Michelle Bachmann-like character now that the real-life politician has bowed out of the presidential race.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/butter-loses-its-republican-primary-connection/', 'snippet': 'A new movie about the overheated world of Iowa politics and butter sculpting will have to trade more on Hugh Jackman’s smile and Olivia Wilde’s good looks than on Jennifer Garner’s parody of seemingly Michelle Bachmann-like character now that the ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES— So Michele Bachmann is out of the presidential race. And that means a movie with partisan potential, “Butter,” set for release by the Weinstein Company on March 16, will have to trade more on Hugh Jackman’s smile and Olivia Wilde’s good looks than on Jennifer Garner’s parody of a seemingly Bachmann-like character who is caught up in the overheated world of Iowa politics and butter sculpting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Butter’ Loses its Republican Primary Connection', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Jennifer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilde, Olivia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Weinstein Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T20:53:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cieply', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cieply', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8cb1d97c-e02e-54d6-b544-c46bc7dc40a7', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8cb1d97c-e02e-54d6-b544-c46bc7dc40a7'}, {'abstract': 'The president of the American Petroleum Institute said the United States would achieve diesel and gasoline independence if the government stopped interfering with industry goals.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/and-now-the-oil-industry-caucus/', 'snippet': 'The president of the American Petroleum Institute said the United States would achieve diesel and gasoline independence if the government stopped interfering with industry goals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'North America could be self-sufficient in gasoline and diesel fuel in 15 years if only the government would get out of the way, the president of the American Petroleum Institute said on Wednesday in a “state of American energy” address intended to raise the industry’s profile in the presidential election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'And Now, the Oil Industry Caucus', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drilling and Boring', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hydraulic Fracturing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Keystone Pipeline System', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 11, 'm