d2a-6c24-5a37-a868-2a6277f46a29'}, {'abstract': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission filed an enforcement action against Anthony Fields of Lyons, Ill., accusing him of making fraudulent investment offers through social media sites.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/04/s-e-c-accuses-adviser-of-using-linkedin-to-promote-bogus-investments/', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission filed an enforcement action against Anthony Fields of Lyons, Ill., accusing him of making fraudulent investment offers through social media sites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LinkedIn is best known as a social networking hub, where people can locate and research just about anyone. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Adviser Accused of Using LinkedIn to Promote Bogus Deals', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LinkedIn Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-04T23:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7716bd3f-18c8-5968-a435-6154457a504b', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7716bd3f-18c8-5968-a435-6154457a504b'}, {'abstract': 'Rooney Mara, Meryl Streep and other actresses in this year’s crop of Oscar hopefuls sometimes went to extraordinary lengths to get, and stay, in character.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/movies/awardsseason/rooney-mara-and-meryl-streep-on-preparing-for-their-roles.html', 'snippet': 'Rooney Mara, Meryl Streep and other actresses in this year’s crop of Oscar hopefuls sometimes went to extraordinary lengths to get, and stay, in character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Lisbeth Salander in David Fincher’s adaptation of “The Girl With the Dragon Tattoo,” Rooney Mara rarely gives anyone a straight look. Instead her gaze is downcast, sideways — anywhere but into the face of her interlocutors, whether they are friendly or decidedly not.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/arts/BAGGER-JP-3/BAGGER-JP-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/05/arts/BAGGER-JP-3/BAGGER-JP-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/arts/BAGGER-JP-3/BAGGER-JP-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/arts/BAGGER-JP-3/BAGGER-JP-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/05/arts/BAGGER-JP-3/BAGGER-JP-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When an Actress Prepares (No Eye Contact, Please)', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When an Actress Prepares (No Eye Contact, Please)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None},