1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olbermann, Keith', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T02:44:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebf7843b-b096-5fa7-8a66-e9d7b9ff9578', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebf7843b-b096-5fa7-8a66-e9d7b9ff9578'}, {'abstract': 'So many apps came out for the iPad last year that it was easy to miss the good ones. Here are 10 favorites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/technology/personaltech/amid-an-avalanche-of-ipad-apps-the-best-of-2011-app-smart.html', 'snippet': 'So many apps came out for the iPad last year that it was easy to miss the good ones. Here are 10 favorites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like owners of iPhones and Androids, users of iPads faced a surge of new apps last year, to the point where it was easy to miss great ones. Here’s my list of 10 favorites from 2011, along with a few runners-up. Note: as with 2010’s Top 10, seasonal sensations like MLB.com’s At Bat aren’t included, nor are games, which I’ll cover separately online.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/business/SMART1/SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/business/SMART1/SMART1-