n’t have to worry about the Jets in the playoffs this season, but imagine the possibilities if a green-clad Peyton Manning could match up with Brady next season.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/tom-brady-isnt-broken-up-over-jets-fall/', 'snippet': 'The Patriots don’t have to worry about the Jets in the playoffs this season, but imagine the possibilities if a green-clad Peyton Manning could match up with Brady next season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Brady, who once said that he hated the Jets, is having happier thoughts about them these days.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tom Brady Isn’t Broken Up Over Jets’ Fall', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brady, Tom', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T11:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f748a23-f484-59df-90a5-4866052b8f28', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f748a23-f484-59df-90a5-4866052b8f28'}, {'abstract': 'The peer-to-peer service, now in a test phase, emphasizes the security measures taken before an owner can list, or a renter can borrow, a car, recreational vehicle, all terrain vehicle, boat or motorcycle.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/justshareit-enters-suddenly-crowded-and-wary-car-sharing-market/', 'snippet': 'The peer-to-peer service, now in a test phase, emphasizes the security measures taken before an owner can list, or a renter can borrow, a car, recreational vehicle, all terrain vehicle, boat or motorcycle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peer-to-peer car-sharing services, which allow owners to rent their vehicles directly to other drivers, scored some notable successes in 2011, as well as some embarrassing failures. A new service is counting on a robust security apparatus and the variety of vehicles, not just cars, that it offers to distinguish it in this crowded start-up segment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'JustShareIt Enters Suddenly Crowded, and Wary, Car-Sharing Market', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carfax', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LoJack Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OnStar Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RelayRides', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T11:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Witkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Witkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cc8b96e-c9f9-5406-92b2-75b543b9c7af', 'word_count': 656, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cc8b96e-c9f9-5406-92b2-75b543b9c7af'}, {'abstract': 'Once winter arrives in full force, Turks start to take refuge in seasonal drinks like sweet sahlep, or hearty boza,  to help them fortify against the elements. A tasting tour of various restaurants and cafes provides a warm way to explore Istanbul and its culinary traditions.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/seasonal-drinks-to-warm-up-winter-in-istanbul/', 'snippet': 'Once winter arrives in full force, Turks start to take refuge in seasonal drinks like sweet sahlep, or hearty boza,  to help them fortify against the elements. A tasting tour of various restaurants and cafes provides a warm way to explore Istanbul...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once winter arrives in full force, with wind whipping down the Bosporus from the Black Sea, and the snow flurries gathering atop minarets, Turks start to take refuge in seasonal drinks like sweet sahlep, or hearty boza,\xa0 to help them fortify against the elements.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seasonal Drinks to Warm Up Winter in Istanbul', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T11:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Fowler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fowler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8177a179-77e0-5c2f-974c-cce17fb176eb', 'word_count': 385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8177a179-77e0-5c2f-974c-cce17fb176eb'}, {'abstract': 'You can decide how to use the extra monitor when you connect it to your Windows 7 laptop.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/qa-expanding-your-screen-real-estate/', 'snippet': 'You can decide how to use the extra monitor when you connect it to your Windows 7 laptop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [