fail to recognize the symptoms.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/fussy-baby-or-a-sleep-disorder/', 'snippet': 'A new study shows sleep problems are surprisingly common among infants and toddlers, but parents and pediatricians often fail to recognize the symptoms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One in 10 infants and toddlers have problems sleeping at night and may be at greater risk of developing a sleep disorder as they get older, a new study suggests.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fussy Baby or a Sleep Disorder?', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T16:14:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/647678a8-ae9e-5790-950d-7bbb28979476', 'word_count': 773, 'uri': 'nyt://article/647678a8-ae9e-5790-950d-7bbb28979476'}, {'abstract': 'Amid signs of improvement in the overall jobs climate, manufacturing stands out as an area of strength in the American economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/business/us-manufacturing-is-a-bright-spot-for-the-economy.html', 'snippet': 'Amid signs of improvement in the overall jobs climate, manufacturing stands out as an area of strength in the American economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the first time in many years, manufacturing stands out as an area of strength in the American economy.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2010/04/19/business/norris-75-standardinline/norris-75-standard