/73a3facd-d01a-59b8-a6e5-a5170a36ebc4'}, {'abstract': 'The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration said changes made by General Motors “should address the issue” of fire risks in the Chevrolet Volt, but that its investigation remained open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/business/gm-to-reinforce-battery-in-hybrid-car.html', 'snippet': 'The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration said changes made by General Motors “should address the issue” of fire risks in the Chevrolet Volt, but that its investigation remained open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — General Motors on Thursday said that it would upgrade the steel structure and liquid cooling system that surround the battery in its Chevrolet Volt to address concerns that the car could catch fire after a severe crash.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/business/06volt-pic/06volt-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/06/business/06volt-pic/06volt-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/business/06volt-pic/06volt-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/business/06volt-pic/06volt-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/06/business/06volt-pic/06volt-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'G.M. to Reinforce Battery in Its Hybrid Car, the Volt', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicke