son’s exhibition “Rumble,” an ode of sorts to Don King, comes to Hauser & Wirth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/arts/design/rashid-johnsons-show-rumble-a-nod-to-don-king.html', 'snippet': 'Rashid Johnson’s exhibition “Rumble,” an ode of sorts to Don King, comes to Hauser & Wirth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RASHID JOHNSON was discussing his coming exhibition at the Hauser & Wirth gallery recently, when Marc Payot, a gallery partner, mentioned that a previous owner of the gallery’s sleek town house on East 69th Street in Manhattan was the boxing promoter Don King.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/arts/08JOHNSON1_SPAN/08JOHNSON1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/arts/08JOHNSON1_SPAN/08JOHNSON1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/arts/08JOHNSON1_SPAN/08JOHNSON1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/arts/08JOHNSON1_SPAN/08JOHNSON1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/arts/08JOHNSON1_SPAN/08JOHNSON1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fusing Identity: Dollops of Humor and Shea Butter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fusing Identity: Dollops of Humor And Shea Butter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boxing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'n