ason premiere in September, with 14 million total viewers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ABC, With No Reruns, Proves a Magnet for Viewers', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mandel, Howie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T21:15:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d3e61ba-49b7-5907-b344-495b457b8457', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d3e61ba-49b7-5907-b344-495b457b8457'}, {'abstract': 'With no splashy offseason additions to the team, the Mets are counting on improvements from its existing players, particularly recuperating pitcher Johan Santana.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/alderson-says-mets-must-improve-from-within/', 'snippet': 'With no splashy offseason additions to the team, the Mets are counting on improvements from its existing players, particularly recuperating pitcher Johan Santana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several weeks after reaching contract agreements with relievers Frank Francisco and Jon Rauch, the Mets introduced the pitchers on a conference call with reporters Thursday. Unlike many off-seasons, there has been no need for a news conference at the ballpark to show off a splashy new addition.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Alderson Says Mets Must Improve From Within', 'kic