porting companies plan to follow suit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you’re planning to buy a home for the first time later this year, your chances of qualifying for a mortgage might be better if you’ve had a history of paying the rent on time.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/realestate/08mort-graphic/08mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/realestate/08mort-graphic/08mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/realestate/08mort-graphic/08mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/realestate/08mort-graphic/08mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Good Rental History Can Help Borrowers', 'kicker': 'Mortgages', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking at Rental History', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Scores', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Experian Group Ltd', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T22:19:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vickie Elmer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vickie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elmer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bceb26a2-c8b0-5df0-b046-32894313a069', 'word_count': 612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bceb26a2-c8b0-5df0-b046-32894313a069'}, {'abstract': '“Alexis. A Greek Tragedy,” a production of the Italian troupe Motus at the Under the Radar festival, is an invigorating portrait of youthful rebellion in contemporary Greece.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/theater/reviews/alexis-a-greek-tragedy-in-under-the-radar-review.html', 'snippet': '“Alexis. A Greek Tragedy,” a production of the Italian troupe Motus at the Under the Radar festival, is an invigorating portrait of youthful rebellion in contemporary Greece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The dialogues keep multiplying and echoing, contracting and expanding, blurring and zooming into focus. In the raw and resonant “Alexis. A Greek Tragedy,” one of the opening works in the Under the Radar festival of experimental theater, conversation is hardly limited to the words exchanged by the actors on the stage of the Ellen Stewart Theater at La MaMa.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/ALEXIS/ALEXIS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/ALEXIS/ALEXIS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/ALEXIS/ALEXIS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/ALEXIS/ALEXIS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/ALEXIS/ALEXIS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Back to the Barricades, Antigone', 'kicker': "Theater Review | 'Alexis. A Greek Tragedy'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Back to the Barricades, Antigone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Motus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grigoropoulos, Alexandros', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Under the Radar Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T22:20:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/64e2b0c6-df66-5d68-95c8-758c6145b6dc', 'word_count': 917, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64e2b0c6-df66-5d68-95c8-758c6145b6dc'}, {'abstract': '“Norwegian Wood,” a film adaptation of Haruki Murakami’s novel about the obsessional aspects of youthful passion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/movies/norwegian-wood-from-haruki-murakami-novel-review.html', 'snippet': '“Norwegian Wood,” a film adaptation of Haruki Murakami’s novel about the obsessional aspects of youthful passion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The dreamy, protracted love scenes in “Norwegian Wood” recall that now quaint era near the peak of the sexual revolution when intense young love fired the collective imagination with envy, prurience and awe. Yes, there were casual hookups then, but they were not called that in the late 1960s, when the story takes place. Romanti