ma” at MoMa offers a selection of films by this great Indian actor and director.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/movies/moma-presents-a-raj-kapoor-film-festival.html', 'snippet': '“Raj Kapoor and the Golden Age of Indian Cinema” at MoMa offers a selection of films by this great Indian actor and director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s one of the most famous sequences in Indian movies. And, not surprisingly, it’s a song. A Chaplinesque tramp with holes in his shoes, too-short pants and a slightly goofy hat skips down a country road and sings these lines in Hindi: “My shoes are Japanese/These pants are English/On my head is a red Russian hat/But still,” he says, pointing to his chest and delivering the kicker, “my heart is Hindustani.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/06KAPOOR/06KAPOOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/06KAPOOR/06KAPOOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/06KAPOOR/06KAPOOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 789, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/06KAPOOR/06KAPOOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/06KAPOOR/06KAPOOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Singing Hindi in the Rain', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Singing Hindi In the Rain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywo