.nytimes.com/2012/01/05/gingrich-goes-very-local-on-new-hampshire-issues/', 'snippet': 'Newt Gingrich suggests conservatives need to unite behind a single alternative to Mitt Romney. Namely, him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Newt Gingrich is running for president of the United States, but as he blazed a trail over the White Mountains, he showed that he had not forgotten that all politics is local. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Goes Local on New Hampshire Issues', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Administration', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'White Mountains (NH)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T23:04:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bfad587-d424-519d-bddf-e8005693aece', 'word_count': 453, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bfad587-d424-519d-bddf-e8005693aece'}, {'abstract': 'In an age when it’s possible to outsource the entire wedding, some couples are forging bonds while forging their own gold to create D.I.Y. wedding bands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/style/with-this-torch-i-thee-weld-a-ring.html', 'snippet': 'In an age when it’s possible to outsource the entire wedding, some couples are forging bonds while forging their own gold to create D.I.Y. wedding bands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOST couples want their wedding to be awe inspiring. And therein lies the foundation of an enormous industry that, for a price, can guarantee bragging rights for the betrothed, whether it’s beachside fireworks, a chocolate-candy-bar multitiered cake flown in from Napa or flower-covered candelabra.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/weddings/JP08FIELDNOTES3/JP08FIELDNOTES3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/weddings/JP08FIELDNOTES3/JP08FIELDNOTES3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/weddings/JP08FIELDNOTES3/JP08FIELDNOTES3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/weddings/JP08FIELDNOTES3/JP08FIELDNOTES3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/weddings/JP08FIELDNOTES3/JP08FIELDNOTES3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With This Torch, I Thee Weld', 'kicker': 'Field Notes', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With This Torch, I Thee Weld', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gold', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-05T23:06:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Saint Louis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': 'Saint', 'lastname': 'Louis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7183eaf1-d5b4-5eb2-a0d6-07cc7dc126ee', 'word_count': 1068, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7183eaf1-d5b4-5eb2-a0d6-07cc7dc126ee'}, {'abstract': 'Elizabeth and the Catapult, led by Elizabeth Ziman, performed “post-label” songs in a set on Wednesday night at the Mercury Lounge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/arts/music/elizabeth-and-the-catapult-at-the-mercury-lounge-review.html', 'snippet': 'Elizabeth and the Catapult, led by Elizabeth Ziman, performed “post-label” songs in a set on Wednesday night at the Mercury Lounge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elizabeth and the Catapult, a New York City band led by the piano-playing songwriter Elizabeth Ziman, got around to new songs about halfway through a set at the Mercury Lounge on Wednesday night. First came a cheerful ditty about a lazy New Year’s Day that “feels like a new beginning,” with poppy la-las punctuating each verse. Then Ms. Ziman announced: “O.K., let’s get serious. My label just dropped me.” She half-smiled. “So I wrote a song for them.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/arts/