': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCarthy, Melissa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Errol', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudd, Paul', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wiig, Kristen', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Screen Actors Guild', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-06T14:05:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8791265f-ae2c-5aac-b72c-8df63a0d6147', 'word_count': 441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8791265f-ae2c-5aac-b72c-8df63a0d6147'}, {'abstract': 'How do you teach this important topic, and why? Post a comment on this post, and later this month we’ll publish a roundup of your ideas and thoughts.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/how-do-you-teach-the-civil-rights-movement/', 'snippet': 'How do you teach this important topic, and why? Post a comment on this post, and later this month we’ll publish a roundup of your ideas and thoughts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | Jan. 27, 2012 Thank you to the many who wrote in. We have now sorted and compiled your answers in our post Reader Ideas | Teaching the Civil Rights Movement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Do You Teach the Civil Rights Movement?', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-06T14:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/76e1322d-a2da-5023-b352-f2ff71ca9631', 'word_count': 135, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76e1322d-a2da-5023-b352-f2ff71ca9631'}, {'abstract': 'Defending Australian Open champion Kim Clijsters suffered a hip flexor injury at the Brisbane International tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/clijsters-may-be-out-of-australian-open-after-injury-in-brisbane/', 'snippet': 'Defending Australian Open champion Kim Clijsters suffered a hip flexor injury at the Brisbane International tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Defending Australian Open champion Kim Clijsters took a significant hit in her bid to defend her title at Melbourne Park later this month after she was forced to retire from her semifinal match at the Brisbane International after suffering a left hip flexor injury.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clijsters May Be Out of Australian Open After Injury in Brisbane', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Australian Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clijsters, Kim', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lynch, Brian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-06T14:22:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffef30c3-88e3-5c53-bfc4-1435a9e3546a', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffef30c3-88e3-5c53-bfc4-1435a9e3546a'}, {'abstract': 'Penn State found its coach in New England offensive coordinator Bill O’Brien, while the rest of college football prepares for a title game and college basketball features a rare power play basket.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/06/leading-off-penn-state-gets-a-coach-the-badgers-get-another-year-from-montee-ball/', 'snippet': 'Penn State found its coach in New England offensive coordinator Bill O’Brien, while the rest of college football prepares for a title game and college basketball features a rare power play basket.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It will be a slightly less dismal day in Still Trying to Be Happy Valley on Saturday when Penn State gets to announce that someone wanted to be its new football coach. The introduction of Patriots offensive coordinator Bill O’Brien will come with all the usual pronouncements of a bright future and a new start, but the overarching emotion will be relief. The sighs come because Penn State’s tortured search found someone willing to don protective gear and enter college football’s version of a SuperFund site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: Penn State Gets a Coach; the Badgers Get Another Year from Montee Ball', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ball, Montee', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'per