l-clintons-vision.html', 'snippet': 'A reader responds to a recent review of Bill Clinton’s “Back to Work.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Clinton’s Vision', 'kicker': 'Letter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bill Clinton’s Vision', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-06T17:11:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/d22cd328-ecfc-5478-8855-d3abdcc9c358', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d22cd328-ecfc-5478-8855-d3abdcc9c358'}, {'abstract': 'In a brief trip to South Carolina, Mitt Romney accused President Obama of failing the American people on the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/us/politics/romney-criticizes-obama-his-rivals-line-up-to-criticize-him.html', 'snippet': 'In a brief trip to South Carolina, Mitt Romney accused President Obama of failing the American people on the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CONWAY, S.C. — Mitt Romney on Friday slammed President Obama for failing the American people and accused him of dragging “the soul of America” toward a “European-style welfare state.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/06/us/politics/06romney/06romney-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/06/us/politics/06romney/06romney-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im