ar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A CENTURY ago, when electric cars were popular — especially in cities and among women drivers — they looked discernibly different from gasoline-powered automobiles. In the age of the horseless carriage, the transportation historian James Flink wrote, electric cars looked even more like carriages.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/automobiles/08DESI1/08DESI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 278, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/automobiles/08DESI1/08DESI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 278}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/automobiles/08DESI1/08DESI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/automobiles/08DESI1/08DESI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/automobiles/08DESI1/08DESI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Electric. Should It Look Electrifying?', 'kicker': 'Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Electric. Should It Look Electrifying?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tesla Motors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audi Division of Volkswag