abor Board Backs Workers on Joint Arbitration Cases', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Labor Board Supports Class Action For Workers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARBITRATION, CONCILIATION AND MEDIATION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DR Horton Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Becker, Craig', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pearce, Mark Gaston', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Labor Relations Board', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-06T23:48:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Greenhouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Greenhouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d51d156e-e354-5b30-8a14-7bd660e84934', 'word_count': 915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d51d156e-e354-5b30-8a14-7bd660e84934'}, {'abstract': 'In Gob Squad’s “Super Night Shot,” part of the Under the Radar Festival at the Public Theater, passers-by are enlisted to appear in an instant film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/theater/reviews/gob-squads-super-night-shot-at-under-the-radar-review.html', 'snippet': 'In Gob Squad’s “Super Night Shot,” part of the Under the Radar Festival at the Public Theater, passers-by are enlisted to appear in an instant film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Disposable fame is sweet in “Super Night Shot,” the collective title for the instant films being shown at the Public Theater as part of the Under the Radar Festival. The mission of this project from the Br