d when he might be able to return to work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/sports/football/burns-are-not-life-threatening-for-steelers-coach-wilson.html', 'snippet': 'It is unclear how long Kirby Wilson, who has been the Steelers’ running backs coach for five seasons, will remain in the hospital and when he might be able to return to work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pittsburgh Steelers’ running backs sensed something was wrong when they arrived at work on Friday for an early-morning film session in preparation for their Sunday playoff game against the Denver Broncos and their coach, Kirby Wilson, was not there. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Steelers Assistant Sustains Burns in a House Fire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Steelers Assistant Is Burned In a Fire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Burns', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T00:33:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/448bd705-c8c2-54d0-a52c-cfff832ae5fb', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/448bd705-c8c2-54d0-a52c-cfff832ae5fb'}, {'abstract': '2013 Scion FR-S slide show', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/09/automobiles/autoshow/detroit-scion-frs-slides.html', 'snippet': '2013 Scion FR-S slide show', '