 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/3c3d6e13-019c-500c-9a3a-494a543a757c'}, {'abstract': 'The December employment report was an upbeat finish to 2011. But without government support, even modest job gains cannot be sustained.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/opinion/waiting-for-recovery.html', 'snippet': 'The December employment report was an upbeat finish to 2011. But without government support, even modest job gains cannot be sustained.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In its broad strokes, the December employment report is an upbeat finish to a difficult year. Job growth accelerated, the workweek expanded modestly, wages ticked up and the unemployment rate declined. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Waiting for Recovery', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waiting for Recovery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Payroll Tax', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment Insurance', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T02:21:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/daf05bc6-2a26-5167-ba55-14c90f8cb66d', 'word_count': 514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/daf05bc6-2a26-5167-ba55-14c90f8cb66d'}, {'abstract': 'Archbishop Edwin F. O’Brien once served at a parish in the northeast Bronx and now works as the pope’s representative to Catholics in the Holy Land.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/nyregion/ex-baltimore-archbishop-edwin-f-obrien-elevated-to-cardinal.html', 'snippet': 'Archbishop Edwin F. O’Brien once served at a parish in the northeast Bronx and now works as the pope’s representative to Catholics in the Holy Land.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The other American elevated to cardinal by the Vatican on Friday is a Bronx boy who exercises regularly on a treadmill, roots ardently for the Yankees and, according to friends, is so devoted to the idea of doing what he asks others to do that he learned how to parachute before serving as a military chaplain in Vietnam.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/nyregion/OBRIEN/OBRIEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 779, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/nyregion/OBRIEN/OBRIEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/07/nyregion/OBRIEN/OBRIEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Step Up for a Bronx Native Who Led the Archdiocese in Baltimore', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Another Step Up for a Bronx Native Who Led the Archdiocese in Baltimore', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cardinals (Roman Catholic Prelates)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Edwin F", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baltimore (Md)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T02:24:04+0000', 'do