-960d16022289'}, {'abstract': 'The players said they could not envision losing control in the huddle, unlike the Jets, because of the respect earned by the Giants’ captains; Eli Manning, Justin Tuck and Zak DeOssie.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/sports/football/manning-and-tuck-giants-captains-earn-respect.html', 'snippet': 'The players said they could not envision losing control in the huddle, unlike the Jets, because of the respect earned by the Giants’ captains; Eli Manning, Justin Tuck and Zak DeOssie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Not many Giants watched the boiling point moment in the Jets’ season-ending defeat last weekend, when an in-the-huddle fracas banished wide receiver Santonio Holmes to the sideline and a solitary seat on the bench. But the Giants knew what had happened or had seen televised video of it.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/sports/giants/giants-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/sports/giants/giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/07/sports/giants/giants-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Say Captains Earn Respect', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants Say Captains Earn Respect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons'