eader-set-to-visit-allies-in-latin-america.html', 'snippet': 'President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad will be visiting four nations — all critics of the United States. But the tour is unlikely to ease the strain of international sanctions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When President Mahmoud Ahmadinejad of Iran begins a four-nation tour of Latin America on Sunday, showcasing his support in the region against a backdrop of international tensions over his nation’s nuclear program, he is set to visit some of the United States’ most ardent critics: Venezuela, Nicaragua, Cuba and Ecuador.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/world/ahmadinejad/ahmadinejad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 744, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/world/ahmadinejad/ahmadinejad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/07/world/ahmadinejad/ahmadinejad-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Increasingly Isolated, Iranian Leader Set to Visit Allies in Latin America', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iranian Leader, Increasingly Isolated, to Visit Latin America', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AHMADINEJAD, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Latin America', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Gover