founded the New York Chamber Symphony.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/arts/music/omus-hirshbein-classical-music-administrator-dies-at-77.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hirshbein directed concert series at Hunter College and the 92nd Street Y, and founded the New York Chamber Symphony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Omus Hirshbein, a colorful, headstrong arts administrator who directed important concert series at Hunter College and the 92nd Street Y, founded the New York Chamber Symphony and held posts at the National Endowment for the Arts, died on Dec. 31 in Manhattan. He was 77.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/arts/HIRSHBEIN-obit/HIRSHBEIN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 361, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/07/arts/HIRSHBEIN-obit/HIRSHBEIN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 361}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/arts/HIRSHBEIN-obit/HIRSHBEIN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/07/arts/HIRSHBEIN-obit/HIRSHBEIN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/07/arts/HIRSHBEIN-obit/HIRSHBEIN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Omus Hirshbein, Classical Music Impresario, Dies at 77', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Omus Hirshbein, Classical Music Impresario, Dies at 77', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Chamber Symph