unic, which made her look as if she’d fallen into a bowl of Dippin’ Dots, that she wore to Carolina Herrera’s spring 2012 show in September. But few in 2011 could take their eyes off Ms. Minaj, the Technicolor Barbie with the big voice and an elastic smile.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/08MINAJ_SPAN/08MINAJ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/08MINAJ_SPAN/08MINAJ_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/08MINAJ_SPAN/08MINAJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/08MINAJ_SPAN/08MINAJ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/fashion/08MINAJ_SPAN/08MINAJ_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Nicki’s World', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Nicki’s World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Minaj, Nicki', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T08:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura M. Holson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72c873af-c99b-5d69-b6c1-f9662b57a228', 'word_count': 1580, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72c873af-c99b-5d69-b6c1-f9662b57a228'}, {'abstract': 'Top stories in the regional press.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/newswallah-bharat-edition-18/', 'snippet': 'Top stories in the regional press.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jammu and Kashmir: Businesses including independent shops and banks in\xa0 Kashmir Valley shut down Jan. 6 to protest power outages and the killing of a student during a protest. The strike was called by the Kashmir Economic Alliance, the area’s business trade group (Greater Kashmir).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Bharat Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T10:22:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d407d208-2434-540f-8533-4baa48b8875f', 'word_count': 535, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d407d208-2434-540f-8533-4baa48b8875f'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times, the president’s weekly address and a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_ur