 us abreast of advances in our fields.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/05/technology/05bits-drucker/05bits-drucker-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Prophet for a New Workplace', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Schools', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T11:57:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf13b576-e7a3-50e6-8c79-ba92d20a28f2', 'word_count': 920, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf13b576-e7a3-50e6-8c79-ba92d20a28f2'}, {'abstract': 'Why was so much chatter devoted to Rex Ryan and the Jets in a week when the Giants were preparing for the playoffs? The circus was in town.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/the-onion-spoofs-ryan-and-sanchez/', 'snippet': 'Why was so much chatter devoted to Rex Ryan and the Jets in a week when the Giants were preparing for the playoffs? The circus was in town.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why was so much chatter devoted to Rex Ryan and the Jets in these parts during a week when the Giants were preparing for the playoffs? Josh Levin put it well at Slate:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Onion Spoofs Ryan and Sanchez', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_ki