ves on the front lines against energy drinks when they wrote “Drink Water” on the decks of their snowboards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bryan Fox and Austin Smith have watched the number of snowboarders — and companies that profit from them — balloon in the last decade. Realms where a snowboarder can carve clean, remote lines are shrinking. But Fox and Smith, close friends and professional snowboarders, recently found themselves alone on the front lines against energy drinks. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-drinkwater-3/dog-drinkwater-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-drinkwater-3/dog-drinkwater-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-drinkwater-3/dog-drinkwater-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-drinkwater-3/dog-drinkwater-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-drinkwater-3/dog-drinkwater-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wary of Energy Drinks in an Adrenaline Sport', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wary of Energy Drinks in Adrenaline Sport', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snowboarding', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Bull', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T14:36:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff DiNunzio', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'DiNunzio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b3702ef-96e5-5335-9a91-4727df73288a', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b3702ef-96e5-5335-9a91-4727df73288a'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Hockey League, which added three teams for its second season, is attempting to succeed in the Northeast where several minor leagues have failed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/sports/hockey/far-from-nhl-federal-hockey-league-soldiers-on.html', 'snippet': 'The Federal Hockey League, which added three teams for its second season, is attempting to succeed in the Northeast where several minor leagues have failed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In recent years, the Northeast has been fertile ground for hockey dreamers, with new, independent minor leagues striving to take root. Yet time and again, reality has stamped out hope. The five-team Mid-Atlantic Hockey League did not complete its inaugural season in 2007-8. The four-team Eastern Professional Hockey League lasted one year in 2008-9. The next year, the North East Professional Hockey League started with four teams, was down to three at the season’s start and lasted only 15 games. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/dog-fhl-2/dog-fhl-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subT