1-16d3-5acc-b87f-e0198db074ad'}, {'abstract': 'Field goal attempts have been decisive in several key college games in recent seasons and the national title game on Monday could come down to a fateful, final kick.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/sports/ncaafootball/lsu-alabama-outcome-could-again-depend-on-kickers.html', 'snippet': 'Field goal attempts have been decisive in several key college games in recent seasons and the national title game on Monday could come down to a fateful, final kick.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW ORLEANS — Considering that Louisiana State and Alabama failed to score a touchdown in their first meeting, the possibility that the national title game on Monday will come down to a fateful, final kick looms large. During L.S.U.’s 9-6 overtime victory Nov. 5 in Tuscaloosa, host Alabama missed four kicks and L.S.U. ended the game on a 25-yard field goal by Drew Alleman. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/kickers/kickers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/kickers/kickers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/08/sports/kickers/kickers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Heartbreak of the Missed Field-Goal Try', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Heartbreak of the Missed Field-Goal Try', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bowl Championship Series', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {