ring and Promotion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monster Worldwide Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LinkedIn Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T20:40:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randall Stross', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randall', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stross', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e37d1db-08d1-57e5-b742-e81e76e62d36', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e37d1db-08d1-57e5-b742-e81e76e62d36'}, {'abstract': 'To end its gridlock, Washington should recall the argument of a Nobel laureate in economics: that the key to successful negotiation is the ability to commit to future action.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/business/the-art-of-bargaining-lost-upon-washington-economic-view.html', 'snippet': 'To end its gridlock, Washington should recall the argument of a Nobel laureate in economics: that the key to successful negotiation is the ability to commit to future action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALMOST everyone agrees about one thing these days: Congress is malfunctioning. To help our representatives escape from their current morass, I suggest that they read “An Essay on Bargaining,” the classic 1956 article by Thomas Schelling, the Nobel laureate economist. It is profound, and it doesn’t contain a single equation.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Art of Bargaining, So Lost Upon Washington', 'kicker': 'Economic View', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Art of Bargaining, So Lost Upon Washington', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Filibusters and Debate Curbs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T20:43:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard H. Thaler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'Thaler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50be1464-9cf4-5617-98bb-69c44b6da157', 'word_count': 1217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50be1464-9cf4-5617-98bb-69c44b6da157'}, {'abstract': 'Danny Dries, a senior forward on the Ohio State men’s hockey team, provides a season recap ahead of the Buckeyes’ outdoor game against Michigan on Jan. 15.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/ohio-state-diary-bringing-humor-into-outdoor-game/', 'snippet': 'Danny Dries, a senior forward on the Ohio State men’s hockey team, provides a season recap ahead of the Buckeyes’ outdoor game against Michigan on Jan. 15.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As some of you may know, Ohio State has a coming weekend series against the University of Michigan that will be capped off on Jan. 15 with an outdoor game at Progressive Field, the home of the Cleveland Indians, called the Frozen Diamond Faceoff. I’m here to provide you with a season recap so far for our team.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ohio State Diary: Bringing Humor Into Outdoor Game', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Indians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ohio State University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Progressive Field (Cleveland,', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Michigan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-07T20:46:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danny Dries', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dries', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4502534b-2031-58b6-b184-12c9318fb5d5', 'word_count': 609, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4502534b-2031-58b6-b184-12c9318fb5d5'}, {'abstract': 'Ray Fair has studied the economy’s effect on American elections for decades. His projections show the president with a slight lead, but that might change.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/08/your-money/an-election-too-close-to-call-as-seen-in-an-economic-lens.html', 'snippet': 'Ray Fair has studied the economy’s effect on American elections for decades. His projections show the president with a slight lead, but that might change.', 'lead_paragraph': '“IT’S the economy, stupid” may not be either party’s official slogan in this year’s presidential campaign. But it might as well be. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/08/business/08-VIEW/08-