for the first of two back-to-back debates that could serve as a televised confrontation of Mitt Romney, who has a large lead in the polls here.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/new-hampshire-debate-live-blog/', 'snippet': 'The Republican candidates for president have gathered at St. Anselm’s College for the first of two back-to-back debates that could serve as a televised confrontation of Mitt Romney, who has a large lead in the polls here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GOFFSTOWN, N.H. — The Republican candidates for president have gathered at Saint Anselm’s College for the first of two back-to-back debates that could serve as a televised confrontation of Mitt Romney, who has a large lead in the polls here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Hampshire Debate Live Blog', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-08T02:56:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0fb299d-f898-5065-ba90-0b44bbe794d4', 'word_count': 4950, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0fb299d-f898-5065-ba90-0b44bbe794d4'}, {'abstract': 'Jon M. Huntsman Jr. insists on pulling troops out of the wars abroad, while the others say that’s a bad idea.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/07/republicans-offer-contrast-on-foreign-policy-at-debate/', 'snippet': 'Jon M. Huntsman Jr. insists on pulling troops out of the wars abroad, while the others say that’s a bad idea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the big differences among the Republican candidates for president has long been foreign policy, and it showed again tonight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Republicans Offer Contrast