8d31-de865772be69', 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cf85c0f-873b-51b3-8d31-de865772be69'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Hanks has engaged Yahoo to be the first digital distributor for “Electric City,” an animated science-fiction series that he created and that he is producing and starring in.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/09/arts/television/yahoo-to-distribute-tom-hanks-series.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Hanks has engaged Yahoo to be the first digital distributor for “Electric City,” an animated science-fiction series that he created and that he is producing and starring in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Hanks has engaged Yahoo to be the first digital distributor for “Electric City,” an animated science-fiction series that he created and that he is producing and starring in. Yahoo, which is trying to become recognized for TV-quality Web shows, is to announce the distribution deal on Monday. “Electric City” is the first original scripted program to be distributed by the Web site. The 90-minute series presents Mr. Hanks’s vision of a future metropolis that is challenged but not doomed. Yahoo plans to show the series in several parts and incorporate extra features, like interactive maps and casual games. It will be available in English, French, Spanish and other languages.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yahoo to Distribute Tom Hanks Series', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yahoo to Distribute Tom Hanks Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hanks, Tom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yahoo! Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T04:45:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': 