the fourth quarter, when the Steelers’ inevitable march to a game-winning field goal against the Broncos stalled inexplicably. Quarterback Ben Roethlisberger, up to then engineering a spirited comeback on one leg, suddenly looked like he had forgotten everything he ever knew. Ominous, dramatic music was cued up somewhere, most likely in your head.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: The Price of Not Believing', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belichick, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miles, Les', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roethlisberger, Ben', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saban, Nick', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Denver Broncos', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Louisiana State University', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Steelers', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T14:44:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organizati