2012/01/09/perry-joins-rivals-in-attacking-romney-on-bain/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney’s Bain Capital “looted” a company in Gaffney, S.C., and got “rich off failures and sticking it to someone else,” Gov. Rick Perry of Texas charged this morning as he began a swing through South Carolina.', 'lead_paragraph': '12:39 p.m. | Updated  ANDERSON, S.C. — Mitt Romney‘s Bain Capital “looted” a company in Gaffney, S.C., and got “rich off failures and sticking it to someone else,” Gov. Rick Perry of Texas charged this morning as he began a swing through South Carolina.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Perry Joins Rivals in Attacking Romney on Bain', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T15:45:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Oppel', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40507f07-8b8d-5840-88f3-d31e4a4bb54e', 'word_count': 703, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40507f07-8b8d-5840-88f3-d31e4a4bb54e'}, {'abstract': 'House Speaker John A. Boehner is leading a delegation to Brazil, Colombia and Mexico as the House prepares to take up energy and infrastructure legislation that is part of the Republican jobs agenda.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.c