pots like Atlas, Tailor and Gilt, takes a pretty down to earth approach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At King in SoHo, Francis Derby, who worked at Momofuku Ssam Bar, WD50 and avant-garde spots like Atlas, Tailor and Gilt, has subdued his inventive impulses somewhat for a more classical approach. His menu will offer smoked baby octopus salad, marinated charred mackerel and also chicken for two baked in salt with spaetzle. The approach in this intimate space is European; the room is accented with vintage pieces.The wine and beer lists emphasize Europe, too. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'King Cozies Up in SoHo', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T21:44:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb86fb08-5269-514f-8a3e-abfb907afd5b', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb86fb08-5269-514f-8a3e-abfb907afd5b'}, {'abstract': 'Thierry Henry had a dream return to Arsenal, scoring the game’s only goal in a win over Leeds United Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/09/for-henry-arsenal-forever/', 'snippet': 'Thierry Henry had a dream return to Arsenal, scoring the game’s only goal in a win over Leeds United Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It took Thierry Henry about 10 minutes to once again put his stamp on an Arsenal game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Henry: Forever Arsenal', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foot