olina and the meltdown inside the Tea Party movement will be online Thursday and in the magazine Sunday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why This Attack Might Hurt Romney', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shutdowns (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T22:05:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Bai', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bai', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2949e85d-3be0-5d4a-998f-51acfb26b0a1', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2949e85d-3be0-5d4a-998f-51acfb26b0a1'}, {'abstract': 'A special election will be held March 20 to replace Carl Kruger in the New York State Senate, Gov. Andrew Cuomo announced.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/09/special-vote-in-march-on-successor-to-state-senator-kruger/', 'snippet': 'A special election will be held March 20 to replace Carl Kruger in the New York State Senate, Gov. Andrew Cuomo announced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY – A special election to replace former State Senator Carl Kruger will be held on March 20, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo announced on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Special Vote in March on Successor to State Senator Kruger', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elec