e about a longtime friend to whom I owe so much.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Remembering Tony Blankley', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blankley, Tony', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T23:05:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aac6263e-dc1b-54a0-9f70-ca1716d5caaa', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aac6263e-dc1b-54a0-9f70-ca1716d5caaa'}, {'abstract': 'The police say the traffic agent interfered when marshals tried to tow her S.U.V. for having more than $450 in unpaid tickets.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/09/traffic-agent-arrested-over-car-tow/', 'snippet': 'The police say the traffic agent interfered when marshals tried to tow her S.U.V. for having more than $450 in unpaid tickets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 6:42 p.m. | A traffic agent who owed more than $450 in parking tickets was arrested Monday morning in Brooklyn, accused of trying to stop her S.U.V. from being towed, the authorities said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Traffic Agent With Unpaid Tickets Is Arrested Over Tow', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bedford-Stuyvesant (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T23:06:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2385380-ddd7-5656-a484-1acee009781b', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2385380-ddd7-5656-a484-1acee009781b'}, {'abstract': 'After the Canadian Pacific Railway rejected his plan to change its chief executive, the hedge fund manager William A. Ackman said he would seek to oust the company’s board.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/09/ackman-plans-proxy-fight-at-canadian-pacific/', 'snippet': 'After the Canadian Pacific Railway rejected his plan to change its chief executive, the hedge fund manager William A. Ackman said he would seek to oust the company’s board.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — The hedge fund manager William A. Ackman said Monday that he would wage a proxy battle to replace the directors and the chief executive of the Canadian Pacific Railway after it rejected his plan to bring in a former rival to run the company.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ackman Plans Proxy Fight at Canadian Pacific', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ackman, William A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Canadian National Railway Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pershing Square Capital Management', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-09T23:10:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7362aa9c-3fe0-57e9-8688-028043e3281f', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7362aa9c-3fe0-57e9-8688-028043e3281f'}, {'abstract': 'The Museum of Jurassic Technology in Culver City, Calif., is a wunderkammer of the real and the should-be-real.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/arts/design/museum-of-jurrasic-technology-shows-its-wild-side-review.html', 'snippet': 'The Museum of Jurassic Technology in Culver City, Calif., is a wunderkammer of the real and the should-be-real.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CULVER CITY, Calif. — It may be best to stop reading this review right now. Otherwise you will know what to expect at the Museum of Jurassic Technology. And then, when you look through a magnifying glass and see a painted sculpture of Disney’s Goofy standing on the head of a needle, or learn how the stage machinery of Baroque theaters created the illusion of flowing water, or are told that some South American bats seem to fly through solid objects, you won’t have the same mixture of shock, marvel, delight and confusion as I did. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/10/arts/JURASSIC/JURASSIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/10/arts/JURASSIC/JURASSIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/10/arts/JURASSIC/JURASSIC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima