rs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/opinion/the-corporate-candidates.html', 'snippet': 'The Republican presidential hopefuls with backgrounds in ordering layoffs and lobbying Congress can’t relate to struggling voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The more Mitt Romney pretends to empathize with the millions of Americans who are struggling in this economy, the less he seems to understand their despair. And the rest of the Republican field seems to have no more insight into the concerns of most voters than he does. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Corporate Candidates', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Corporate Candidates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-10T02:34:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b1caa6c-4931-56c2-b7e9-2cc0851100ef', 'word_count': 584, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b1caa6c-4931-56c2-b7e9-2cc0851100ef'}, {'abstract': 'An independent panel advised the camera maker to seek more than $1.2 billion from current and past executives over a cover-up that lasted more than a decade.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytim