news reports said several protesters were killed as the police sought to contain the demonstrations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/world/africa/nigerians-protest-oil-price-rise-as-subsidies-end.html', 'snippet': 'A strike over the oil price increase shut down much of the country, and news reports said several protesters were killed as the police sought to contain the demonstrations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAKAR, Senegal — Tens of thousands of Nigerians took to the streets in cities across the country on Monday to protest a sudden sharp rise in oil prices after the government abruptly ended fuel subsidies. At the same time, a national strike over the oil price increase shut down much of the country. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/10/world/NIGERIA/NIGERIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/10/world/NIGERIA/NIGERIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/10/world/NIGERIA/NIGERIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/10/world/NIGERIA/NIGERIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/10/world/NIGERIA/NIGERIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nigerians Protest Rise in Oil Prices', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nigerians Protest Rise in Oil Prices After Subsidies End', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{