near, workers race to cover signs of the chief minister’s party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The onerous task of hiding Uttar Pradesh’s enormous stone tributes to the state’s chief minister, Mayawati, and her party began early Tuesday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Statues Under Wraps in Uttar Pradesh', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Images', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uttar Pradesh State (India)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-10T18:27:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hari Kumar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kumar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1e075b6-ca0f-56a6-9bfd-c819b7cd83b5', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1e075b6-ca0f-56a6-9bfd-c819b7cd83b5'}, {'abstract': 'The coupe, which Honda called a concept, is essentially the production version of the ninth-generation Accord.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/an-almost-there-debut-for-the-2013-honda-accord-coupe/', 'snippet': 'The coupe, which Honda called a concept, is essentially the production version of the ninth-generation Accord.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Introduced Tuesday, Jan. 10: Honda Accord coupe concept.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Almost-There Debut for the 2013 Honda Accord Coupe', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles',