leet near the Persian Gulf saved a group of distressed Iranian mariners on Tuesday, pulling them to safety from a cargo dhow that was foundering with a flooded engine room, the naval central command reported.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Navy Reports Second Rescue of Iranian Mariners', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Navy Reports Second Rescue of Iranian Mariners in a Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Persian Gulf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Navy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-10T19:41:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a94131a-4fb3-58ef-b689-b3ab01ba940e', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a94131a-4fb3-58ef-b689-b3ab01ba940e'}, {'abstract': 'Angelo Sosa is the chef creating the small-plate menu.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/at-anejo-food-to-complement-tequila/', 'snippet': 'Angelo Sosa is the chef creating the small-plate menu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mexican restaurants all over town have scores of tequilas on the bar, but at Anejo Tequileria y Restaurante, opening next Tuesday in Hell’s Kitchen, a carefully curated selection of about two dozen tequilas, mezcals and also bottles of a similar, less known distillate from Chihuahua in the north, sotol, take center stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Añejo, Food to Complement Tequila', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-10T19:44:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89b5cc14-e804-5057-a6ec-2509b8c6062a', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89b5cc14-e804-5057-a6ec-2509b8c6062a'}, {'abstract': 'McCartney’s collection contained quirky monogrammed separates, buffalo checks and dazzling brocade dresses.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/10/just-one-look-stella-mccartney/', 'snippet': 'McCartney’s collection contained quirky monogrammed separates, buffalo checks and dazzling brocade dresses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The suit from Stella McCartney this season is a bit of a departure from the one she’s best known for, with its soft-edged, single-button jacket. The prefall suit has three buttons and is “much more fitted, tailored and body-conscious,” said McCartney at last night’s presentation. “I’m always designing for women, things they’ll want to wear.” Chances are, much of the collection –– including the quirky monogrammed separates, the green and black buffalo checks (shown here) and the dazzling brocade dresses –– will be on that list, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Stella McCartney', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-10T19:45:15+0000'