uation system continues, and on Tuesday Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo issued a blistering statement, saying "the forces that protect this bureaucracy have stymied reform at every turn." He urged both sides to "expedite ...', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Urges Districts and Unions to Compromise on Evaluations ', 'kicker': 'SchoolBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-11T00:30:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By FERNANDA SANTOS and CHRIS PALMER', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fernanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'SANTOS', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'PALMER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e28bea82-a75f-5bca-98b5-611893c5624b', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e28bea82-a75f-5bca-98b5-611893c5624b'}, {'abstract': 'Total dividends paid by companies in the S.& P. 500-stock index last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/01/11/business/dividend-payouts-pick-up.html', 'snippet': 'Total dividends paid by companies in the S.& P. 500-stock index last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Total dividends paid by companies in the S.& P. 500-stock index last year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dividend Payouts Pick Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-11T00:36:51+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/92729e41-3d42-581c-8fa4-36de8d0f84f7', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/92729e41-3d42-581c-8fa4-36de8d0f84f7'}, {'abstract': 'A federal appeals court on Tuesday blocked implementation of an amendment adopted by Oklahoma in Nov. 2010 that would bar state courts from considering Shariah, or Islamic, law in any proceedings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/11/us/oklahoma-court-upholds-blocking-of-amendment-against-shariah-law.html', 'snippet': 'A federal appeals court on Tuesday blocked implementation of an amendment adopted by Oklahoma in Nov. 2010 that would bar state courts from considering Shariah, or Islamic, law in any proceedings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal appeals court on Tuesday blocked implementation of an amendment adopted by Oklahoma in November 2010 that would bar state courts from considering Shariah, or Islamic, law in any proceedings. Soon after voters approved the amendment, the American Civil Liberties Union and the Council on American-Islamic Relations sued and a district court issued a preliminary injunction, saying that the amendment most likely violates the First Amendment. On Tuesday, the 10th Circuit of the United States Court of Appeals upheld the injunction, saying the state had not demonstrated any compelling reason for discrimination against one religion. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oklahoma: Court Upholds Blocking of Amendment Against Shariah Law', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Plains', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oklahoma: Court Upholds Blocking of Amendment Against Shariah Law', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Civil Liberties Union', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shariah (Islamic Law)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank'