ne-sane/', 'snippet': 'The Raiders take a stunning step toward normal as new General Manager Reggie McKenzie fires Coach Hue Jackson to cut ties to a dysfunctional past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At first blush, the news that the Raiders have fired a coach is hardly notable. Firings in Al Davisland were such an annual event it was probably printed on the team calendars. Heck, if they fired one in the middle of training camp, most of the N.F.L. would simply sigh. The Raiders have been the league’s unintentional reality show for so long, the shock value had run out on crazy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: Have the Raiders Gone Sane?', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bowl Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Mark', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gaborik, Marian', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Hue', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCaffery, Fran', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mularkey, Mike', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saban, Nick', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schottenheimer, Brian', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bowl Championship Series', 'rank': 16, 'major