r 1911 in the Model T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Low-Carbon Car Leather? Bridge of Weir Makes Its Case at Lincoln Stand', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leather and Leather Goods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'North American International Auto Show', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Waste Materials and Disposal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lincoln Division of Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-11T15:58:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Motavalli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Motavalli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3acf2c07-e156-522a-a477-5c51a211b259', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3acf2c07-e156-522a-a477-5c51a211b259'}, {'abstract': 'A day after his drubbing of the Republican field, Mitt Romney assailed the angry attacks about his work for Bain Capital and urged his opponents to settle on what he called a “new course.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/us/politics/romney-warns-foes-to-scale-back-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'A day after his drubbing of the Republican field, Mitt Romney assailed the angry attacks about his work for Bain Capital and urged his opponents to settle on what he called a “new course.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, N.H. — A triumphant Mitt Romney prepared to enter the