rson': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a0b26e9-c070-5b44-924f-cf5014ccf606', 'word_count': 421, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a0b26e9-c070-5b44-924f-cf5014ccf606'}, {'abstract': 'Televisions and beer are plentiful at this combination sports bar and disco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/fashion/bounce-sporting-club.html', 'snippet': 'Televisions and beer are plentiful at this combination sports bar and disco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A SPORTS bar that doubles as a disco? Nightmarish as it may sound, the concept may, in fact, be a stroke of genius, if the crowds at the downtown Bounce Sporting Club are any indication. Opened in September, Bounce is the rare place where onetime fraternity brothers and the women who love them can gather for happy hour (or on weekends for the Big Game), become sufficiently inebriated and eventually commence dancing without having to migrate to the meatpacking district. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/fashion/12BOITE1_SPAN/12BOITE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/12/fashion/12BOITE1_SPAN/12BOITE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/fashion/12BOITE1_SPAN/12zBOITE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/fashion/12BOITE1_SPAN/12BOITE1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/12/fashion/12BOITE1_