-9b9d-709ad3e10ad4'}, {'abstract': 'A disc jockey well known and well liked in New York City’s music scene is attracting support and financial help after a bizarre accident in Oregon that nearly killed him.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/11/fund-raising-tour-for-injured-d-j-is-rolling-to-new-york/', 'snippet': 'A disc jockey well known and well liked in New York City’s music scene is attracting support and financial help after a bizarre accident in Oregon that nearly killed him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The strangest thing about the accident, friends say, was not the blood-soaked victim — a disc jockey from Brooklyn, traveling in Portland, Ore., for a spell.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aid Coast to Coast for Injured Brooklyn D.J.', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disc Jockeys', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-11T19:32:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cfabdebb-a12d-57f3-b85c-9773d69079e8', 'word_count': 928, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cfabdebb-a12d-57f3-b85c-9773d69079e8'}, {'abstract': 'Italy’s technocratic prime minister, Mario Monti, said that austerity alone was not the answer to Europe’s debt crisis, and that Italy could deteriorate without assistance from European institutions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/world/europe/italys-mario-monti-in-germany-calls-for-growth-policies-in-europe.html', 'snippet': 'Italy’s technocratic prime minister, Mario Monti, said that austerity alone was not the answer to Europe’s debt crisis, and that Italy could deteriorate without assistance from European institutions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Italy’s technocratic prime minister, Mario Monti, arrived in Germany on Wednesday with a sharp message for Chancellor Angela Merkel that austerity alone was not the answer to Europe’s sovereign debt crisis, and that the political and economic situation in Italy could deteriorate rapidly without more assistance from European institutions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/world/europe/12germany-pic/12germany-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/12/world/europe/12germany-pic/12germany-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/world/europe/12germany-pic/12germany-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/world/europe/12germany-pic/12germany-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/12/world/europe/12germany-pic/12germany-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Monti, in Berlin, Calls for Growth Policies in Europe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italy’s Leader Says Austerity Alone Isn’t a Cure to Debts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 