in Hollywood it is campaign season, when contenders make the rounds of receptions and meet-and-greets, intended to convince likely voters of their affability and depth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/movies/awardsseason/new-york-film-critics-and-national-board-of-review-awards.html', 'snippet': 'In politics and in Hollywood it is campaign season, when contenders make the rounds of receptions and meet-and-greets, intended to convince likely voters of their affability and depth.', 'lead_paragraph': '“At our house we call this time of year ‘the convention,’\xa0”Frances McDormand announced from the stage at the National Board of Review gala on Tuesday night. Addressing the assembled famous faces — the Clooneys and Rooneys, Tildas and Martys — Ms. McDormand, the Oscar-winning star of “Fargo,” added, “You are going to be seeing a lot of each other.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/arts/bagger-1/bagger-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/12/arts/bagger-1/bagger-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/arts/bagger-1/bagger-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/12/arts/bagger-1/bagger-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/12/arts/bagger-1/bagger-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'And Now, the Awards for Awards', 'kicker': 'The Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'And Now, The Awards For Awards', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Film Critics Circle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-11T23:27:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'subsection_name': 'Awards Season', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89067cfd-02b0-5359-bc3d-596ca34fcb2f', 'word_count': 1275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89067cfd-02b0-5359-bc3d-596ca34fcb2f'}, {'abstract': 'At C.E.S., everyone at Sony seemed to have received the memo about user experience.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/11/living-up-to-apples-standards/', 'snippet': 'At C.E.S., everyone at Sony seemed to have received the memo about user experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS — Apple does not exhibit at C.E.S. and its executives haven’t deigned to speak at the event for years. Yet the company’s shadow looms large.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Living Up to Apple’s Standards', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Consumer Electronics Show', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony