/01/12/at-prague-castle-treasures-of-the-czars/', 'snippet': 'The Court of the Tsar Under the Romanov Dynasty, at the Prague Castle through March 4, is a showcase of more than 150 priceless artifacts, relics and jewels that shed light on the lives of Russia’s famous royal family during the 16th and 17th cent...', 'lead_paragraph': 'A rare exhibition of gilded treasures from the Moscow Kremlin museums — some of which had never before left Russia — has been getting rave reviews since its opening at Prague Castle last month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Prague Castle, Treasures of the Czars', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romanov Family', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Czech Republic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T11:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': "By Julie O'Shea", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Shea", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95d1cc6d-67fd-5e0c-8fb3-86aebe15a290', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95d1cc6d-67fd-5e0c-8fb3-86aebe15a290'}, {'abstract': 'Whatever the constitutional details, Quebec has already reached its own type of sovereignty: a sovereignty of the public sphere.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/quebec-is-already-culturally-independent-of-canada/', 'snippet': 'Whatever the constitutional details, Quebec has already reached its own type of sovereignty: a sovereignty of the public sphere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A sketch on Montreal’s infrastructure troubles from “Bye Bye 2011,” a Québ