1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e1c113a-6aa7-5420-b513-91312cf0a594', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e1c113a-6aa7-5420-b513-91312cf0a594'}, {'abstract': 'A recipe for slow-roasted Korean pork turns anyone with an oven and a few hours into a chef.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/magazine/the-bo-ssam-miracle.html', 'snippet': 'A recipe for slow-roasted Korean pork turns anyone with an oven and a few hours into a chef.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend’s dinner is a slow-roasted shoulder of pig, a meal that can be picked apart by a table of friends armed only with chopsticks and lettuce. A tight and salty caramel crust sits on top of the moist, fragrant collapse of meat, and juices run thick to pool beneath it, a kind of syrup, delicious in its intensity. It is pork as pommes soufflé.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '48', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/magazine/15eat1_span/15eat1_span-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 445, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/magazine/15eat1_span/15eat1_span-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 445}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/magazine/15eat1_span/15eat1_span-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1015, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/magazine/15eat1_span/15eat1_span-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1015, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/magazine/15eat1_span/15eat1_span-thumbSta