et. Arthur also refers to la strada principale in the Italian section of the Bronx and will make naming any future restaurants a lot easier, like spreading ashes: Arthur on Bleecker, Arthur on Madison, Arthur on. … Wait, I’m getting ahead of myself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The New Restaurant Will Be Chef Joe’s', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chefs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T12:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Buschel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buschel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29d92331-f423-5ae3-a745-338e74af8082', 'word_count': 1447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29d92331-f423-5ae3-a745-338e74af8082'}, {'abstract': 'Kindred spirits in defeat, Andy Murray and his new coach now aim to share a victory in a Grand Slam tennis tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/13/sports/tennis/13iht-sraomurray13.html', 'snippet': 'Kindred spirits in defeat, Andy Murray and his new coach now aim to share a victory in a Grand Slam tennis tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No man needs a Grand Slam title quite as much as Andy Murray. His new coach, Ivan Lendl, was once in the same awkward position.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't