per Nicki Minaj, who are Grammy nominees in multiple categories, will be among the first-time performers at the awards ceremony on Feb. 12.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The country music star Jason Aldean and the rapper Nicki Minaj will be among the first-time performers during the Grammy Awards ceremony on Feb. 12, the National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences announced on Thursday. Mr. Aldean and Ms. Minaj are nominated for several awards. They will be joined by Kelly Clarkson, Foo Fighters, Bruno Mars and Taylor Swift.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jason Aldean and Nicki Minaj to Perform at the Grammys', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aldean, Jason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Minaj, Nicki', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T16:57:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee95ec38-f068-55dd-aaf5-95201ab6f127', 'word_count': 198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee95ec38-f068-55dd-aaf5-95201ab6f127'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers link age discrimination to poorer health.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/age-discrimination-takes-its-toll/', 'snippet': 'Researchers link age discrimination to poorer health.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Raise your hand if you’ve felt that people treat y