 'nyt://article/57b12b91-a688-5813-ae3d-80adaf06aef6'}, {'abstract': 'Christopher Clarey, who covers tennis for The Times and The International Herald Tribune, will answer questions from readers.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/have-australian-open-questions-christopher-clarey-has-answers/', 'snippet': 'Christopher Clarey, who covers tennis for The Times and The International Herald Tribune, will answer questions from readers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who is the favorite in the men’s singles at the Australian Open? Will playing in her home country have any kind of effect on Samantha Stosur? Which under-the-radar players could do well this year? Christopher Clarey, who covers tennis for The Times and for The International Herald Tribune, will answer questions from readers. Use the comment field below for your questions. Answers will appear early next week on Straight Sets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Have Australian Open Questions? Christopher Clarey Has Answers', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T19:19:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By THE NEW YORK TIMES', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b59a28ab-ae23-5180-9932-63479099bbc9', 'word_count': 70, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b59a28ab-ae23-5180-9932-63479099bbc9'}, {'abstract': 'Documentarians assembled for Cinema Eye Honors argued over how the Academy’s new rules will affect the voting process.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/at-cinema-eye-honors-documentarians-try-to-understand-new-oscar-rules/', 'snippet': 'Documentarians assembled for Cinema Eye Honors argued over how the Academy’s new rules will affect the voting process.', 'lead