25-aa2d-5f5f-8098-d7131375fc91', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aafa7925-aa2d-5f5f-8098-d7131375fc91'}, {'abstract': 'His book is based on journals the New Orleans rapper kept during his eight-month stint at Rikers Island.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/lil-wayne-the-memoirist/', 'snippet': 'His book is based on journals the New Orleans rapper kept during his eight-month stint at Rikers Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lil Wayne, the New Orleans rapper, has turned his experience at Rikers Island into a memoir that will be published in November, two years after his release, Grand Central Publishing announced on Thursday. The book, “Gone Till November,” is described as an internal monologue based on journals Lil Wayne kept during his eight-month stint at the New York City jail on a gun possession charge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lil Wayne, the Memoirist', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greenberg, Ben', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lil Wayne', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Grand Central Publishing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rikers Island Prison Complex', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T20:04:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id