Some influential Republican voices have denounced Newt Gingrich’s attacks on Mitt Romney’s career in private equity, but that is not dissuading a “super PAC” supporting Mr. Gingrich from carpet-bombing the South Carolina airwaves with blistering ads about Bain Capital, Mr. Romney’s former firm. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'PAC Deluges South Carolina Airwaves With Anti-Romney Ads', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adelson, Sheldon G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T22:10:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Trip Gabriel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Trip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gabriel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7724fa65-de05-57dc-9605-d119cb4e3d2a', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7724fa65-de05-57dc-9605-d119cb4e3d2a'}, {'abstract': 'An old industrial neighborhood is now home to restaurants and bars — and Switzerland’s tallest building.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/travel/in-zurich-west-feeding-the-hip-and-the-hungry.html', 'snippet': 'An old industrial neighborhood is now home to restaurants and bars — and Switzerland’s tallest building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR much of the past century, the Zurich West neighborhood was best known for its industry, churning out water turbines, electric motors and even ships in the area between the Limmat River and the railway tracks behind the main train station. Then, as manufacturers moved away, contemporary art galleries, museums and design shops sprouted amid abandoned factories in the mid-1990s, creating a gritty haven for the city’s creative class.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15HEADSUP_SPAN/15HEADSUP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15HEADSUP_SPAN/15HEADSUP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15HEADSUP_SPAN/15HEADSUP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15HEADSUP_SPAN/15HEADSUP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15HEADSUP_SPAN/15HEADSUP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Zurich West, Feeding the Hip and the Hungry', 'kicker': 'Heads Up', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Catering to Zurich’s Epicures', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Zurich (Switzerland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-12T22:11:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_n