 '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/1361c0e7-0970-5f34-a712-01b524999ce2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/1361c0e7-0970-5f34-a712-01b524999ce2'}, {'abstract': 'A few of the treasures on the island of Phu Quoc require a little work and a sense of adventure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/travel/in-phu-quoc-vietnam-tranquillity-off-the-tourist-trail.html', 'snippet': 'A few of the treasures on the island of Phu Quoc require a little work and a sense of adventure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT was my first time operating a motorcycle, but I handled the Honda with the confidence of a veteran, zipping alongside my boyfriend, Caleb, through rain-filled potholes on red clay streets. The morning was overcast after a night of thunderstorms, but we were determined to spend as many daylight hours as possible on Sao Beach, the white sand haven rumored to be among the most beautiful spots on Phu Quoc, an island 30 miles off the west coast of Vietnam.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 272, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 272}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN/15OVERNIGHTER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/travel/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN/15OVERNIGHTER1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2