A dozen multifamily developments, with a total of 1,588 new units, were approved in 2011; of those, four are under construction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/realestate/long-island-in-the-region-a-rise-in-multifamily-development.html', 'snippet': 'A dozen multifamily developments, with a total of 1,588 new units, were approved in 2011; of those, four are under construction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE island never seems to lack for grand building plans. But that is sometimes less obvious than it might be, because of what usually happens when plans meet reality. Years can go by before a shovel enters the ground, what with a tangled approvals process and a tough climate for financing. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/realestate/15LIZONE_SPAN/15LIZONE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/realestate/15LIZONE_SPAN/15LIZONE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/realestate/15LIZONE_SPAN/li-zone-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/realestate/15LIZONE_SPAN/li-zone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/realestate/15LIZONE_SPAN/li-zone-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Projects With Mass Appeal', 'kicker': 'In the Region | Long Island', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Projects With Mass Appeal', 'name': None, 'seo':