 and challenged everyone’s concentration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/13/sports/basketball/nbas-bulls-survive-five-games-in-six-nights.html', 'snippet': 'The Bulls beat the Wizards on Wednesday night, Chicago’s third game in three nights and fifth in six in a grind that rendered legs rubbery and challenged everyone’s concentration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — One of the brutal stretches that have become a signature of the condensed N.B.A. schedule ended Wednesday night at the United Center. An undermanned, gassed Chicago Bulls team took the floor for its third game in three nights and fifth in six, a grind that rendered legs rubbery and challenged everyone’s concentration.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/13/sports/BULLSdress/BULLSdress-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 996, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/13/sports/BULLSdress/BULLSdress-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/13/sports/BULLSdress/BULLSdress-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'No Rest (but Four Wins) for the Weary Bulls', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Rest (but 4 Wins) For the Weary Bulls', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deng, Luol', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Wizards', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lucas, John III', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Derrick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}