t': 1230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd8bbd66-2edd-579e-9453-ad49d856821f'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg pledged more lawyers for a commission with a role in overseeing the New York Police Department, but critics say the entity is a flawed watchdog.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/13/nyregion/bloombergs-pledge-to-fight-police-misconduct-faces-skepticism.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg pledged more lawyers for a commission with a role in overseeing the New York Police Department, but critics say the entity is a flawed watchdog.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a year that saw a steady drumbeat of police corruption cases and increased scrutiny of several New York Police Department practices, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg pledged on Thursday to add four lawyers to the two-person legal staff at the agency responsible for monitoring the department’s Internal Affairs Bureau.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vow to Fight Police Misconduct Faces Skepticism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vow to Fight Misconduct By Police Faces Skepticism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the City Message (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T03:14:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12a42e64-0549-552b-89d9