goal of immigration reform?', 'web_url': 'https://campaignstops.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/12/year-of-the-immigrant/', 'snippet': 'Will the increasing power of the Latino and Asian-American vote lead us toward the elusive goal of immigration reform?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although everyone is talking about the presidential election this year, I am much more excited about the role of immigrants in the politics of 2012. It’s not a year like 2009 when we waited anxiously for a new president and Congress to create a sensible solution for immigration reform. Those hopes are long gone. They have been replaced by new fears aroused by draconian laws that emerged from Alabama, Arizona and Georgia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Year of the Immigrant', 'kicker': 'Campaign Stops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asian-Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Angle, Sharron E', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boxer, Barbara', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fiorina, Carleton S', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Edwin M', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 1