ted States and tested them for viruses gave them cause for alarm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a familiar story: deep within the jungle, an intrepid explorer or hunter awakens something he shouldn’t have. Maybe he bagged the wrong bat or came into contact with an ailing chimp. Whatever the origin, he unsuspectingly becomes host to something deadly and unseen and unwittingly carries it back home across the river or the ocean. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From the Jungle to J.F.K., Viruses Cross Borders in Monkey Meat', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Livestock Diseases', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Monkeys and Apes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'SARS (Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Viruses', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'West Nile Virus', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Columbia University', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy International Airport (NYC)', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations',