stract': 'The Rev. Patrick J. Conroy, the House of Representatives chaplain, and the Rev. Dr. Barry C. Black, the Senate’s chaplain, try to nurture civility in their fractious congregation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/us/congresss-chaplains-face-divided-flock-on-religion.html', 'snippet': 'The Rev. Patrick J. Conroy, the House of Representatives chaplain, and the Rev. Dr. Barry C. Black, the Senate’s chaplain, try to nurture civility in their fractious congregation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Rev. Patrick J. Conroy invited all the members of the House of Representatives and their families to the holiday reception he was hosting last month as the chamber’s chaplain. He put out hot cider, cookies and a not-quite-functional chocolate fountain, and for the benefit of the children he picked up his folk guitar to perform “The House at Pooh Corner.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/your-money/14religion_337/14religion_337-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 337, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Congress’s Chaplains Try to Instill Civility in a Quarrelsome Flock', 'kicker': 'On Religion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Congress’s Chaplains Try to Instill Civility in a Quarrelsome Flock', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chaplains', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T16:19:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name':