Kwame Brown’s injury and Andris Biedrins’ foul trouble, Golden State Warriors Coach Mark Jackson employed a game-long plan of intentionally fouling Dwight Howard, a notoriously poor free throw shooter who was otherwise destroying Golden State’s interior defense.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Warriors, Ellis Proves Essential', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T18:36:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By ROB MAHONEY', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MAHONEY', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d2dbb728-2885-5598-b0cb-85b0c7eeebf6', 'word_count': 713, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d2dbb728-2885-5598-b0cb-85b0c7eeebf6'}, {'abstract': 'The bride, telling a story of survival and kindness, said, “I feel certain God has a plan for me and that being with Sean is a big part of it.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/fashion/weddings/kate-foster-and-sean-hogue-vows.html', 'snippet': 'The bride, telling a story of survival and kindness, said, “I feel certain God has a plan for me and that being with Sean is a big part of it.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS freshmen at Missouri State University, Kate Foster and Sean Hogue had a whirlwind romance that quickly led to serious talk about marriage. They are still very young, Ms. Foster is 21 now and Mr. Hogue 22, yet their lives have been tempered by disaster — the tornado that devastated Joplin, Mo., last May and destroyed Ms. Foster’s home. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type