, a spouse and, in one particularly painful case, a teenage child who died on Christmas morning. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/fashion/15THISLIFE/15THISLIFE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1023, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/fashion/15THISLIFE/15THISLIFE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/fashion/15THISLIFE/15THISLIFE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mourning in a Digital Age', 'kicker': 'This Life', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mourning in a Digital Age', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grief (Emotion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T20:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Feiler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feiler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16b506c1-1f43-5ae4-bccf-2c4a19c2923c', 'word_count': 1253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16b506c1-1f43-5ae4-bccf-2c4a19c2923c'}, {'abstract': 'The freshest American cars at the Detroit show reflected