0', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f97ef18c-9bf0-5979-b920-5c230ae1d2e0'}, {'abstract': 'Keith Hennessy presented “Almost,” an improvisational performance, at the Abrons Arts Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/arts/dance/keith-hennesseys-almost-at-abrons-arts-center-review.html', 'snippet': 'Keith Hennessy presented “Almost,” an improvisational performance, at the Abrons Arts Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Keith Hennessy was quaking in his underwear, wobbling atop a tall stack of foam blocks when he said, “I’m doing this on purpose.” It was near the end of “Almost,” his improvisational performance at the Abrons Arts Center on Thursday, part of the American Realness festival. A moment before, having ad-libbed his way into that precarious position, he had said, dryly, “There’s a load of possibilities here.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/ALMOST/ALMOST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/ALMOST/ALMOST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/ALMOST/ALMOST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/ALMOST/ALMOST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/ALMOST/ALMOST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Uh, Uh, Uh ... He’s Nearly Got It', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Uh,