ttps://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/13/anthony-roth-costanzo-to-replace-david-daniels-at-the-met/', 'snippet': 'Anthony Roth Costanzo will step into the counter-tenor role of Prospero in the Metropolitan Opera’s production of “The Enchanted Island” on Saturday evening.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anthony Roth Costanzo will step into the counter-tenor role of Prospero in the Metropolitan Opera’s production of “The Enchanted Island” on Saturday evening. He will replace David Daniels, who is ill, the Met said. Mr. Costanzo is cast as Ferdinand in the opera, and will be replaced in that part by Jeffrey Mandelbaum. The switch also occurred in Act II of Thursday’s performance. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anthony Roth Costanzo to Replace David Daniels at the Met', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T23:11:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bef8d8e6-35f0-5393-85fd-7a1f9488c41d', 'word_count': 64, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bef8d8e6-35f0-5393-85fd-7a1f9488c41d'}, {'abstract': 'Christine C. Quinn, the City Council speaker, said she would introduce legislation mandating a so-called living wage for a more limited group of workers than originally proposed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/nyregion/speaker-quinn-announces-compromise-on-living-wage.html', 'snippet': 'Christine C. Quinn, the City Council speaker, said she would introduce legislation mandating a so-called living wage for a more limited group of workers than originally proposed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After months of heated debate ov