 is precisely what animates his work.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/RESONANCE/RESONANCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/RESONANCE/RESONANCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/RESONANCE/RESONANCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/RESONANCE/RESONANCE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/14/arts/RESONANCE/RESONANCE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Past, Present and Future, All at Once', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Past, Present And Future, All at Once', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schoenberg, Arnold', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lehman, Steve', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Iyer, Vijay', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Austrian Cultural Forum', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sorey, Tyshawn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-13T23:37:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'origin