d editors of The New York Times scour the Web each day for important and peculiar items. Friday’s selection includes a project that began with old skulls, plagiarism in self-publishing on Amazon and a game that teaches Web coding.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/13/todays-scuttlebot-victorian-human-skulls-and-a-plagiarism-problem/', 'snippet': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web each day for important and peculiar items. Friday’s selection includes a project that began with old skulls, plagiarism in self-publishing on Amazon and a game that teaches W...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Interesting things that reporters and editors for The New York Times found on the Web on Friday. Find more Scuttlebot items here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot: Victorian Human Skulls and a Plagiarism Problem', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012