 15 choices of race on the census form, more than 18 million Latinos have been checking “other,” reflecting the group’s diverse self-image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/us/for-many-latinos-race-is-more-culture-than-color.html', 'snippet': 'With 15 choices of race on the census form, more than 18 million Latinos have been checking “other,” reflecting the group’s diverse self-image.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every decade, the Census Bureau spends billions of dollars and deploys hundreds of thousands of workers to get an accurate portrait of the American population. Among the questions on the census form is one about race, with 15 choices, including “some other race.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/us/LATINOS-1/LATINOS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 362, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/14/us/LATINOS-1/LATINOS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 362}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/us/LATINOS-1/LATINOS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/us/LATINOS-1/LATINOS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/14/us/LATINOS-1/LATINOS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Many Latinos, Racial Identity Is More Culture Than Color', 'kicker': 'Race Remixed', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Many Latinos, Racial Identity Is More Culture Than Color', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywo