 his 33 years as a correspondent for CBS and ABC News, Mr. Threlkeld reported on wars, presidential campaigns, assassinations and the collapse of the Soviet Union.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/business/media/richard-threlkeld-award-winning-journalist-dies-at-74.html', 'snippet': 'In his 33 years as a correspondent for CBS and ABC News, Mr. Threlkeld reported on wars, presidential campaigns, assassinations and the collapse of the Soviet Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard Threlkeld, who in his 33 years as a correspondent for CBS and ABC News covered wars, presidential campaigns, assassinations and the collapse of the Soviet Union, died Friday morning in a car accident on Long Island. He was 74. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/business/THRELKELD-obit/THRELKELD-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/14/business/THRELKELD-obit/THRELKELD-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/business/THRELKELD-obit/THRELKELD-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 615, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/business/THRELKELD-obit/THRELKELD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/14/business/THRELKELD-obit/THRELKELD-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Richard Threlkeld, Award-Winning Journalist, Dies at 74', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Richard Threlkeld, 74, Award-Winning Journalist', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Threlkeld, Richard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC News', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-14T02:31:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Hevesi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hevesi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc179c08-84e1-5298-b9db-bcf9eff3a46a', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc179c08-84e1-5298-b9db-bcf9eff3a46a'}, {'abstract': 'The location, and the professor’s longtime friendship with a colleague who was at least briefly under suspicion, have added to the comparisons with a police detective series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/world/europe/steven-rawlings-case-evokes-oxfords-inspector-morse.html', 'snippet': 'The location, and the professor’s longtime friendship with a colleague who was at least briefly under suspicion, have added to the comparisons with a police detective series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — It has all the elements that have made the Inspector Morse detective series a popular success on both sides of the Atlantic: two Oxford University academics, friends and professional collaborators for decades, co-authors of a popular textbook on science mathematics, meet for a pub supper in a village outside the city.', 'print_section': 'A',