ollowed in Justin Smith’s footsteps as a defensive menace for the University of Missouri. Now the Smiths play together for San Francisco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/14/sports/football/aldon-smith-and-justin-smith-lead-49ers-defense.html', 'snippet': 'Aldon Smith followed in Justin Smith’s footsteps as a defensive menace for the University of Missouri. Now the Smiths play together for San Francisco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANTA CLARA, Calif. — In 2001, Justin Smith set the Missouri record for sacks in a season, with 11.\xa0', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/sports/sub-niners/sub-niners-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/14/sports/sub-niners/sub-niners-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/sports/sub-niners/sub-niners-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/14/sports/sub-niners/sub-niners-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/14/sports/sub-niners/sub-niners-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': '2 Smiths Add Up to Trouble for 49ers’ Opponents', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Smiths Share More Than a Name', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Missouri', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name