useum — might have happened in Lithuania for all the effect they have had (or could have) on the lives of people in Brownsville, in northeastern Brooklyn. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/nyregion/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/nyregion/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/nyregion/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/nyregion/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/nyregion/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN/15SUBBIGCITY2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Where Optimism Feels Out of Reach', 'kicker': 'Big City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where Optimism Feels Out of Reach', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime and Criminals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brownsville (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gangs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kazin, Alfred', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-14T05:38:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_