rotation into a strong point. The trade made too much sense to turn down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/sports/baseball/yankees-deal-from-depth-in-their-prospects.html', 'snippet': 'After trading away Jesus Montero, the Yankees still have three catchers for the future while turning a shaky rotation into a strong point. The trade made too much sense to turn down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So this is why the Yankees stockpiled so many catchers in their farm system. Teams need only one starting catcher, after all. Yet on the Baseball America list of the Yankees’ top 10 prospects, they had four catchers — and only two pitchers.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/KEPNER1/KEPNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yanks Deal From Depth in Their Prospects', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yanks Deal From Depth in Their Prospects', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N