ralization in Kazakhstan but whether it will be sufficient to tamp down emerging signs of discontent remains to be seen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/world/asia/an-election-in-kazakhstan-will-offer-something-new-a-multiparty-system.html', 'snippet': 'The government praised the change to a multiparty system as a step toward liberalization in Kazakhstan but whether it will be sufficient to tamp down emerging signs of discontent remains to be seen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASTANA, Kazakhstan — This capital city has been abuzz for weeks with the latest political news: Soon there will be politics. After an election scheduled for Sunday, Kazakhstan’s Parliament will be guaranteed, under a new law, to consist of more than one political party. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/world/KHAZAKHSTAN/KHAZAKHSTAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/world/KHAZAKHSTAN/KHAZAKHSTAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/world/KHAZAKHSTAN/KHAZAKHSTAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Election in Kazakhstan Will Offer Something New: A Multiparty System', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Election in Kazakhstan Will Offer Something New: A Multiparty System', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nazarbayev, Nursultan A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 