sco in the midst of the upscale shopping district on Union Square. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/us/15BCLOUNGE/15BCLOUNGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/us/15BCLOUNGE/15BCLOUNGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/us/15BCLOUNGE/15BCLOUNGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/us/15BCLOUNGE/15BCLOUNGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/us/15BCLOUNGE/15BCLOUNGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Facing Last Call, Fans Rally for a Storied Saloon', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Facing Last Call, Fans Rally for a Storied Saloon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evictions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-15T00:36:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zusha Elinson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zusha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elinson', 'qualifier':