x Smith led the 49ers to two go-ahead touchdowns in the final 2 minutes 11 seconds to beat the Saints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Like any 49ers team, this one cannot escape comparisons to the dynastic San Francisco teams of a generation ago. As if trying to fully recapture their gloried past, the 49ers had the 1980s pop icons Huey Lewis and the News sing the national anthem before Saturday’s playoff game. A handwritten sign above the last row of seats of dilapidating Candlestick Park read, “We’re back!” The sentiment in the Bay Area in the days before the game was that the resurrection went unnoticed by anyone east of the Sierra Nevada.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/YJPNINERS/YJPNINERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/YJPNINERS/YJPNINERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/YJPNINERS/YJPNINERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/YJPNINERS/YJPNINERS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/15/sports/YJPNINERS/YJPNINERS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Just Like in the Glory Days, 49ers Seize the Moment in the Playoffs', 'kicker': 'San Francisco 36, New Orleans 32', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Just Like in the Glory Days, 49ers Seize the Moment in the Playoffs', 'name': None, 'seo': 