i Manning threw three touchdown passes Sunday and the resurgent Giants defense hounded Aaron Rodgers and the top-seeded Packers right out of the playoffs with a 37-20 victory at Lambeau Field.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Final: Giants 37, Packers 20', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-15T18:33:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4004a5fe-090d-5dce-83bd-33aa45bdd5b1', 'word_count': 3262, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4004a5fe-090d-5dce-83bd-33aa45bdd5b1'}, {'abstract': 'Milan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/15/fashion/costumenational_fall2012.html', 'snippet': 'Milan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Milan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/15/fashion/costumenational_fall2012-slide-EJ6Z/costumenational_fall2012-slide-EJ6Z-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Costume National Homme', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Milan Fashion Week', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion Shows', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_