 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/theater/reviews/anthony-rapp-in-gary-duggans-dedalus-lounge-review.html', 'snippet': 'Three melancholy friends in a Dublin bar find their lives become increasingly knotty in Gary Duggan’s play “Dedalus Lounge.”', 'lead_paragraph': '“I thought I had a handle on myself,” Danny tells the audience in “Dedalus Lounge,” a mesmerizing mess of a play at the Interart Theater Annex. “When will I be normal?” he asks, his voice shaking. Those lines are part of an unsettling monologue, and they’re not the only compelling moments in a story that is by turns earnest and odd, tender and disturbing. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/daedalus/daedalus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/daedalus/daedalus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/daedalus/daedalus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/daedalus/daedalus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/daedalus/daedalus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sex, Death and Melancholy: Or, Three Friends Walk Into a Dublin Bar ...', 'kicker': "Theater Review | 'Dedalus Lounge'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sex, Death and Melancholy: Or, Three Friends Walk Into a Dublin Bar ...', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'