icality of the instruments was at the heart of the music.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/guitar/guitar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/guitar/guitar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/guitar/guitar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/guitar/guitar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/16/arts/guitar/guitar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Exploring a Range of Variations on Six Strings, a Body and a Neck', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Exploring a Range of Variations on Six Strings, a Body and a Neck', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Guitars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-15T23:43:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2b8f40e-97b6-5e25-a374-07cb9f158928', 'word_count': 575, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2b8f40e-97b6-5e25-a374-07cb9f158928'}, {'abstract': 'Miuccia Prada gave her audience a surprise this evening in Milan by casting several famous actors to walk in her runway show.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/15/prada-mens/', 'snippet': 'Miuccia Prada gave her audience a surprise this evening in Milan by casting several famous actors to walk in her runway show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Miuccia Prada, an intellectual designer who is not known for pursuing the baser side of fashion’s obsession with celebrities, gave her audience a surprise this evening in Milan by casting several famous actors to walk in her runway show. There was no real reason for this, a spokeswoman said, unless you considered that the theme of the show involved “the comings and goings of players and power.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Red Carpet at Prada', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T00:11:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac7e96dd-26ba-5b01-bd54-990bf1f54894', 'word_count': 428, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac7e96dd-26ba-5b01-bd54-990bf1f54894'}, {'abstract': 'A slide show of images of fashion from the red carpet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/16/movies/awardsseason/20120116_REDCARPET.html', 'snippet': 'A slide show of images of fashion from the red carpet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A slide show of images of fashion from the red carpet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im