bstract': 'The crackdown comes amid other moves by the government to take over functions once performed by the United States military and to claim areas of the country it had controlled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/world/middleeast/asserting-its-sovereignty-iraq-detains-american-contractors.html', 'snippet': 'The crackdown comes amid other moves by the government to take over functions once performed by the United States military and to claim areas of the country it had controlled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — Iraqi authorities have detained a few hundred foreign contractors in recent weeks, industry officials say, including many Americans who work for the United States Embassy, in one of the first major signs of the Iraqi government’s asserting its sovereignty after the American troop withdrawal last month.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/world/JP-CONTRACTOR/JP-CONTRACTOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/16/world/JP-CONTRACTOR/JP-CONTRACTOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/16/world/JP-CONTRACTOR/JP-CONTRACTOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flexing Muscle, Baghdad Detains U.S. Contractors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flexing Muscle, Baghdad Detains U.S. Contractors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mercenaries and Private Military Contractors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value':