ine': 'Hoarding Is Seen as Cause Of Fuel Shortage in Egypt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rumors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shortages', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T04:47:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31948c6f-127b-53ff-b179-552540c2f17b', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31948c6f-127b-53ff-b179-552540c2f17b'}, {'abstract': 'Upsetting the Packers gave our traveling Giants fans a very good reason to celebrate in Wisconsin.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/eight-men-in-savoring-a-victory/', 'snippet': 'Upsetting the Packers gave our traveling Giants fans a very good reason to celebrate in Wisconsin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fifty years ago, if the Giants were headed to Green Bay to play the Packers in the postseason, fans in New York might have considered themselves lucky to catch the game on television. Today, with tickets available online and frequent-flier miles accruing with every credit-card purchase, fans can dare to dream a little more boldly. Six members of a Chatham, N.J., softball team — a mix of lawyers, Wall Streeters and computer software salesmen — traveled to Lambeau Field for Sunday’s showdown between the Giants and the Packers. It was a trip of cheap hotel rooms and high hopes, cramped rental cars and unexpectedly good seats at the game. They were joined by two pals in Milwaukee.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eight Men In: Savoring a Victory', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Bay Packers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lambeau Field', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T05:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Doug Chase', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Doug', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chase', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1dbcd31a-d4b4-5504-9362-2e0640cbc44c', 'word_count': 849, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1dbcd31a-d4b4-5504-9362-2e0640cbc44c'}, {'abstract': 'New research, led by a City University professor and financed in part by a union, found that only 3 in 10 nonunion retail workers received health insurance through their jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/nyregion/study-offers-a-look-at-new-yorks-retail-workers.html', 'snippet': 'New research, led by a City University professor and financed in part by a union, found that only 3 in 10 nonunion retail workers received health insurance through their jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Retail workers in New York City earn a median of $9.50 an hour, most are part-time or temporary, and just 3 in 10 receive health insurance through their jobs, according to a new study of the city’s larger retailers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Study of Retail Workers Finds $9.50 Median Pay', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Study of Retail Workers Finds $9.50 Median Pay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Part-Time Employment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Working Hours', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City University of New York', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T05:05:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Greenhouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Greenhouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22a5d7e3-3b02-55b7-9e89-57a9924b2368', 'word_count': 793, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22a5d7e3-3b02-55b7-9e89-57a9924b2368'}, {'abstract': 'Hosting his third Golden Globe Awards, Ricky Gervais delivered his usual venom-tipped jokes. The audience wasn’t that amused or that shocked, either.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/movies/awardsseason/naughty-business-as-usual-for-gervais-on-golden-globes.html', 'snippet': 'Hosting his third Golden Globe Awards, Ricky Gervais delivered his usual venom-tipped jokes. The audience wasn’t that amused or that shocked, either.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ricky Gervais was aske