an stars back to the island — from Roberto Clemente and Orlando Cepeda to Roberto Alomar and Bernie Williams — and they would regularly play before tens of thousands of fans during what was otherwise their off-season. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/sports/17puertorico3/17puertorico3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/sports/17puertorico3/17puertorico3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/17/sports/17puertorico3/17puertorico3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Puerto Rico Traces Baseball’s Slide to the Draft', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Decline of an Island Pastime', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puerto Ricans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T18:04:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jorge Castillo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jorge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castillo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'org