ir Limits, Recognized or Not', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Personal Best: Workouts Have Their Limits, Recognized or Not', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muscles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychology and Psychologists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Running', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T21:31:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Kolata', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kolata', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8dc26b8f-294e-51d0-afa3-2ae5ed729bdd', 'word_count': 980, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8dc26b8f-294e-51d0-afa3-2ae5ed729bdd'}, {'abstract': 'Are husbands who take a back seat to their wives’ careers still a man-bites-dog story?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/stay-at-home-fathers-arent-so-rare-anymore/', 'snippet': 'Are husbands who take a back seat to their wives’ careers still a man-bites-dog story?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The household stories in last week’s Bloomberg Businessweek are ordinary. Try not to nod off during the following quotation (in which I have made a few key changes):', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stay-at-Home Fathers Aren’t So Rare Anymore', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blodgett, Leslie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lepore, Daw