nzotti, founder of the luxury online retailer Vivre.com, believes people go out of their way to help travelers, and always seeks out special places with the locals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALTHOUGH I really feel as if I’m part of a cattle herd every time I’m at the airport, I still love being on a plane. I don’t have to do anything if I don’t want to. When you work crazy hours, that time to do nothing is really precious.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/business/FLIER/FLIER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/business/FLIER/FLIER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/17/business/FLIER/FLIER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Silent on the Plane, but Chatty With the Locals', 'kicker': 'Frequent Flier', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Silent on the Plane, but Chatty With the Locals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T22:49:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eva Jeanbart-Lorenzotti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eva', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jeanbart-Lorenzotti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d452da9-3079-582d-8c6f-17527e399960', 'word_count': 608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d452da9-3079-582d-8c6f-17527e399960'}, {'abstract': 'After walking the runway at Donatella Versace’s “tough glamour” show, models watch themselves on television.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/16/at-versace-party-the-show-goes-on/', 'snippet': 'After walking the runway at Donatella Versace’s “tough glamour” show, models watch themselves on television.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — Donatella Versace organized a customary dinner party following her men’s fashion show in Milan on Monday night, inviting a few guests into the ornate apartment where Gianni Versace once resided, on the second floor of the company’s headquarters. Once the last of the models, who walked in a collection Ms. Versace called “tough glamour,” had changed into more casual Versace sportswear and made their way upstairs from the show, a man walked through the crowd telling them, “The show is about to start.” Hadn’t it just ended?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Versace Party, the Show Goes On', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Versace, Donatella', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Versace, Gianni, SpA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Milan (Italy)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-16T22:51:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e39a98f3-c596-5e1a-a73e-9df2e98ea71d', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e39a98f3-c596-5e1a-a73e-9df2e98ea71d'}, {'abstract': 'Full planes make it worthwhile to vie for priority seating and other preferential treatment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/business/looking-for-better-treatment-when-boarding-on-the-road.html', 'snippet': 'Full planes make it worthwhile to vie for priority seating and other preferential treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINCE the first of the year, I’ve had many conversations with business travelers who said they had made a last-minute trip in December to top off their miles flown for 2011 and qualify for renewal of some level of elite status for 2012. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/business/ROAD/ROAD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/business/ROAD/ROAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/17/business/ROAD/ROAD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Selling Boarding Perks to the Forlorn', 'kicker': 'On the Road', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Selling Boarding Perks To the Forlorn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frequent 