ondon Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Shots For Glory On Grass In England', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roddick, Andy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T11:54:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Clarey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clarey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ded2c58-a112-59df-a207-8f1733051bf5', 'word_count': 1424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ded2c58-a112-59df-a207-8f1733051bf5'}, {'abstract': 'If you have never been to Bi-Rite Market, does this site make you want to go?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/with-redesign-a-special-retailer-tries-to-create-an-equally-special-web-site/', 'snippet': 'If you have never been to Bi-Rite Market, does this site make you want to go?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bi-Rite Market is something of an institution in San Francisco. A grocery store with a huge and faithful following, it doesn’t see itself as just a grocery store. People actually line up on the street to get inside. The reviews for the store on Yelp are overwhelmingly positive. The homepage on the store’s Web site proclaims, “Bi-Rite is a neighborhood market, feeding our community with love, passion & integrity.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Redesign, a Special Retailer Tries to Create an Equally Special Web Site', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Redesign, a Special Retailer Tries to Create a Special Web Site', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T12:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabriel Shaoolian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabriel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shaoolian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/824a72d7-35a9-5fea-9e4c-5ea4dbf8a403', 'word_count': 954, 'uri': 'nyt://article/824a72d7-35a9-5fea-9e4c-5ea4dbf8a403'}, {'abstract': 'The Butler Bulldogs made it to the national championship game in each of the past two seasons. But getting to the tournament this year looks to be a challenge.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/for-butler-a-slow-start/', 'snippet': 'The Butler Bulldogs made it to the national championship game in each of the past two seasons. But getting to the tournament this year looks to be a challenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2010 and 2011, the Butler Bulldogs were college basketball’s favorite Cinderella story. But this season has been a struggle. Matt Rhinesmith, a sports reporter for The Butler Collegian, will file occasional posts for The Quad about the team’s efforts to return to the N.C.A.A. tournament.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Butler, a Slow Start', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayward, Gordon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howard, Matt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mack, Shelvin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Andrew', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevens, Brad', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ball State University', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Butler University', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland State University', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gonzaga University', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hinkle Fieldhouse', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Purdue University', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Evansville', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Louisville', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Wisconsin-Green Bay', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Wisconsin-Milwaukee', 'rank': 18, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Xavier University of Ohio', 'rank': 19, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T12:00:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subse