rd_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d455e943-ce5c-513d-bf74-3e4d0792e566'}, {'abstract': 'A report released Tuesday said that Olympus’s executives had so cleverly buried losses that the company’s external auditors could not have uncovered them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/business/global/auditors-not-involved-in-cover-up-olympus-says.html', 'snippet': 'A report released Tuesday said that Olympus’s executives had so cleverly buried losses that the company’s external auditors could not have uncovered them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Olympus, the Japanese camera maker whose executives have admitted to covering up $1.7 billion in losses, said Tuesday that its auditors, KPMG Azsa and Ernst & Young ShinNihon, had not been complicit in the false accounting — though those firms remain under investigation by the Japanese authorities over possible roles in the scandal. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/business/OLYMPUS/OLYMPUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/18/business/OLYMPUS/OLYMPUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/business/OLYMPUS/OLYMPUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Olympus Clears Auditors in an Accounting Cover-Up', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Olympus Clears Auditors In an Accounting Cover-Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'KPMG', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ERNST & YOUNG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value':