17/red-wings-sabres-go-in-different-directions/', 'snippet': 'The Red Wings notched a 15th straight home win at the expense of a Sabres team headed in the other direction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The contrast couldn’t have been more striking on Monday evening: the Detroit Red Wings, streaking to a 15th-straight win at Joe Louis Arena, and the Buffalo Sabres continuing to slump to new depths. The Red Wings crushed the Sabres, 5-0, thanks to a flurry of three first-period goals.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Wings and Sabres Go in Different Directions', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Datsyuk, Pavel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lidstrom, Nicklas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Ryan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pegula, Terry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buffalo Sabres', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Red Wings', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T18:40:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne C. Gerstner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Gerstner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/961d2f92-5ca3-5a2e-ae40-33a0159c600f', 'word_count': 791, 'uri': 'nyt://article/961d2f92-5ca3-5a2e-ae40-33a0159c600f'}, {'abstract': 'Nathan Myhrvold, co-author of “Modernist Cuisine,” and Melissa Clark infuse celery sticks with gin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000001264211/in-the-kitchen-with-na