r suit service. With today’s casual lifestyle and the sagging global economy, is the market there for high-...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alexander McQueen is dead but not gone. True to its corset-and-drama heritage, the brand is teaming with the traditional Savile Row tailor Huntsman to create a made-to-order suit service. The designer Sarah Burton announced the move in Milan during the men’s wear autumn 2012 season, writes Suzy Menkes, the IHT fashion editor, where the tilt in men’s fashion toward formal and evening wear is being confirmed every day. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Too Dandy for Tough Times — Or Is Couture the Cure?', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burton, Sarah', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McQueen, Alexander', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Menkes, Suzy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Milan (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T19:28:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rendezvous', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rendezvous', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/19f74c44-274e-53b2-bd6d-fb96956ffe18', 'word_count': 168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19f74c44-274e-53b2-bd6d-fb96956ffe18'}, {'abstract': 'January 17, 2012 — Wikipedia and other Web sites plan Wednesday blackouts to protest two Congressional web piracy bills.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/media/100000001291898/media-decoder--web-sites-to-go-dark.html', 'snippet': 'January 17, 2012 — Wikipedia and other Web sit