 obesity rates for adults and children in the United States have remained largely unchanged during the past 12 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After two decades of steady increases, obesity rates in adults and children in the United States have remained largely unchanged during the past 12 years, a finding that suggests national efforts at promoting healthful eating and exercise are having little effect on the overweight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obesity Rates Stall, But No Decline', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defying Explanation, Obesity Rates Stall in U.S. but Stay Stubbornly High', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weight', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T20:33:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Parker-Pope', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b48c79d7-afe2-50d2-a6ea-ee83e45ca60a', 'word_count': 490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b48c79d7-afe2-50d2-a6ea-ee83e45ca60a'}, {'abstract': 'Legal action was taken against three measures that critics contend are part of an antidemocratic trend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/world/europe/hungary-is-pressed-on-democracy.html', 'snippet': 'Legal action was taken against three meas