yt://article/7e0fcb09-582c-58cc-8779-b2aaadaa7a83', 'word_count': 159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e0fcb09-582c-58cc-8779-b2aaadaa7a83'}, {'abstract': 'A behind-the-scenes video offers more clues about Billy Crystal’s approach to hosting the Oscars. Surprise: There will be some celebrating of movies.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/billy-crystals-oscar-reunion/', 'snippet': 'A behind-the-scenes video offers more clues about Billy Crystal’s approach to hosting the Oscars. Surprise: There will be some celebrating of movies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If anyone was still wondering whether this year’s Oscar telecast, hosted by Billy Crystal, would be something of a nostalgia-fest, the answer is as certain and as dependably comforting, as a Betty White birthday joke. In a new behind-the-scenes video released by the Academy, Mr. Crystal ruminates on the pressure of returning to host – “there’s so much expected of this,” he says – and, though he wouldn’t reveal anything about his opening monologue (“a magician never tells his tricks”) he did offer some spoilers about the direction of the program. “I think that’s going to be a theme of the evening – how did you fall in love with movies?” he says. “It’s a common experience we all have. We have to celebrate that more.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Billy Crystal’s Oscar Reunion', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crystal, Billy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Betty', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T21:03:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5604c745-3f16-5ad1-8f41-55443fccf373', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5604c745-3f16-5ad1-8f41-55443fccf373'}, {'abstract': 'A ruling by a federal judge against the Madoff trustee makes it appear likely that a lawsuit seeking money from the owners of the Mets will move to a jury trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/sports/baseball/judge-rejects-bid-by-madoff-trustee-to-appeal-ruling.html', 'snippet': 'A ruling by a federal judge against the Madoff trustee makes it appear likely that a lawsuit seeking money from the owners of the Mets will move to a jury trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Judge Jed S. Rakoff’s ruling on Tuesday was full of case citations, legal reasoning, a Yogi Berra quotation and a reference to the hijacked Achille Lauro cruise ship.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/18mets1/18mets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/18mets1/18mets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/18mets1/18mets1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Owners Can Look Forward to Trial During Spring Training', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Owners Can Look Forward To Trial During Spring Training', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Picard, Irving H', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madoff, Bernard L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rakoff, Jed S', 'rank': 3, 'major