hip might grab the front of his sport coat to keep it from flapping open and revealing the pistol. Someone getting out of a cab might hold tight to his side, to keep a weapon secure.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Working on Technology to Detect Concealed Guns', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lieberman, Donna', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T21:39:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/006dd5c3-bde8-5e8c-97b0-dce7c7298725', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/006dd5c3-bde8-5e8c-97b0-dce7c7298725'}, {'abstract': 'The long title of the play: “The London Merchant, or the History of George Barnwell.” The short review: excellent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/theater/reviews/the-london-merchant-an-18th-century-gem-review.html', 'snippet': 'The long title of the play: “The London Merchant, or the History of George Barnwell.” The short review: excellent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The long title of the play: “The London Merchant, or the History of George Barnwell.” The short review: excellent. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank