cour the Web important and peculiar items. Tuesday’s selection includes a cartoon about AC adapter collecting and the new ailment “text neck.”', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/todays-scuttlebot-a-c-adapters-and-watching-out-for-text-neck/', 'snippet': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web important and peculiar items. Tuesday’s selection includes a cartoon about AC adapter collecting and the new ailment “text neck.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Interesting things that reporters and editors for The New York Times found on the Web on Tuesday. Find more Scuttlebot items here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot:  AC Adapters, and Watching Out for ‘Text Neck’', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T22:44:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/efdcef17-39f3-59de-b4cf-4fcc78abd976', 'word_count': 204, 'uri': 'nyt://article/efdcef17-39f3-59de-b4cf-4fcc78abd976'}, {'abstract': 'Frederick Wiseman’s documentary “Crazy Horse” is a behind-the-scenes look at how seriously the famous Paris erotic revue takes itself as an artistic endeavor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/movies/crazy-horse-by-frederick-wiseman-review.html', 'snippet': 'Frederick Wiseman’s documentary “Crazy Horse” is a behind-the-scenes look at how seriously the famous Paris erotic revue takes itself as an artistic endeavor.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Crazy Horse,” Frederick Wiseman’s new documentary, invites the viewer to contemplate the intricacies of the creative process, the daily rhythms of a complex organization and the tensions between artistic ambition and practicality — and also to look at very beautiful women wearing very little. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/arts/CRAZY/CRAZY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/18/arts/CRAZY/CRAZY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/arts/CRAZY/CRAZY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 865, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/arts/CRAZY/CRAZY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/18/arts/CRAZY/CRAZY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Agony Behind an Erotic Club’s Ecstasy', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Crazy Horse'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Agony Behind an Erotic Club’s Ecstasy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wiseman, Frederick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T22:49:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce81ac39-4a3c-5023-b166-147fa9c0a54b', 'word_count': 720, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce81ac39-4a3c-5023-b166-147fa9c0a54b'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney’s 15 percent effective tax rate appears to indicate that his income is largely from capital gains, but in the absence of his tax return, it is difficult to say.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/capital-gains-romney-and-the-1/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney’s 15 percent effective tax rate appears to indicate that his income is largely from capital gains, but in the absence of his tax return, it is difficult to say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few aspects of the division between the 1 percent and the 99 percent have proven so divisive as the fact that the rich often pay a lower tax rate than everybody else. That is because the top federal tax rate on capital gains income is 15 percent, compared with a top marginal tax rate of 35 percent on other taxable income, like wages and salaries, that exceeds $380,000 a year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Capital Gains: Romney and the 1%', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_