'snippet': 'Four video demonstrations of simple techniques from “Modernist Cuisine.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the modernist cooking techniques that Nathan Myhrvold showed me for this week’s column seem a lot more confusing than they actually are — at least if you’ve never, say, cooked salmon using fake sous vide before. These four short videos help illustrate the methods. And it’s instructive to hear Mr. Myhrvold talk about the recipes, explaining some of the finer points in more depth than in a written recipe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kitchen Modernism With Nathan Myhrvold', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-17T23:41:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea8a04b4-c9e3-5535-be13-9eab3a58a7c5', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea8a04b4-c9e3-5535-be13-9eab3a58a7c5'}, {'abstract': 'A developer received a permit from one city agency for a building project, hours before another city agency took an emergency vote to try to stop the project.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/designation-of-historic-district-in-east-village-wont-stop-project/', 'snippet': 'A developer received a permit from one city agency for a building project, hours before another city agency took an emergency vote to try to stop the project.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It seems like a classic case of closing the barn door after the horses have gotten out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Designation of Historic District in East Village Won’t Stop P