3a31'}, {'abstract': 'A little over a month after news broke that Ryan Braun had a positive drug test, he will receive the National League Most Valuable Player award at a dinner Saturday in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/sports/baseball/braun-to-accept-mvp-award-in-wake-of-positive-drug-test.html', 'snippet': 'A little over a month after news broke that Ryan Braun had a positive drug test, he will receive the National League Most Valuable Player award at a dinner Saturday in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At some point Saturday evening, hundreds of baseball fans, players, officials and members of the news media will sit in rapt attention as Ryan Braun approaches the podium to make a short speech at the Hilton in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/BRAUN/BRAUN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/BRAUN/BRAUN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/BRAUN/BRAUN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/BRAUN/BRAUN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/18/sports/BRAUN/BRAUN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Braun, Amid Drug Furor, to Attend Awards Dinner', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Despite Positive Drug Test, Braun Will Accept Award', 'name': None, 'seo': None,