 stars of the reality television show “19 and Counting,” along with five of their 19 children and two grandchildren.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/17/duggars-are-suprise-guests-at-santorum-event/', 'snippet': 'The crowd at a Fuddruckers in Anderson, S.C., gasped audibly when out came Jim Bob and Michelle Duggar, the stars of the reality television show “19 and Counting,” along with five of their 19 children and two grandchildren.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANDERSON, S.C. — The two speakers who introduced Rick Santorum to the overflow crowd at a Fuddruckers here both proudly described their seven children as blessings — a popular sentiment in a gathering that was heavy with people who call themselves pro-life Christians. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Duggars Are Surprise Guests at Santorum Event', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T03:24:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Eckholm', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eckholm', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1b8ccc1c-73b2-5a01-bae5-22a81a006e65', 'word_count': 334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b8ccc1c-73b2-5a01-bae5-22a81a006e65'}, {'abstract': 'Henrik Lundqvist stopped 27 shots, and James L. Dolan showed up to praise the organization and General Manager Glen Sather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/sports/hockey/nhl-roundup.html', 'snip