s dirty, in the belief that it heightens the sensual connection to food and softens the formality of fine dining.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mind Your Manners: Eat With Your Hands', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tableware', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sahni, Julie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Culver City (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T10:55:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec823c7a-3d17-5aa4-9334-080bee85c9e6', 'word_count': 209, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec823c7a-3d17-5aa4-9334-080bee85c9e6'}, {'abstract': 'Forty-six sites participated in the rankings accuracy challenge run in conjunction with the Fantasy Sports Trade Association.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/fantasy-football-accuracy-rankings-for-2011/', 'snippet': 'Forty-six sites participated in the rankings accuracy challenge run in conjunction with the Fantasy Sports Trade Association.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sara Holladay is the Fantasy Football Librarian.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fantasy Football Accuracy Rankings for 2011', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fantasy Sports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T11:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 