ey shows that a vast majority of Americans want Democrats and Republicans to cooperate to break partisan gridlock.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/g-o-p-in-congress-get-blame-for-gridlock/', 'snippet': 'The latest New York Times/CBS News survey shows that a vast majority of Americans want Democrats and Republicans to cooperate to break partisan gridlock.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The public is not assigning blame equally between President Obama and Republicans in Congress for the partisan gridlock over key legislation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.O.P. in Congress Gets Blame for Gridlock', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T13:15:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marjorie Connelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marjorie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Connelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cecb87e0-9f08-5cc6-b1f3-b99e2ac196e9', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cecb87e0-9f08-5cc6-b1f3-b99e2ac196e9'}, {'abstract': 'The Huffington Post has named Anne Sinclair, the wife of Dominique Strauss-Kahn, the former managing director of the International Monetary Fund, as editor of its French edition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/business/media/anne-sinclair-editor-huffington-post-france.html', 'snippet': 'The Huffington Post has named Anne Sinclair, the wife of Dominique Strauss-Kahn, the former managing director of the International Monetary Fund, as editor of its French edition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The French journalist Anne Sinclair, who is married to the former managing director of the International Monetary Fund, Dominique Strauss-Kahn, has been chosen to edit the French edition of The Huffington Post, the news Web site, which is being set up in partnership with the newspaper Le Monde. \xa0', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/business/Sinclair/Sinclair-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/business/Sinclair/Sinclair-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/19/business/Sinclair/Sinclair-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Strauss-Kahn’s Wife to Edit Huffington Post in France', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'TV Personality in France To Lead a Huffington Site', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huffington, Arianna', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Huffington Post', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sinclair, Anne', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strauss-Kahn, Dominique', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Le Monde', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18