ate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rivals and Supporters Urge Romney to Release Tax Data', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T16:59:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ea31cb7-fd1a-5fe2-97a4-639997a81d6f', 'word_count': 500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ea31cb7-fd1a-5fe2-97a4-639997a81d6f'}, {'abstract': 'Kenneth Branagh says being seated next to Meryl Streep has been the best perk of the awards season so far, but adds that he was literally tongue-tied, so much does he admire her.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/kenneth-branagh-star-struck/', 'snippet': 'Kenneth Branagh says being seated next to Meryl Streep has been the best perk of the awards season so far, but adds that he was literally tongue-tied, so much does he admire her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bagger doesn’t like to play favorites – at least not yet. That comes later, when we’re trying to win our Oscar pool. But every awards season there are a few people who seem to rise above the hype machine and have engaging conversations that keep everything in perspective. (Shouts to our girl Michelle Williams.) This year the Bagger has found a new gimlet conversationalist in Kenneth Branagh, Ms. Williams’s co-star in “My Week With Marilyn.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kenneth Branagh, Star-Struck', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Branagh, Kenneth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monroe, Marilyn', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olivier, Laurence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Plummer, Christopher', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Streep, Meryl', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weinstein, Harvey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'WILLIAMS, MICHELLE', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T17:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c904bfd3-a22e-5ffe-9de8-374da1f5adae', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c904bfd3-a22e-5ffe-9de8-374da1f5adae'}, {'abstract': 'Erin Callan, the former chief financial officer of Lehman Brothers who all but disappeared from Wall Street after the firm’s collapse, was married late last year.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/for-callan-life-after-lehman-includes-a-new-husband/', 'sni