ea-is-tottering-says-kims-eldest-son/', 'snippet': 'The eldest of Kim Jong-il’s three sons believes the despotic North Korean regime is vulnerable to collapse, according to a new book by a Tokyo-based journalist. The son, Kim Jong-nam, who lives primarily in the gambling enclave of Macao, also says...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The eldest of the late Kim Jong-il’s three sons believes the despotic North Korean regime is vulnerable to collapse, according to a new book by a Tokyo-based journalist. Kim Jong-nam, who lives primarily in the gambling enclave of Macao, also says the late leader’s youngest son, and North Korea’s new leader, Kim Jong-un, is simply a figurehead. Their father died Dec. 17 at the age of 69. Read the full story from The Associated Press»', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Regime in North Korea is Tottering, Says Kim’s Eldest Son', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T17:07:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark McDonald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McDonald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed1f2148-81b5-51cd-9121-57b73dd124f7', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed1f2148-81b5-51cd-9121-57b73dd124f7'}, {'abstract': 'By the time the fall men’s collections came to a close, there was a feeling of having just visited the zoo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/fashion/in-milan-a-zoo-roams-large.html', 'snippet': 'By the time the fall men’s collections came to a close, there was a feeling of having just visited the zoo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 's