anderson-efficiency-experts/', 'snippet': 'Chris Bosh and Ryan Anderson do not create shots like Derrick Rose and Kobe Bryant do, but they should be recognized as impressive, efficient scorers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shot creation has long been crucial to ascendancy as a premier scorer, but Michael Jordan’s eminence brought that particular skill to unprecedented heights. Jordan revolutionized one-on-one play with his electricity; one of his many enduring legacies is the way scorers are perceived and evaluated today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bosh and Anderson, Efficiency Experts', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T21:08:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By ROB MAHONEY', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MAHONEY', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c506699c-cfd2-547b-9e2b-b1f19a6be48b', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c506699c-cfd2-547b-9e2b-b1f19a6be48b'}, {'abstract': 'Goodbye, lip liners, brow pencils, spackled-on foundations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/19/fashion/2012-0119-SKIN.html', 'snippet': 'Goodbye, lip liners, brow pencils, spackled-on foundations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Goodbye, lip liners, brow pencils, spackled-on foundations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/2012-0119-SKIN-slide-91SJ/2012-0119-SKIN-slide-91SJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cred