ited-live-on-fox/', 'snippet': 'The Fox network will, for the first time, carry an Premier League match live when Manchester United visits Arsenal on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Football Sunday on the Fox network has got a bit more interesting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arsenal-Manchester United Live on Fox', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arsenal (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T21:24:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2771c64-4b6d-509b-a283-023fa8457925', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2771c64-4b6d-509b-a283-023fa8457925'}, {'abstract': 'A school for professional makeup artists opens in New York; help for the dry skin of winter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/fashion/new-products-beauty-spots.html', 'snippet': 'A school for professional makeup artists opens in New York; help for the dry skin of winter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEAUTY SCHOOL START-UP Frustrated with YouTube makeup tutorials? Here’s a more hands-on option: the Make Up for Ever Academy. The company has branches in Paris (where its headquarters are); Nice, France; Hong Kong, and Beirut. A school in Union Square (above), which opened this month, is its first in North America. That one includes a lecture room with individual stations and a photo studio. Three makeup courses are available: Beauty-Fashion, Television-Film and Stage-Artistic (a seven-week program costs $4,450). Apply at makeupforeverusa.com/mufe/academy/.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/19SPOT1_SPAN/19SPOT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/19SPOT1_SPAN/19SPOT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/19SPOT1_SPAN/19ZSPOT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/19SPOT1_SPAN/19SPOT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/19/fashion/19SPOT1_SPAN/19SPOT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beauty Spots', 'kicker': 'Skin Deep', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Beauty Spots', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nails (Body Part)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T21:25:25+0000', 'document_type': 'articl