w York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bloomberg Says He Pays Highest Tax Rate and Opposes Hedge Fund Break', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bain Capital', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-18T22:16:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81914326-34bf-5a10-b253-80233448ba58', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81914326-34bf-5a10-b253-80233448ba58'}, {'abstract': 'A traditional house in Fez, built around a tiled courtyard, offers 6,500 square feet of refurbished space ideal for use as a guesthouse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/17/greathomesanddestinations/20120122IHHMorocco.html', 'snippet': 'A traditional house in Fez, built around a tiled courtyard, offers 6,500 square feet of refurbished space ideal for use as a guesthouse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A traditional house in Fez, built around a tiled courtyard, offers 6,500 square feet of refurbished space ideal for use as a guesthouse.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/17/greathomesanddestinations/20110122IHHMorocco-slide-6QBN/20110122IHHMoroc