ject', 'value': 'Energy and Power', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind Power', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kanter, James', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Sea', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T04:55:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rendezvous', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rendezvous', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55a8d915-2c7b-50ec-b020-c7e6549fe026', 'word_count': 252, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55a8d915-2c7b-50ec-b020-c7e6549fe026'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/18/news-quiz-jan-19-2012/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries in today’s paper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | Jan. 19, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T04:57:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tiffany Frasier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tiffany', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Frasier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87439eb5-c4a7-5f0e-80ae-c029dd1afda3', 'word_count': 20, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87439eb5-c4a7-5f0e-80ae-c029dd1afda3'}, {'abstract': 'For the third straight session, Gov. Susana Martinez of New Mexico will be pushing to repeal a nearly decade-old law that allows illegal immigrants to obtain driver’s licenses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/us/in-new-mexico-a-fight-anew-over-drivers-licenses-for-illegal-immigrants.html', 'snippet': 'For the third straight session, Gov. Susana Martinez of New Mexico will be pushing to repeal a nearly decade-old law that allows illegal immigrants to obtain driver’s licenses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANTA FE, N.M. — It is legislative season in New Mexico, which means it is time once again to debate whether illegal immigrants should be granted driver’s licenses. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/us/NEW-MEXICO/NEW-MEXICO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/us/NEW-MEXICO/NEW-MEXICO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/19/us/NEW-MEXICO/NEW-MEXICO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Fight on Licenses for Illegal Immigrants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Fight On Licenses For Illegal Immigrants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martinez, Susana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Mexico', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T04:57:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Frosch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Frosch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/acb5709e-8d5e-547e-951f-7b9d1aba227c', 'word_count': 761, 'uri': 'nyt://article/acb5709e-8d5e-547e-951f-7b9d1aba227c'}, {'abstract': 'Predicting a patient’s life expectancy, once an essential part of doctoring, remains a challenge for most doctors.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/why-doctors-cant-predict-how-long-a-patient-will-live/', 'snippet': 'Predicting a patient’s life expectancy, once an essential part of doctoring, remains a challenge for most doctors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Slender, in her 60s and possessing the stoicism of someone who had single-handedly raised children in the toughest section of the city, our patient faced a difficult challenge of the medical kind. She had diabetes and such severe peripheral vascular disease that even the strongest antibiotics could not heal a long-standing foot infection. She needed an operation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Doctors Can’t Predict How Long a Patient Will Live', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Longevity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T05:01:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pauline W. Chen, M.D', 'person': [{'firs