nippet': 'Brandman University is planning a bilingual education program to serve students who might otherwise miss out on a higher education.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pathway to higher education can be blocked for some would-be students because they are not proficient enough in English to succeed\xa0 in a traditional college. And as they grow older, they may find their opportunities further constrained by their lack of a degree.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A West Coast University Targets Spanish Speakers Struggling with English', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T11:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel E. Slotnik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Slotnik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26481b9b-a4a1-5c84-b82e-8d31aaa1e672', 'word_count': 560, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26481b9b-a4a1-5c84-b82e-8d31aaa1e672'}, {'abstract': 'Fiat intends to bring the supersized subcompact to in the United States next year.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/fiat-to-unveil-500-wagon-at-geneva-auto-show/', 'snippet': 'Fiat intends to bring the supersized subcompact to in the United States next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an interview with Bloomberg, Olivier François, the head of the Fiat brand, said that the Italian automaker would show a wagon variant of the 500 supermini at the Geneva auto show in March, which would go on sale in the United States next year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fiat to Unveil 500 Wagon at Geneva Auto Show', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': Non