stage area. He was surrounded by models wearing plastic covers, like tea cozies, over their suits and vicuna coats to keep them spotless for the runway. I snapped a few pictures because they looked at once so manly and ridiculous. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Kicks Off, With a Nod to a New York Artist', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Owens, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vuitton, Louis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T16:57:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52d1878d-9e16-59b0-b419-ac64213fa9b7', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52d1878d-9e16-59b0-b419-ac64213fa9b7'}, {'abstract': 'Since “The Ed Sullivan Show” the world of New York theater, on and off Broadway, has been a relatively minor player in prime-time television.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/arts/television/touches-of-broadway-in-glee-and-south-park.html', 'snippet': 'Since “The Ed Sullivan Show” the world of New York theater, on and off Broadway, has been a relatively minor player in prime-time television.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHATEVER happens with NBC’s “Smash,” theater lovers who also watch television are going to enjoy a feast of backstage and onstage dramatics. And that has been a rarity on the small screen.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 