sons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Ron', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Steve', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC News', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Make Us Great Again', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 17, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T19:19:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d45bd93a-ea4f-5d04-892a-aefa89e363ce', 'word_count': 1195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d45bd93a-ea4f-5d04-892a-aefa89e363ce'}, {'abstract': 'Magazines do profiles of TV and film stars, so why not profile celebrities on the, arguably, just as relevant medium of the Internet?', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/mike-obrien-is-famous-on-the-internet/', 'snippet': 'Magazines do profiles of TV and film stars, so why not profile celebrities on the, arguably, just as relevant medium of the Internet?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Magazines do profiles of TV and film stars, so why not profile celebrities on the, arguably, just as relevant medium of the Internet? Online, there exists a different set of A-Listers, whose work reaches an audience of millions and attracts rabid, devoted fans. And no one in the real world has any idea. Internet fame can be cultivated or unexpectedly backed into. It can lead to TV pilot deals, commercial work, merchandise sales, book agents and other tangible successes. It’s time these secret celebrities got introduced to the mainstream in “They’re Famous! (On the Internet).” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mike O’Brien Is Famous! (On the Internet)', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celebrities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T19:19:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gaby Dunn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gaby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dunn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0861e6a-038a-538c-b60b-2024ce46ba6f', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0861e6a-038a-538c-b60b-2024ce46ba6f'}, {'abstract': 'Get to know the host of “7 Minutes in Heaven.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/magazine/mike-obrien-7-minutes-in-heaven.html', 'snippet': 'Get to know the host of “7 Minutes in Heaven.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike O’Brien is what might be called Web nouveau: he’s earnest rather than snarky and seems genuinely baffled by meme culture. Yet O’Brien, who didn’t even have a Twitter account until September, has become famous — at least on the Internet — as the host of “7 Minutes in Heaven,” an extremely funny Web show based on the adolescent make-out game.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type