'nyt://article/7328af0a-28f8-5114-ae89-7db5f3745e96'}, {'abstract': 'SAS, the grandaddy of data mining and business intelligence companies, posts a double-digit revenue boost in 2011. The business of managing big data is booming, especially in retail and finance, but helping the government find cheaters is the best growth area.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/data-analytics-company-finds-fraud-is-a-friend/', 'snippet': 'SAS, the grandaddy of data mining and business intelligence companies, posts a double-digit revenue boost in 2011. The business of managing big data is booming, especially in retail and finance, but helping the government find cheaters is the best...', 'lead_paragraph': ' Crime detection pays.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/19/technology/19bits-sas/19bits-sas-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Data Analytics Company Finds Fraud Is a Friend', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T20:53:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7154f67d-0ba6-583e-8d34-16fdd6d15ecf', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7154f67d-0ba6-583e-8d34-16fdd6d15ecf'}, {'abstract': '“Modern Terrorism,” a new play by Jon Kern, has been selected for the 2012 Laurents/Hatcher Foundation Award, The playwright will receive $50,000 and an additional $100,000 will go to a theater for production costs to mount the work.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/19/laurentshatcher-playwriting-prize-goes-to-modern-terrorism/', 'snippet': '“Modern Terrorism,” a new play by Jon Kern, has been selected for the 2012 Laurents/Hatcher Foundation Award, The playwright will receive $50,000 and an additional $100,000 will go to a theater for production costs to mount the work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new play titled “Modern Terrorism” has been selected for the 2012 Laurents/Hatcher Foundation Award, a generous theater prize that provides $50,000 to the author – in this case, Jon Kern – and an additional $100,000 toward the production costs for the play’s premiere. Trustees for the foundation of the writer and director Arthur Laurents (“West Side Story,” “Gypsy”) and his partner of 52 years, Tom Hatcher, announced the selection of Mr. Kern on Thursday; he is a graduate of the Columbia University master’s program in playwriting as well as the University of Chicago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Laurents/Hatcher Playwriting Prize Goes to ‘Modern Terrorism’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hatcher, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Laurents, Arthur', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Talbott, Jeff', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'George Street Playhouse', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Laurents/Hatcher Foundation Award', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MCC Theater', 'rank': 8, 'majo