ector has sued the dealer Larry Gagosian, claiming that he sold a 1964 Roy Lichtenstein painting from her collection without her consent. The suit, filed Wednesday in state court in Manhattan, is part of a tangle of art deals that led to two earlier lawsuits against the dealer in federal court, one of which Mr. Gagosian settled for $4.4 million last year, according to court papers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gagosian Sued for Selling Lichtenstein Painting Without Owner’s Consent', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cowles, Charles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gagosian, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lichtenstein, Roy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T21:20:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6ac6b8d-4e62-5431-8cae-6394f07dceac', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6ac6b8d-4e62-5431-8cae-6394f07dceac'}, {'abstract': 'The Burmese military’s offensive against the Kachin in northern Myanmar is raising human rights concerns among American officials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/world/asia/ethnic-war-with-kachin-intensifies-in-myanmar-jeopardizing-united-states-ties.html', 'snippet': 'The Burmese military’s offensive against the Kachin in northern Myanmar is raising human rights concerns among American officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MAIJA YANG, Myanmar — Even as the Burmese government initiates political reforms in much of the country, it has intensified an ethnic civil war here in the resource-rich hills of northern Myanmar, a conflict that at once threatens its warming trend with the United States and could alienate Chinese officials concerned about stability on the border.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/asia/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/20/world/asia/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/asia/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/asia/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/20/world/asia/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH/myanmar_kachin-slide-C4AH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Ethnic War Is Rekindled in Myanmar', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Villagers Flee As Ethnic War Jars Myanmar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War and Guerrilla Warfare', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Perso