pressed PC sales, holding down the demand for chips.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/technology/intel-profit-up-6-in-quarter.html', 'snippet': 'Catastrophic flooding in Thailand depressed PC sales, holding down the demand for chips.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Intel’s profit rose only 6 percent in the fourth quarter, the company said Thursday, as the impact of last year’s catastrophic flooding in Thailand, which devastated hard-drive production, began to affect PC sales.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Profit Increases 6% at Intel', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Profit Increases 6% at Intel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Chips', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intel Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-19T21:28:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurie J. Flynn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Flynn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d18e7661-accb-53ca-8e41-37bc99006d09', 'word_count': 408, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d18e7661-accb-53ca-8e41-37bc99006d09'}, {'abstract': 'A selected guide to talks, walks, exhibitions, celebrations and other events in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/arts/spare-times-for-jan-20-26.html', 'snippet': 'A selected guide to talks, walks, exhibitions, celebrations and other events in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Around Town', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for J