o the Stop Online Piracy Act and the Protect Intellectual Property Act had the most to lose if it passed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/technology/public-outcry-over-antipiracy-bills-began-as-grass-roots-grumbling.html', 'snippet': 'It is no coincidence that the social sites with the loudest voices in opposition to the Stop Online Piracy Act and the Protect Intellectual Property Act had the most to lose if it passed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Wikipedia went dark and Google blacked out its logo on Wednesday, millions of people could not help but notice. For most, it was the first time that they had heard about two antipiracy bills. One puzzled Twitter user wrote: “Isn’t a SOPA some kind of food?” ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/business/Sopa/Sopa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/20/business/Sopa/Sopa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/business/Sopa/Sopa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/business/Sopa/Sopa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/20/business/Sopa/Sopa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Public Outcry Over Antipiracy Bills Began as Grass-Roots Grumbling', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Public Outcry Over Antipiracy Bills Began as Grass-Roots Grumbling: Many Voices on the Web, Amplifie