view of games on U.S. television Jan. 21-22 that involve American players in the U.S. national team pool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robbie Rogers has signed with Leeds United. George John is onboard with West Ham United. Tim Ream is on the verge of inking a deal with Bolton. And even Edson Buddle is trying to impress Everton during a weeklong trial with the Liverpool club.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend TV Guide, Jan. 21-22: Tracking U.S. Players', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Americans Abroad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buddle, Edson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donovan, Landon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howard, Tim', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ream, Tim', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whitbread, Zak', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'English Premier League', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'German Bundesliga', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T07:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Godfrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Godfrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62bdc474-a65c-5126-ab8e-7a9dd83019d4', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62bdc474-a65c-5126-ab8e-7a9dd83019d4'}, {'abstract': 'Can a great model inhabit the style of a designer without necessarily wearing the clothes? At noon, the curator Olivier Saillard may answer those and other questions when he presents “Models at Work,” a performance at the V & A in London.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/live-from-the-va-whats-in-a-pose/', 'snippet': 'Can a great model inhabit the style of a designer without necessarily wearing the clothes? At noon, the curator Olivier Saillard may answer those and other questions when he presents “Models at Work,” a performance at the V & A in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Can a great model inhabit the style of a designer without necessarily wearing the clothes? Do her gestures and poses reveal fashion’s magic, as surely as a great photographer does, and can those movements be isolated and set in motion in a different venue? On Friday, the curator Olivier Saillard may answer those and other questions when he presents “Models at Work,” a performance at the Victoria and Albert Museum in London, as part of its Fashion in Motion series. You can watch the live stream here at 12 p.m. The models will include Axelle Doué, Claudia Huidobro, Anne Rohart, Violeta Sanchez and Amalia Vairelli.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live From the V&A: What’s in a Pose?', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T07:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2591b72e-d435-59c7-815c-cb5119fcee7d', 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2591b72e-d435-59c7-815c-cb5119fcee7d'}, {'abstract': 'Ill will and mistrust run deep among civilians and militaries on both sides, raising questions about what future role the United States and its allies can expect to play in Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/world/asia/afghan-soldiers-step-up-killings-of-allied-forces.html', 'snippet': 'Ill will and mistrust run deep among civilians and militaries on both sides, raising questions about what future role the United States and its allies can expect to play in Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — American and other coalition forces here are being killed in increasing numbers by the very Afghan soldiers they fight alongside and train, in attacks motivated by deep-seated animosity between the supposedly allied forces, according to American and Afghan officers and a classified coalition report.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/jp-kabul1/jp-kabul1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/20/world/jp-kabul1/jp-kabul1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/jp-kabul1/jp-kabul1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/20/world/jp-kabul1/jp-kabul1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/20/world/jp-kabul1/jp-kabul1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghanistan’s Soldiers Step Up Killings of Allied Forces', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghan Soldiers Step Up Killings Of Allied Forces', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T07:01:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew Rosenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/229c86f3-15fd-5ce9-bafc-1902adeb77c3', 'word_count': 1509, 'uri': 'nyt://article/229c86f3-15fd-5ce9-bafc-1902adeb77c3'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/news-quiz-jan-20-2012/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries in today’s paper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | Jan. 20, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T07:41:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tiffany Frasier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tiffany', 'middlename