le/21e9a9f1-2de0-5199-9c91-56deadc4f758'}, {'abstract': 'In criticizing a silly Chris Matthews comment, the president of the Media Research Center moves adroitly to unvarnished racism.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/brent-bozell-and-ghetto-crackheads/', 'snippet': 'In criticizing a silly Chris Matthews comment, the president of the Media Research Center moves adroitly to unvarnished racism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whenever I write about the undertones (and sometimes overtones) of race in American politics, I get a lot of critical emails and Tweets, some reasonable, some pretty nasty.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brent Bozell and Ghetto Crackheads', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matthews, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fox News Channel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T20:26:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8f50d54-5709-540f-a22b-9c638e6dc689', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8f50d54-5709-540f-a22b-9c638e6dc689'}, {'abstract': 'The effort consists of imposing a phased oil embargo on Iran and sanctions against dealing with Iran’s central bank to press Tehran into talks on its nuclear program.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/21/world/europe/european-union-planning-tough-sanctions-on-iran.html', 'snippet': 'The effort consists of imposing a phased oil embargo on Iran and sanctions against dealing with Iran’s central bank to press Tehran into talks on its nuclear program.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The European Union moved closer to imposing a phased oil embargo on Iran and some form of narrow sanctions against transactions with Iran’s central bank, European and French diplomats said on Friday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/21/world/IRAN/IRAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/21/world/IRAN/IRAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/21/world/IRAN/IRAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'European Union Moves Closer to Imposing Tough Sanctions on Iran', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Union Moves Closer to Imposing Tough Sanctions on Iran', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T20:26:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01fb90d0-7cc8-53d1-bfd6-0cd64c57c982', 'word_count': 1159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01fb90d0-7cc8-53d1-bfd6-0cd64c57c982'}, {'abstract': 'Crab salad with whatever crab is local.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/from-icy-waters-a-cold-weather-pleasure/', 'snippet': 'Crab salad with whatever crab is local.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This time of year, after a few weeks of post-holiday deprivation and perhaps a little too much foul weather, a bit of decadence may seem in order, at least for one meal. Why not treat yourself and your table mates to the one of the cold season’s treats, and indulge in a fresh crabmeat salad? In this week’s City Kitchen, we’re making a deviled crab salad with slightly bitter chicory greens and a lemony, mustardy dressing, suitable for a fine first course or weekend lunch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Icy Waters, a Cold-Weather Pleasure', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crabs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T20:35:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Tanis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/273fc68e-474b-52f8-a7c0-3d13145d8954', 'word_count': 150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/273fc68e-474b-52f8-a7c0-3d13145d8954'}, {'abstract': 'Government borrowing is still debt that must eventually be paid off, just as we were taught in introductory economics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/opinion/sunday/the-dangerous-notion-that-debt-doesnt-matter.html', 'snippet': 'Government borrowing is still debt that must eventually be paid off, just as we were taught in introductory economics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITH little fanfare, a dangerous notion has taken hold in progressive policy circles: that the amount of money borrowed by the federal government from Americans to finance its mammoth deficits doesn’t matter.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-jumbo-v4.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-superJumbo-v4.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contributor/rattner-contributor-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/10/04/opinion/rattner-contrib