, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c48b140-1408-5dcc-b2ba-6f2418fa75a4'}, {'abstract': 'The marijuana proponent Dana Beal, arrested in Wisconsin in 1971, is to return to prison there soon in another marijuana prosecution.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/20/a-yippie-on-familiar-turf-both-in-new-york-and-in-jail/', 'snippet': 'The marijuana proponent Dana Beal, arrested in Wisconsin in 1971, is to return to prison there soon in another marijuana prosecution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A jail stint and a heart attack have done nothing to temper the spirit of Dana Beal, who still has his bushy, General Custer-style mustache, his thick head of gray hair, and the activist streak that has defined his nearly half-century of marijuana activism and radical politics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Yippie on Familiar Turf, Both in New York and in Jail', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beal, Dana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-20T23:09:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/346dd1a1-94b0-51b4-ace8-3792b8636104', 'word_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/346dd1a1-94b0-51b4-ace8-3792b8636104'}, {'abstract': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important and peculiar items. Friday’s selection includes items on checking your cellphones at the dinner table, anticipating the next SOPA, an epic que