www.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/nyregion/violin-masters-tackle-brahms-bach-and-the-bard-at-purchase-college.html', 'snippet': 'Three leading practitioners of the violin, Guy Braunstein, David Douglass and Gil Shaham, will appear in concerts at the Performing Arts Center at Purchase College.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VIOLINISTS are hardly an unknown quantity on the Westchester County concert stage. But over the next month, three leading practitioners of the instrument will turn the Purchase College Performing Arts Center into a veritable violin mecca, presenting the music of Brahms, Bach and the Bard of Avon in concerts of varying scale, style and temperament.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/22ARTSWE4_SPAN/22ARTSWE4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/22ARTSWE4_SPAN/22ARTSWE4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/22ARTSWE4_SPAN/22ARTSWE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/22ARTSWE4_SPAN/22ARTSWE4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/22ARTSWE4_SPAN/22ARTSWE4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Violin Masters on Parade', 'kicker': 'Arts | Westchester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Violin Masters On Parade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organi