word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ad063fb-c6f1-585e-81a2-eef1036f5181'}, {'abstract': 'With control of the House of Representatives on the line in November, the Supreme Court added a further twist to a mapping controversy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/21/opinion/redistricting-in-texas.html', 'snippet': 'With control of the House of Representatives on the line in November, the Supreme Court added a further twist to a mapping controversy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a closely watched case about a redistricting battle in Texas, the Supreme Court on Friday issued a per curiam opinion that added a further twist in a rushed and messy controversy. In the unanimous ruling, the Supreme Court told a three-judge district court in San Antonio to put aside redistricting plans it created and devise new maps based on those made by the Texas Legislature. And this time, the Supreme Court said, the district court must do a better job of explaining any maps it draws. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Redistricting in Texas', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Redistricting in Texas', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Redistricting and Reapportionment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-21T02:19:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_