t the former Syracuse assistant basketball coach Bernie Fine, whom two former ball boys accuse of molesting them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man who accused the former Syracuse assistant basketball coach Bernie Fine of molesting him has withdrawn a civil suit against Fine after acknowledging that he lied and doctored e-mails in an attempt to bolster parts of his story. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accuser of Syracuse Coach Admits Doctoring E-Mails and Drops Civil Suit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Accuser of Syracuse Coach Admits Doctoring E-Mails and Drops Civil Suit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fine, Bernie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tomaselli, Zach', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Syracuse University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-21T03:31:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Thamel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thamel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4557f056-25ce-5765-8c5f-828e532bc148', 'word_count': 617, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4557f056-25ce-5765-8c5f-828e532bc148'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the background of the star 49ers linebacker Patrick Willis, who was raised by a struggling single father and than a foster father in western Tenness