ms “found” last week in the Missed Connections section on Craigslist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/nyregion/missed-connections-poetry-on-craigslist-under-the-influence.html', 'snippet': 'Intoxication’s influence on romance is a classic literary trope, ably demonstrated in these poems “found” last week in the Missed Connections section on Craigslist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A STRANGER across the bar, a glass in his or her hand, a wild fire in the eyes. What is it that draws us to drunk people? Their volubility? Their lack of inhibition? Or is it that — in a birds-of-a-feather sort of way — our would-be partner’s muddled state is so often a reflection of our own? Whatever the case, intoxication’s influence on romance is a classic literary trope, ably demonstrated in these poems “found” last week in the Missed Connections section of newyork.craigslist.org. They are printed verbatim, with only line and stanza breaks added; their titles are the subject headings.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inebriated Love', 'kicker': 'Poetic Connections | Drunk People', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inebriated Love', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Craigslist', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-21T05:17:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Feuer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2de39018-408d-59bd-