e-fielder-vast-talent-narrow-options.html', 'snippet': 'The productive and consistent Prince Fielder is still seeking a home in free agency, but his demands are murky and will probably have to be adjusted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is a standard negotiating tactic, an argument hard to beat on the surface. Player A is better than Player B. Therefore, Player A should make more money than Player B. Fill in the zeros, shake hands, sign the contract. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/22/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/22/sports/YKEPNER/YKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fielder’s Options Are as Narrow as His Talent Is Vast', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fielder’s Options Are as Narrow As His Talent Is Vast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Nationals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'