1-8cab-97eb7c75db99'}, {'abstract': 'Winds that exceeded 35 miles an hour forced organizers to suspend play in a tournament in the California desert.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/21/high-winds-delay-humana-challenge/', 'snippet': 'Winds that exceeded 35 miles an hour forced organizers to suspend play in a tournament in the California desert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LA QUINTA, Calif. — In his first competitive round since 1995, former President Bill Clinton broke 70, but only with a huge assist from Mother Nature. Clinton had completed nine holes at the Palmer course at PGA West when play at the Humana Challenge on Saturday was suspended because of high winds that toppled trees, turned portable toilets into projectiles and caused a giant scoreboard to take a dive into the lake along the 18th green at the Palmer course.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'High Winds Delay Humana Challenge', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Slugger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Humana Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'PGA Tour Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-21T23:58:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06b2dc