imes.com/2012/01/22/nyregion/pilar-montero-bar-owner-and-link-to-brooklyns-seafaring-past-dies-at-90.html', 'snippet': 'When Mrs. Montero opened a bar with her husband in 1945, it was one of a dozen similar establishments. But when dock traffic declined, only Montero’s kept its character.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pilar Montero spent most of her life in the little bar she owned near the waterfront in Brooklyn with her husband, or around the corner in the apartment where they reared their children. But Mrs. Montero saw the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/dog-MONTERO-obit/dog-MONTERO-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/dog-MONTERO-obit/dog-MONTERO-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/22/nyregion/dog-MONTERO-obit/dog-MONTERO-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pilar Montero, Bar Owner and Link to a Seafaring Past, Dies at 90', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pilar Montero, 90, Bar Owner And Link to a Seafaring Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-22T01:27:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', '