azine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin Tachman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tachman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5ce2308-37b0-5ca0-bdfb-52e50d35daa5', 'word_count': 33, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5ce2308-37b0-5ca0-bdfb-52e50d35daa5'}, {'abstract': 'We’re doing better than Europe.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/notes-on-deleveraging/', 'snippet': 'We’re doing better than Europe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new McKinsey Global Institute report on debt and deleveraging has attracted a lot of attention, and rightly so. I have some quibbles with the way the data are presented, but they’re very useful data — and lead to some surprising conclusions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Notes On Deleveraging', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-22T15:58:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0eeed4a-49c9-5b11-9052-4d769d95e9f0', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0eeed4a-49c9-5b11-9052-4d769d95e9f0'}, {'abstract': 'Li Na blew a major opportunity to win against Kim Clijsters, losing in three sets on Sunday at the Australian Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/sports/tennis/23iht-tennis23.html', 'snippet': 'Li Na blew a major opportunity to win against Kim Clijsters, losing in three sets on Sunday at the Australian Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MELBOURNE, Australia — The reassuring news on a mis