ich.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/in-national-polls-a-mixed-view-of-gingrich/', 'snippet': 'Some of the latest polls show that Republican voters nationwide are deeply divided in their views of Newt Gingrich.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About a week ago, the most recent national New York Times/CBS News poll showed that Republican voters were divided in their assessment of Newt Gingrich.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In National Polls, a Mixed View of Gingrich', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-22T16:16:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marjorie Connelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marjorie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Connelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eae1e228-0bfb-550c-a44e-2afcc550e708', 'word_count': 444, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eae1e228-0bfb-550c-a44e-2afcc550e708'}, {'abstract': 'Free speech and safety both considerations.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/22/at-jaipur-fest-difficult-balancing-act/', 'snippet': 'Free speech and safety both considerations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Controversy over Salman Rushdie’s invitation to the Jaipur Literature Festival and the public reading of his “The Satanic Verses” has forced organizers to walk a difficult path between championing free expression and keeping the festival safe and