City Ballet performed an all-Robbins program on Friday at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/arts/dance/city-ballet-focuses-on-robbins-at-koch-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'The New York City Ballet performed an all-Robbins program on Friday at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the curtain rises on Jerome Robbins’s “In G Major,” the first of three works on the “All Robbins” program performed by New York City Ballet on Friday at the David H. Koch Theater, the setting is simple but unmistakable. Stylized designs on the backdrop evoke sun, sea and sky. Young people gambol about in costumes resembling chic bathing wear. We’re at the French Riviera, between the wars. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/jp-memory/jp-memory-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 277, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/jp-memory/jp-memory-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 277}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/jp-memory/jp-memory-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 472, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/jp-memory/jp-memory-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/jp-memory/jp-memory-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Middle of Winter, a Sunny Day at the Beach, and Death’s Shadow', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Middle of Winter, a Sunny Day at the Beach, and 