 tribute to Cachao, the Cuban-born inventor of the mambo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/arts/music/cachao-tribute-by-carlos-henriquez-at-rose-theater-review.html', 'snippet': 'The bassist Carlos Henriquez’s paid tribute to Cachao, the Cuban-born inventor of the mambo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carlos Henriquez stood front and center with his bass throughout “The Music of Cachao,” Jazz at Lincoln Center’s tribute to the pioneering Cuban bassist and composer Israel Cachao López on Friday night at the Rose Theater. This was, as Mr. Henriquez noted with a chuckle in the concert’s second half, a departure from his usual station near the back of the stage. But it made perfect sense: the tumbaos that boomed from Mr. Henriquez’s bass, in patterns more or less invented by Cachao, gave the music its flexible spine — along with a strong heartbeat, steady in its syncopations. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/cachao/cachao-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/cachao/cachao-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/cachao/cachao-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/cachao/cachao-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/23/arts/cachao/cachao-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Veterans and Young Guns Pay Tribute to the Cuban Father of th