-adds-to-anguish-after-tumultuous-events-at-penn-state.html', 'snippet': 'The Penn State community went into a state of mourning after Joe Paterno, the football coach from 1966 until 2011, died Sunday morning from lung cancer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STATE COLLEGE, Pa. —\xa0 They crunched across the snow-blanketed campus Sunday to lay flowers at his statue, to gather for a candlelight vigil outside the Old Main administration building and to simply glance at his home while they walked past. Waves of students, alumni and fans were paying their respects to the man they knew as JoePa.\xa0', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/YNITTANY/YNITTANY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/YNITTANY/YNITTANY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/YNITTANY/YNITTANY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 859, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/YNITTANY/YNITTANY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/YNITTANY/YNITTANY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Tumultuous Events at Penn State, Death Adds to the Anguish', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Tumultuous Events at Penn State, Death Adds to the Anguish', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 