.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stem Cell Treatment for Eye Diseases Shows Promise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stem Cell Treatment for Eye Diseases Shows Promise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lancet, The (Journal)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stem Cells (Embryonic)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Macular Degeneration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clinical Trials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eyes and Eyesight', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T17:43:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f987c534-eba8-5c3a-9ede-e5e8ffd218d8', 'word_count': 853, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f987c534-eba8-5c3a-9ede-e5e8ffd218d8'}, {'abstract': 'There were swishing ponytails, smoky eyes, vertiginous heels and lots of sparkle at Versace’s couture collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/just-one-look-versace/', 'snippet': 'There were swishing ponytails, smoky eyes, vertiginous heels and lots of sparkle at Versace’s couture collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Atelier Versace, the haute couture division of the Italian house, showed for the first time since 2004 this morning at the Beaux Arts. It was a modest return — a presentation of 15 looks on a gold staircase to a standing audience — but very, very Versace: swishing ponytails, smoky eyes, vertiginous heels and lots of sparkle. Sculptural (“ergonomic”) aluminum bands defined the curves of delicate encrusted lace columns and minis. Here, a get-thee-to-a-red-carpet number in brazen persimmon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Versace', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Versace, Gianni, SpA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T17:45:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/211be6fc-5427-5a9e-a4ac-a80d30335acc', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/211be6fc-5427-5a9e-a4ac-a80d30335acc'}, {'abstract': 'Capt. Mark Kelly, the husband of a congresswoman who nearly died in an assassination attempt last year, will join Michelle Obama at Tuesday’s State of the Union speech.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/mark-kelly-to-join-first-lady-for-state-of-the-union/', 'snippet': 'Capt. Mark Kelly, the husband of a congresswoman who nearly died in an assassination attempt last year, will join Michelle Obama at Tuesday’s State of the Union speech.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Capt. Mark Kelly, the husband of Representative Gabrielle Giffords, will sit with Michelle Obama in the first lady’s box at Tuesday’s State of the Union speech, Jay Carney, the White House press secretary, said on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mark Kelly to Join First Lady for State of the Union', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State of the Union 