icle/b2ed0cd1-f4ea-58e6-9a31-65171eb80ce2', 'word_count': 75, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2ed0cd1-f4ea-58e6-9a31-65171eb80ce2'}, {'abstract': 'In the Couture edition of The Daily Shoe, T picks the most exquisite made-to-measures. Here, a made-to-order, curvaceous cut velvet beauty called the opium den.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/the-daily-shoe-roger-vivier/', 'snippet': 'In the Couture edition of The Daily Shoe, T picks the most exquisite made-to-measures. Here, a made-to-order, curvaceous cut velvet beauty called the opium den.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Couture edition of The Daily Shoe, T picks the most exquisite made-to-measures.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Daily Shoe | Roger Vivier', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T19:51:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ccb5f751-f788-5151-bba2-cf8222374ffa', 'word_count': 59, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccb5f751-f788-5151-bba2-cf8222374ffa'}, {'abstract': 'Disgust is having its moment in the light as researchers find that it does more than cause that sick feeling in the stomach. It protects human beings from disease and parasites, and affects almost every aspect of human relations, from romance to politics.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/gross-yuck-harnessing-the-power-of-disgust/', 'snippet': 'Disgust is having its moment in the light as researchers find that it does more than cause that sick feeling in the stomach. It protects human beings from disease and parasites, and affects almost every aspect of human relations, from romance to p...', 'lead_paragraph': 'You probably haven’t given much thought to the disgusting things in life. If anything, you try not to think about the things that gross you out. But among scientists, disgust is the new frontier of emotion research, as reported by James Gorman in today’s Science Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gross! Yuck! Harnessing the Power of Disgust', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T19:53:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Parker-Pope', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b4caea5-20ff-5fc0-b402-439b280f598c', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b4caea5-20ff-5fc0-b402-439b280f598c'}, {'abstract': 'A view of the day in sports, with pain on the handball court and pride on the soccer field.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/23/sports/20120123photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A view of the day in sports, with pain on the handball court and pride on the soccer field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A view of the day in sports, with pain on the handball court and pride on the soccer field.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/20120123photoreplay-slide-KHV3/20120123photoreplay-slide-KHV3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/sports/20120123photoreplay-slide-KHV3/20120123photoreplay-