, 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot: Questionable Piracy Numbers and an Android Guru', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T21:54:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cff0b5e-5ea5-5969-a216-0b71b4b92cf9', 'word_count': 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cff0b5e-5ea5-5969-a216-0b71b4b92cf9'}, {'abstract': 'Summarizing the legacy of Joe Paterno after his death is a complicated task.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/summing-up-the-paterno-legacy-its-complicated/', 'snippet': 'Summarizing the legacy of Joe Paterno after his death is a complicated task.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The death of Penn State’s former coach and icon Joe Paterno, at once stunning and yet unsurprising because of his age and ailments, came so quickly after the other end, the freefall from his career pedestal following the Jerry Sandusky scandal. It left little time to make sense of it all. Sandusky hasn’t even been tried yet for allegedly sexually abusing children on Paterno’s watch. The scandal’s history is still in the first-draft stage. And now to sum up the life of a venerated coach who was above reproach until it all came down at once?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Summing Up the Paterno Legacy: It’s Complicated', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coaches and Managers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jenkins, Sally', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paterno, Joe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reilly, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sandusky, Jerry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taliaferro, Adam', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania State University', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T21:55:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bda7439c-cce1-553c-bda0-8af80f5fb331', 'word_count': 538, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bda7439c-cce1-553c-bda0-8af80f5fb331'}, {'abstract': 'The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention calls fluoridation one of the 10 most valuable public health measures of the 20th century.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/dental-exam-went-well-thank-fluoride/', 'snippet': 'The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention calls fluoridation one of the 10 most valuable public health measures of the 20th century.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I admit to being jealous of my sons for growing up in a time when vaccines spared them miseries like the measles, mumps and polio scares that marred my childhood. But I’m most envious of their freedom from the dental decay that forced me to spend countless miserable hours with my mouth propped open while the dentist did his best to stay on top of rapidly rotting teeth.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dental Exam Went Well? Thank Fluoride', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fluorides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teeth and Dentistry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T21:57:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane E. Brody', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Brody', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/422ebbeb-cd34-588c-a434-ffd2be1d70aa', 'word_count': 1085, 'uri': 'nyt://article/422ebbeb-cd34-588c-a434-ffd2be1d70aa'}, {'abstract': 'Paris', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/23/fashion/runway-couture/giambattista-valli-spring-2012-couture.html', 'snippet': 'Paris', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/23/fashion/runway/0123vallicouture-slide-KI3C/0123vallicouture-slide-KI3C-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giambattista Valli: Spring 2012 Couture', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords