l take over the society that runs the Bronx, Central Park, Prospect Park and Queens Zoos.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/zoos-have-a-new-head-keeper/', 'snippet': 'Dr. Cristián Samper, director of the National Museum of Natural History, will take over the society that runs the Bronx, Central Park, Prospect Park and Queens Zoos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bronx Zoo and its cousins have a new head keeper. Cristián Samper, the director of the Smithsonian Institution’s National Museum of Natural History, will take over as president and C.E.O. of the Wildlife Conservation Society starting in August, the society announced on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Zoos Have a New Head Keeper', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Zoos', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Samper, Cristian', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bronx Zoo Wildlife Conservation Park', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Smithsonian Institution', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wildlife Conservation Society', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-23T23:14:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa0c38b4-bac0-5753-ad33-8d2e04b4592a', 'word_count': 159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa0c38b4-bac0-5753-ad33-8d2e04b4592a'}, {'abstract': 'Around the Web, awards watchers are weighing in with their predictions for Tuesday’s Oscar nominations.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/23/what-will-be-nominated-even-the-oscarologists-arent-entirely-sure/', 'snippet': 'Around the Web, awards watchers are weighi