, Mitt Romney was on the offensive for the first time in a series of G.O.P. debates, tearing into Newt Gingrich’s time as House speaker and the years when he advised companies like Freddie Mac.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/24/us/politics/romney-unleashes-attack-with-gingrich-sole-target.html', 'snippet': 'In Florida on Monday, Mitt Romney was on the offensive for the first time in a series of G.O.P. debates, tearing into Newt Gingrich’s time as House speaker and the years when he advised companies like Freddie Mac.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — Mitt Romney leveled a searing attack against Newt Gingrich’s character and raised pointed questions about his ability to lead during a debate here Monday evening, taking urgent steps to slow Mr. Gingrich’s rising momentum in the fight for the Republican presidential nomination.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/24/us/24debate1/24debate1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/24/us/24debate1/24debate1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/24/us/24debate1/24debate1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/24/us/24debate1/24debate1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/24/us/24debate1/24debate1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Unleashes Attack With Gingrich Sole Target', 'kicker': None, 'content_kick