r a stellar 17-year career had leaked out two weeks ago, so Tuesday’s event was not a surprise, but it was emotional nonetheless.', 'lead_paragraph': '8:15 p.m. | Updated In the latter innings of his career, Jorge Posada faced the painful but inevitable slide of an aging star. Younger and more productive players pushed him lower and lower down the batting order, ultimately resulting in the only real public feud he had with his team.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Posada, an Emotional Farewell', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Posada, Jorge', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-24T19:31:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e56b16dd-0832-5152-9afb-48dc880d9149', 'word_count': 839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e56b16dd-0832-5152-9afb-48dc880d9149'}, {'abstract': 'Paris', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/24/fashion/runway-couture/giorgio-armani-spring-2012-couture.html', 'snippet': 'Paris', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paris', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/24/fashion/runway/0124armani-slide-3H1Y/0124armani-slide-3H1Y-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Giorgio Armani: Spring 2012 Couture', 'ki