y full of high-priced commercials broken up by a football game. The company cautiously returned to a “Star Wars” theme.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/24/volkswagen-super-bowl-ad-has-a-tough-act-to-follow-last-years-ad/', 'snippet': 'The car company’s ad last year, called “The Force,” was considered the most successful on a day full of high-priced commercials broken up by a football game. The company cautiously returned to a “Star Wars” theme.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As popular as Volkswagen’s Super Bowl commercial was last year, with its “Star Wars” focus,\xa0 it was not a given that a Volkswagen spot this year would also pay tribute to the film and its characters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Volkswagen Super Bowl Ad Has a Tough Act to Follow: Last Year’s Ad', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen A.G', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-24T21:37:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a496d329-1df6-52af-8d51-fc819ac0d890', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a496d329-1df6-52af-8d51-fc819ac0d890'}, {'abstract': 'The director of a biosecurity center writes about the scientific debate over bird flu experiments. Readers are invited to respond.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/25/opinion/invitation-to-a-dialogue-research-and-its-risk