on a World Cup slalom on home soil Tuesday after being disqualified and fined at the last two slalom competitions for straddling gates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/25/sports/skiing/austrias-hirscher-wins-slalom-amid-allegations-of-cheating.html', 'snippet': 'Marcel Hirscher, 22, won a World Cup slalom on home soil Tuesday after being disqualified and fined at the last two slalom competitions for straddling gates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SCHLADMING, Austria — The annual ski-racing extravaganza known as Nightrace Schladming drew more than 40,000 fans to this small village Tuesday evening. They got to see one of their countrymen win the famed World Cup slalom competition under stadium lights, just as he is coming under intense criticism in a debate that is roiling the sport. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/SKI/SKI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/SKI/SKI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/SKI/SKI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 662, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/SKI/SKI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/SKI/SKI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Young Austrian, Victory Amid Allegations of Cheating', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Young Austrian, Victory Amid Allegations of Cheatin