nez. It was the winter after the 2004 season, and Ilitch, the owner of the Detroit Tigers, had presided over 209 losses in the past two years. In a meeting at a Miami country club, he told Ordonez, a star free agent, how badly he burned to win.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/KEPNER/KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stocking Up for a Title Run, the Tigers Buy in Bulk', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chasing A Title, The Tigers Buy in Bulk', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ordonez, Magglio', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Prince', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ilitch, Mike', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wage