}, {'abstract': 'The two Super Bowl coaches, Bill Belichick and Tom Coughlin, have a friendship that stretches back to their years as assistants with the Giants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/25/sports/football/for-belichick-fond-memories-of-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'The two Super Bowl coaches, Bill Belichick and Tom Coughlin, have a friendship that stretches back to their years as assistants with the Giants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOXBOROUGH, Mass. — Much as it was four years ago, when the New England Patriots and the Giants met in Super Bowl XLII, nostalgia will be a prime topic of conversation as Super Bowl XLVI approaches.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/25/sports/PATRIOTS/PATRIOTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Belichick, Fond Memories of New York (Giants, Not Jets)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the H.C. of the N.E.P., Fond Memories of New York (Giants, Not Jets)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coughlin, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belichick, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'