d_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c1090e7-3aa3-513f-8db8-ffe22e62d12d'}, {'abstract': 'In neighborhoods like Williamsburg and Bushwick, some men are twisting their long hair into a form more famously worn by librarians and Katharine Hepburn. Meet the man bun.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/fashion/in-brooklyn-committing-to-a-man-bun.html', 'snippet': 'In neighborhoods like Williamsburg and Bushwick, some men are twisting their long hair into a form more famously worn by librarians and Katharine Hepburn. Meet the man bun.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON a recent night at Hotel Delmano, a stylish speakeasy in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, the heavily tattooed head bartender, Sam Anderson, and his colleague, Michaelangelo Davis III, were shaking up cocktails with manly vigor. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/fashion/0126noticed/0126noticed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/26/fashion/0126noticed/0126noticed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/fashion/0126noticed/0126noticed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 898, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/fashion/0126noticed/0126noticed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/26/fashion/0126noticed/0126noticed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare a Hair Band? A Man Bun to Go', 'kicker': 'Noticed', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headli