medy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/arts/television/inside-comedy-and-russell-simmons-presents-the-ruckus.html', 'snippet': 'Two new shows, “Inside Comedy” and “Russell Simmons Presents The Ruckus,” use two different formats to explore the world of comedy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If it wasn’t a trend before, it certainly will become one on Thursday night with the premiere of “Inside Comedy” on Showtime. The business of being funny has spawned a cottage industry of comedians talking about the business of being funny. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/comedy/comedy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/comedy/comedy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/comedy/comedy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/comedy/comedy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/comedy/comedy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Take My Comedy Influences. Please.', 'kicker': 'Television Review | ‘Inside Comedy’ and ‘The Ruckus’', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Take My Comedy Influences. Please.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comedy Central', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simmons, Russell', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations