/25/books/yuri-rasovsky-radio-and-audio-book-dramatist-dies-at-67.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rasovsky was an award-winning maker of audio books and founder of the Hollywood Theater of the Ear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yuri Rasovsky, whose boyhood revelation that radio drama transcends the stage — because listeners must make imaginative leaps to “see” the action — propelled his career as a leading creator of radio plays and audio books, died on Jan. 18 at his home in Los Angeles. He was 67. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/RASOVSKY-obit/RASOVSKY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/25/arts/RASOVSKY-obit/RASOVSKY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yuri Rasovsky, Dramatist for the Ear, Is Dead at 67', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yuri Rasovsky, Dramatist For the Ear, Is Dead at 67', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Audiobooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-25T21:44:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3f459d9-2994-5c34-a1f8-bd38fd75f610', 'word_count': 674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3f459d9-2994-5c34-a1f8-bd38fd75f610'}, {'abstract': 'Too bad we can’t trust the fact-