rl': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/25/just-one-look-jean-paul-gaultier/', 'snippet': 'Gaultier’s catwalk included a variety of Amy Winehouse-inspired pencil skirts and boleros.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jean Paul Gaultier loves to flirt with bad taste. So was it at all surprising that his spring couture show was dedicated to the memory of Amy Winehouse? To a live doo-wop performance of “Rehab,” beehived models strutted the catwalk in an extraordinary variety of garments and looks — yes, Winehouse-inspired pencil skirts and boleros, but also an elegant draped evening gown in electric blue crepe and a fetishist’s corset dress in black and ivory satin. Here, a dress that proves that python, tulle, cabochon embroidery, roses and lace can — in the right mains — keep one from going back to black.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Jean Paul Gaultier', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-25T21:50:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sally Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sally', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6609a3c9-d0cb-5107-ba3e-b381da463160', 'word_count': 107, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6609a3c9-d0cb-5107-ba3e-b381da463160'}, {'abstract': 'The club opened last November above Bowlmor Lanes, is a monstrous shrine to frat culture and preppy nostalgia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/fashion/greenwich-village-country-club-in-greenwich-village-review.html', 'snippet': 'The club opened last November above Bowlmor Lanes, is a monstrous shrine to frat culture and preppy nostalgia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITH its adult kickball leagues and Craigslis