846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/006a0357-5d5e-5d98-bb19-4363b13cdaab'}, {'abstract': 'The leading Republicans appealed for the votes of South Florida’s Hispanic voters, with Mitt Romney and Newt Gingrich skirmishing over an advertisement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/us/politics/gingrich-says-he-will-end-ad-about-romney-immigration-stance.html', 'snippet': 'The leading Republicans appealed for the votes of South Florida’s Hispanic voters, with Mitt Romney and Newt Gingrich skirmishing over an advertisement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The leading Republican candidates spent Wednesday appealing for the votes of South Florida’s Hispanic voters, with the campaigns of Mitt Romney and Newt Gingrich skirmishing over an advertisement that branded Mr. Romney as anti-immigration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/us/alt-26campaign/alt-26campaign-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/26/us/alt-26campaign/alt-26campaign-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 314}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/us/alt-26campaign/alt-26campaign-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/26/us/alt-26campaign/alt-26campaign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/26/us/alt-26campaign/alt-26campaign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Candidates Scramble to Win Hispanic Votes in Florida', 'kicker': None, 'content_kick