ues from Amy Winehouse, evoking her chaotic essence in a marvelous show.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/jean-paul-gaultier-all-this-craziness/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Gaultier’s couture collection took cues from Amy Winehouse, evoking her chaotic essence in a marvelous show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several years back, in Paris, Fendi invited Amy Winehouse to sing at a party, and lots of people went and many more waited outside. I wedged myself into a corner near the small stage and just watched her go to work with that voice. On Wednesday, as the spring haute couture shows wound down, Jean Paul Gaultier evoked her chaotic essence in a marvelous show.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jean Paul Gaultier: All This Craziness', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Couture (Fashion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gaultier, Jean Paul', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winehouse, Amy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T05:43:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fdad884-b1f1-5710-9225-c28d08f25e91', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fdad884-b1f1-5710-9225-c28d08f25e91'}, {'abstract': 'It appears that South Korea and the United States are going to proceed with joint war games involving a quarter-million troops next month — the first external test for Kim Jong-u