 you think about the Oscar nominees this year. What were the best movies you saw in 2011, whether they made the nominations list or not?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/what-are-the-best-movies-you-saw-in-2011/', 'snippet': 'Student Opinion | Tell us what you think about the Oscar nominees this year. What were the best movies you saw in 2011, whether they made the nominations list or not?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Oscar nominations are in, and nine films are nominated for Best Picture this year. What are the best movies you saw in 2011? Why? If you were in charge of giving your own movie awards, what categories would you create, and which films, actors, writers or directors from this or any other year would win?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Are the Best Movies You Saw in 2011?', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T10:05:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29ff9b66-8215-5e37-9823-88338ec737bb', 'word_count': 363, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29ff9b66-8215-5e37-9823-88338ec737bb'}, {'abstract': 'The Obama administration threatened to withhold aid as Egypt confirmed it had kept at least a half-dozen Americans from leaving.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/world/middleeast/egypt-bars-son-of-ray-lahood-from-leaving.html', 'snippet': 'The Obama administration threatened to withhold aid as Egypt confirmed it had kept at least a half-dozen Americans from leaving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Building tensions between the United States and Egypt flashed into the open Thursday when Cairo confirmed that it had barred at least a half-dozen Americans from leaving the country and the Obama administration threatened explicitly to withhold its annual aid to the Egyptian military. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/world/jpEGYPT/jpEGYPT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Tensions Rise, Egypt Bars Exit of Six Americans', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Tensions Rise, Egypt Bars Exit Of Six Americans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Democratic Institute for International Affairs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Republican Institute', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Aid', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaHood, Ray', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T10:26:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Lee Myers and David D. Kirkpatrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Myers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_ma