wo smaller companies that are harnessing novel technologies to develop drug treatments for leukemias and lymphomas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two big biotechnology companies announced on Thursday that they would buy smaller companies that are harnessing novel technologies to develop drug treatments for leukemias and lymphomas. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Biotech Firms Bolster Their Drug Pipelines Through Deals', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biotechnology', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clinical Trials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMGEN INC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Celgene Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T16:04:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/429d700c-209c-53ff-a8df-2435d96ade48', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/429d700c-209c-53ff-a8df-2435d96ade48'}, {'abstract': 'Britain: worse than the 30s.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/the-greater-depression/', 'snippet': 'Britain: worse than the 30s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One thing everyone always says is that while this Lesser Depression may be bad, it’s nothing like the Great Depression.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Greater Depression', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 's