ics, but it must first defeat Costa Rica in the qualifying tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/sports/soccer/us-womens-soccer-team-must-beat-costa-rica-to-make-olympics.html', 'snippet': 'The United States women’s soccer team could provide a riveting story line at the 2012 London Olympics, but it must first defeat Costa Rica in the qualifying tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States women’s soccer team could provide a riveting story line at the 2012 London Olympics, given the household names of players like Hope Solo and Abby Wambach, and the galvanizing performance the Americans displayed last year at the World Cup.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/sports/27soccer1/27soccer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/27/sports/27soccer1/27soccer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/sports/27soccer1/27soccer1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 623, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/sports/27soccer1/27soccer1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/27/sports/27soccer1/27soccer1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Costa Rica Stands Between the U.S. and London', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Costa Rica Stands Between the U.S. and London', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wambach, Abby