ke a pretty good case that the trend had actually reversed itself, and that polling now appeared to favor Mitt Romney again. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Enters Debate Needing One More Comeback', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rasmussen Reports', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Winning Our Future', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T22:10:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25bc8911-e0a7-5675-8214-fae8b8f58ea8', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25bc8911-e0a7-5675-8214-fae8b8f58ea8'}, {'abstract': 'Foreign residents of Turkey have been thrown into a panic over a new law mandating that they buy national health insurance by Tuesday or face a fine. But no one seems to be sure how to sign up, who is required to, or by when.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/expats-face-confusing-new-law-to-buy-national-health-insurance-in-turkey/', 'snippet': 'Foreign residents of Turkey have been thrown into a panic over a new law mandating that they buy national health insurance by Tuesday or face a fine. But no one seems to be sure how to sign up, who is required to, or by when.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISTANBUL — Expatriates living in Turkey scrambled this week to try to fulfill a new requirement that foreign residents register and pay for national health insurance by Tuesday, January 31, or face a fine said to be 886.50 lira, or about $495.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Expats Face Confusing New Law to Buy Insurance in Turkey', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Americans Abroad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-26T22:11:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susanne Fowler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fowler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49afd971-1b99-51d6-a42e-b4bf385ff9a7', 'word_count': 536, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49afd971-1b99-51d6-a42e-b4bf385ff9a7'}, {'abstract': 'January 26, 2012 — Egyptian authorities block at least six American employees of American nongovernmental organizations from leaving the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000001314919/timescast--egypt-detains-americans.html', 'snippet': 'January 26, 2012 — Egyptian authorities block at least six American employees of American nongovernmental organizations from leaving the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'January 26, 2012 — Egyptian authorities block at leas