r the Web for important and peculiar items. Thursday’s selection includes items on the life of the founder of Megaupload, a new iPhone 5 rumor and the creator of the Apple stores unveiling his vision for J. C. Penney.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/todays-scuttlebot-tales-of-kim-dotcom-and-the-iphone-makers/', 'snippet': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important and peculiar items. Thursday’s selection includes items on the life of the founder of Megaupload, a new iPhone 5 rumor and the creator of the Apple stores unvei...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here are the interesting things that the tech reporters and editors for The New York Times found on the Web on Thursday. Find more Scuttlebot items here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot: Tales of Kim Dotcom and the iPhone Makers', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-