'nyt://article/02911258-b3d1-54c6-a600-c0bc15b89c3f', 'word_count': 245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02911258-b3d1-54c6-a600-c0bc15b89c3f'}, {'abstract': 'Prince Fielder’s world came full-circle, as he officially became part of his favorite childhood team, the Detroit Tigers, with a nine-year, $214 million contract.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/princefielder/', 'snippet': 'Prince Fielder’s world came full-circle, as he officially became part of his favorite childhood team, the Detroit Tigers, with a nine-year, $214 million contract.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — It was a happily eerie scene at Comerica Park on Thursday, as the new Detroit Tigers slugger Prince Fielder sat on the dais for a news conference, flanked by his cute, curly-haired 7-year-old son, Jadyn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fielder Comes Home', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Cecil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fielder, Prince', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:03:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne C. Gerstner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Gerstner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5980ad07-1f87-5139-a51b-ac28a3ae34c1', 'word_count': 600, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5980ad07-1f87-5139-a51b-ac28a3ae34c1'}, {'abstract': 'In an era when party leaders are ceding power to grass-roots conservatives who are defined by populism and often anger at institutions, it is not clear that there is a meaningful Republican establishment any longer.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/gingrich-insurgency-tests-partys-old-guard/', 'snippet': 'In an era when party leaders are ceding power to grass-roots conservatives who are defined by populism and often anger at institutions, it is not clear that there is a meaningful Republican establishment any longer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Old Guard of the Republican Party has suddenly surfaced with some acid criticism of Newt Gingrich and warnings that he would be crushed in November, seeking to impose some discipline on an electorate that seems to be flirting seriously with nominating Mr. Gingrich for president. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Insurgency Tests Party’s Old Guard', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservatism (US Politics)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeLay, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dole, Bob', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:05:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard W. Stevenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Stevenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2170002-e233-5e16-88fb-06d744641b79', 'word_count': 948, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2170002-e233-5e16-88fb-06d744641b79'}, {'abstract': 'Vermeer’s portrait “Girl With a Pearl Earring” will visit the Frick Collection in late 2013, on loan from Royal Picture Gallery Mauritshuis in The Hague.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/arts/design/vermeers-girl-with-a-pearl-earring-to-visit-frick-in-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Vermeer’s portrait “Girl With a Pearl Earring” will visit the Frick Collection in late 2013, on loan from Royal Picture Gallery Mauritshuis in The Hague.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The No. 1 question from visitors to the Rijksmuseum in Amsterdam, according to Emilie Gordenker, is “Where is ‘Girl With a Pearl Earring’?”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/27VOGEL1/27VOGEL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 719, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/27VOGEL1/27VOGEL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/27VOGEL1/27VOGEL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Venerable Fresh Face Goes on Tour', 'kicker': 'Inside Art', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Venerable Fresh Face Goes on Tour', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vermeer, Jan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Frick Collection', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eggleston, William (1939- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:06:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 