rtual campaign arm for Mitt Romney, featuring huge, screaming headlines about Mr. Gingrich and his past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Furious conservatives have taken to blogs and Twitter on Thursday to vent their ire against what they allege is a conspiratorial dumping of twisted and manipulated negative attacks on Newt Gingrich. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Conservatives Criticize Drudge for Anti-Gingrich Assault', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drudge, Matt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Limbaugh, Rush', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drudge Report', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:09:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9695a43-68ac-53cd-acfd-45dc87ac67d1', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9695a43-68ac-53cd-acfd-45dc87ac67d1'}, {'abstract': 'Hiroki Kuroda, a right-handed starter, wrapped up a one-year, $10 million deal, and reliever Boone Logan signed a one-year contract and avoided arbitration.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/bolstering-staff-yankees-complete-deal-with-kuroda/', 'snippet': 'Hiroki Kuroda, a right-handed starter, wrapped up a one-year, $10 million deal, and reliever Boone Logan signed a one-year contract and avoided arbitration.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The Yankees announced the signing of Hiroki Kuroda, a right-handed starter, on Thursday and also agreed to a one-year deal with reliever Boone Logan to avoid arbitration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bolstering Staff, Yankees Complete Deal With Kuroda', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuroda, Hiroki', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Logan, Boone', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:09:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d4aea8f-7095-5bf1-915e-14a82301bfbd', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d4aea8f-7095-5bf1-915e-14a82301bfbd'}, {'abstract': 'This exhibition of brush-and-ink works by Fu Baoshi is the first full-dress retrospective of a 20th-century Chinese artist to be seen at the Met.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/arts/design/fu-baoshi-chinas-master-modernist-at-metropolitan-museum.html', 'snippet': 'This exhibition of brush-and-ink works by Fu Baoshi is the first full-dress retrospective of a 20th-century Chinese artist to be seen at the Met.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The painter Fu Baoshi was born in China in 1904, seven years before the Chinese Revolution brought 2,100 years of dynastic rule to an end. He died in 1965, months before China’s Communist regime unleashed the Cultural Revolution, which aggressively persecuted the country’s writers, artists and other intelligentsia, sometimes unto death. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/design/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 328, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/design/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 328}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/design/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 560, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/design/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/27/arts/design/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z/20120127-FU-slide-5R3Z-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'History Unfolding on a Hand Scroll', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'History Unfolding On a Hand Scroll', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Museum of Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:10:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roberta Smith', 'person': [{