h blew out in the Gulf of Mexico nearly two years ago, is not liable for some of the pollution claims arising from the fatal accident, a federal judge in Louisiana ruled on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ruling Favors Owner of Rig in Gulf Spill', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ruling Favors Owner of Rig In Gulf Spill', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transocean Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barbier, Carl J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gulf of Mexico Oil Spill (2010)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:25:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7c82d5c-ac27-541e-a8bf-5e0ed478ecc1', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7c82d5c-ac27-541e-a8bf-5e0ed478ecc1'}, {'abstract': 'A photograph online showed a group of young Arizona men posing with guns and holding a bullet-riddled image of the president’s face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/us/secret-service-looks-into-image-of-obama-riddled-with-bullets.html', 'snippet': 'A photograph online showed a group of young Arizona men posing with guns and holding a bullet-riddled image of the president’s face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — The Secret Service said Thursday that it was looking into a photograph posted on the Internet that showed a group of young Arizona men posing in the desert with guns while holding up what appeared to be a bullet-riddled image of President Obama’s face.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shot-Up Image of President Draws a Secret Service Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shot-Up Image of President Draws a Secret Service Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Secret Service', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Phoenix (Ariz)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T00:31:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Lacey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lacey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c20239fe-e9a4-5b8c-b393-4768f450da7d', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c20239fe-e9a4-5b8c-b393-4768f450da7d'}, {'abstract': 'Two exhibitions, one at the National Museum of American History and the other at Monticello, explore Thomas Jefferson’s relationship with slavery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/arts/design/smithsonian-and-monticello-exhibitions-on-jeffersons-slaves.html', 'snippet': 'Two exhibitions, one at the National Museum of American History and the other at Monticello, explore Thomas Jefferson’s relationship with slavery.', 'lead_paragraph': '