king to buy Deluxe Entertainment Services, he turned to Goldman Sachs for advice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Perelman Lawsuit, a Fight Over Files Not Deleted', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Compensation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drapkin, Donald G', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perelman, Ronald O', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MacAndrews & Forbes Holdings Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T01:30:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/771fa6f7-0d48-573b-9925-6dd79d252c38', 'word_count': 590, 'uri': 'nyt://article/771fa6f7-0d48-573b-9925-6dd79d252c38'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Mitch Daniels got so much wrong in his reply to the president’s State of the Union address. To really create jobs, it takes a cluster, not just heroes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/opinion/krugman-jobs-jobs-and-cars.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Mitch Daniels got so much wrong in his reply to the president’s State of the Union address. To really create jobs, it takes a cluster, not just heroes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitch Daniels, the former Bush budget director who is now Indiana’s governor, made the Republicans’ reply to President Obama’s State of the Union address. His performance was, well, boring. B