mber.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Gay-rights advocates say they have almost twice the 57,277 signatures required to put a same-sex marriage referendum on the ballot this November, which will most likely bring the issue before voters for the second time in three years. Same-sex marriage was legalized here in 2009, but voters overturned the law with a so-called people’s veto later that year. Six states and the District of Columbia allow same-sex marriage, but none have yet legalized it with a popular vote. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Maine: Gay-Rights Backers Say Petition Goal Is Met', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Maine: Gay-Rights Backers Say Petition Goal Is Met', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T01:35:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb767516-a0f0-5974-bd75-01da294c8efd', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb767516-a0f0-5974-bd75-01da294c8efd'}, {'abstract': 'Greg Kelly, who is now the subject of a rape accusation, has been attacked by critics who say his relationship with his father is an inherent conflict of interest for him professionally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/nyregion/greg-kelly-of-fox-tv-not-