will marry his partner of five years in a ceremony in Massachusetts, Mr. Frank’s spokesman said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/us/massachusetts-congressman-will-marry-his-partner.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Barney Frank, one of the first openly gay members of Congress, will marry his partner of five years in a ceremony in Massachusetts, Mr. Frank’s spokesman said.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Representative Barney Frank, left, one of the first openly gay members of Congress, will marry his partner of five years in a ceremony in Massachusetts, Mr. Frank’s spokesman said. Mr. Frank’s partner, Jim Ready, 42, is a photographer and handyman in Ogunquit, Me. Mr. Frank, 71, announced in November that he would retire at the end of this year after more than three decades in the House. Mr. Frank’s spokesman said the wedding date had not been determined. Same-sex marriage is legal in Massachusetts. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: Congressman Will Marry His Partner', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: Congressman Will Marry His Partner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frank, Barney', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T01:47:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Goodnough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodnough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_materia