ater apologized.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/26/198845/', 'snippet': 'Contrary to a claim by a Romney ad, Newt Gingrich did not specifically call Spanish “the language of the ghetto,” though Mr. Gingrich later apologized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Newt Gingrich was asked if he had called Spanish “the language of the ghetto,” as a new ad from the Romney campaign suggests.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fact Check: ‘Language of the Ghetto’', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T01:56:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aaad5ac5-b919-5ae3-b456-312d6df1d26c', 'word_count': 136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aaad5ac5-b919-5ae3-b456-312d6df1d26c'}, {'abstract': 'A suicide bomber exploded a car near a British reconstruction team on Thursday, killing four Afghans, including a child, and wounding 31 others, the provincial governor’s office and the British government said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/world/asia/afghanistan-suicide-bomber-kills-4.html', 'snippet': 'A suicide bomber exploded a car near a British reconstruction team on Thursday, killing four Afghans, including a child, and wounding 31 others, the provincial governor’s office and the British government said.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A suicide bomber exploded a car near a British reconstruction team traveling in a convoy through the center of Lashkar Gah in southern Afghanistan on Thursday, killing four Afghans, including a child, and wounding 31 others, the provincial governor’s office and the British government said. Three British citizens were hurt in the explosion, Britain’s Foreign Office said. It was unclear whether the convoy was the target of the attack. The reconstruction team is one of dozens across Afghanistan in which civilian and military personnel lead efforts to build roads and schools and to help local governments become more effective. Lashkar Gah was among the first cities where Afghan security forces assumed sole control last summer in the first stage of a transition from American security. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghanistan: Suicide Bomber Kills 4', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Afghanistan: Suicide Bomber Kills 4', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T01:56:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Bowley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bowley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/878554ec-5cae-5325-8755-f79132811897', 'word_count': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/878554ec-5cae-5325-8755-f79132811897'}, {'abstract': 'Polls are finding that Americans seem less upset by the existence of income inequality than by the perception that federal policies unfairly favor the rich.', 'web_url': 'https://c