en, Conn. Their claims gained chilling corroboration on Tuesday. The Federal Bureau of Investigation arrested a sergeant and three officers on charges of terrorizing the town’s Hispanic neighborhoods, stopping and detaining people, searching businesses without cause, beating people in handcuffs, smashing a man’s head into a wall. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Outrage in East Haven', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Outrage in East Haven', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maturo, Joseph A Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Haven (Conn)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hispanic-Americans', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Racial Profiling', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T03:54:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a5f0328-090c-50dc-a326-808d3047a011', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a5f0328-090c-50dc-a326-808d3047a011'}, {'abstract': 'The resignation of the Arizona Congresswoman is a reminder of how little has been done about the nation’s inadequate gun laws since the Tucson rampage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/opinion/rep-gabby-giffordss-farewell.html', 'snippet': 'The resignation of the Arizona Congresswoman is a reminder of how little has been done about the nation’s inadequate gun laws since the Tucson rampage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'House members were moved to tears on Wednesday when Representative Gabrielle Giffords handed in her resignation because, she said, she needed more time to heal from the grievous gunshot wound she suffered last year at the hands of a would-be assassin. The rarest of Congressional events — a display of genuinely bipartisan tributes — was the parting gift from her colleagues along with unanimous approval of Ms. Giffords’s bill to fight drug trafficking along the Mexican border. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gabby Giffords’s Farewell', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gabby Giffords’s Farewell', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Giffords, Gabrielle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tucson Shooting (2011)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Congress', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T04:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/720b76c6-631b-5570-986d-04b7140ada28', 'word_count': 313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/720b76c6-631b-5570-986d-04b7140ada28'}, {'abstract': '“The Prime Minister’s Children,” an Israeli television series, provides an insider’s look into a political family. No wonder: Noa Rothman, one of the creators, is Yitzhak Rabin’s granddaughter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/arts/television/noa-rothmans-prime-ministers-children-on-israeli-tv.html', 'snippet': '“The Prime Minister’s Children,” an Israeli television series, provides an insider’s look into a political family. No wonder: Noa Rothman, one of the creators, is Yitzhak Rabin’s granddaughter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TEL AVIV — Noa Rothman bears an uncanny resemblance to her grandfather Yitzhak Rabin — so much so that when Rami Heuberger tried out for the prime minister’s role in Ms. Rothman’s television series, “The Prime Minister’s Children,” he had trouble looking at her.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/arts/29PRIME2_SPAN/29PRIME2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/29/arts/29PRIME2_SPAN/29PRIME2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/arts/29PRIME2_SPAN/29PRIME2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/arts/29PRIME2_SPAN/29PRIME2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/