ndering exactly which voters they should be courting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/us/texas-candidates-await-redrawn-congressional-district-map-to-find-out-which-voters-to-court.html', 'snippet': 'Candidates across the state are waiting to see which political map will be used in the April election and wondering exactly which voters they should be courting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s possible to lose an election before it even starts. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/27/us/SUB-27TTRAMSEY/SUB-27TTRAMSEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Hard to Campaign Without a Map', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Hard to Campaign Without a Map', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Redistricting and Reapportionment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morrison, Geanie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maps', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T06:59:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Ramsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70a06440-647a-5b88-8400-1d8f389c2d85', 'word_count': 738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70a06440-647a-5b88-8400-1d8f389c2d85'}, {'abstract': 'Our quirky, 