'uri': 'nyt://article/db0ba4df-7f73-5346-a160-31e9090695eb'}, {'abstract': 'The Colts’ quarterback and the team owner have seemingly been communicating through a go-between. That person happens to be a columnist, Bob Kravitz of The Indianapolis Star.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/peyton-manning-jim-irsay-and-bob-kravitz/', 'snippet': 'The Colts’ quarterback and the team owner have seemingly been communicating through a go-between. That person happens to be a columnist, Bob Kravitz of The Indianapolis Star.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It is so sad and so hard to write it again, but it’s true: Peyton Manning is done in Indianapolis.” — Bob Kravitz', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Peyton Manning, Jim Irsay and Bob Kravitz', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Irsay, Jim', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Peyton', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapolis Colts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T11:27:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Toni Monkovic', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Toni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Monkovic', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/854c29ac-f660-55f4-aea6-beb3f1b913fa', 'word_count': 505, 'uri': 'nyt://article/854c29ac-f660-55f4-aea6-beb3f1b913fa'}, {'abstract': '“Luck,” an HBO series about the world of horse racing, stars Dustin Hoffman and Nick Nolte.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/28/arts/television/luck-starring-dustin-hoffman-on-hbo.html', 'snippet': '“Luck,” an HBO series about the world of horse racing, stars Dustin Hoffman and Nick Nolte.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What are the odds that an HBO series by David Milch (“Deadwood”) and Michael Mann (“Miami Vice”), that stars Dustin Hoffman and Nick Nolte, and is set in a Damon Runyon-esque world of horse racing could be anything but great? ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/arts/28LUCK/28LUCK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/28/arts/28LUCK/28LUCK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/arts/28LUCK/28LUCK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/arts/28LUCK/28LUCK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/28/arts/28LUCK/28LUCK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Where Fortune Is Just Around the Bend', 'kicker': "Television Review | 'Luck'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where Fortune Is Just Around the Bend', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nolte, Nick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoffman, Dustin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Milch, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mann, Micha