cific campaign promises Mitt Romney has made in the realm of defense policy is to increase the Navy’s shipbuilding program to 15 vessels each year from 9 or 10, enough to significantly increase the size of a fleet that has been straining to meet its global missions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Defense Budget Limits Reach of a Campaign Promise for the Navy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defense Budget Limits Reach of a Campaign Promise for the Navy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Navy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T16:30:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John H. Cushman Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'Cushman', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fc481cf-bb67-5e41-95ae-07e487ac82e2', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fc481cf-bb67-5e41-95ae-07e487ac82e2'}, {'abstract': 'Among the more than 12,000 who used an interactive calculator, reducing troop levels in Europe and Asia was the most popular choice, and many saw potential administrative savings.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/how-readers-cut-the-pentagon-budget/', 'snippet': 'Among the more than 12,000 who used an interactive calculator, reducing troop levels in Europe and Asia was the most popular choice, and many saw potential administrative savings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 12,000 readers completed The New York Times’s interactive calculator on the Pentagon budget. The results are not scientific, of course. But among those readers who filled out the calculator, a few patterns emerged:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Readers Cut the Pentagon Budget', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T16:30:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c70a2fde-84ee-5de9-95b7-b98e5df2e451', 'word_count': 213, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c70a2fde-84ee-5de9-95b7-b98e5df2e451'}, {'abstract': 'France’s largest bank is looking to sell up to $11 billion of loans to oil and gas companies in an effort to reduce its loan book in the United States, according to people briefed on the matter.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/27/bnp-paribas-said-to-be-selling-11-billion-of-loans/', 'snippet': 'France’s largest bank is looking to sell up to $11 billion of loans to oil and gas companies in an effort to reduce its loan book in the United States, according to people briefed on the matter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The French bank BNP Paribas is looking to sell up to $11 billion of loans to oil and gas companies in an effort to reduce its loan book 