nytimes.com/2012/01/29/travel/qa-with-ross-halfin-celebrity-photographer.html', 'snippet': 'The celebrity photographer on where, and how, to capture the best views in the world, with or without a camera.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROSS HALFIN has traveled the world photographing rock stars like Jimmy Page and Mötley Crüe against backdrops as varied as Perth, Australia, and the South Dakota Badlands. Along the way he learned a few things about the best lens to travel with and where to find a stunning landscape. For a striking sunset, he said the window of an airplane as it takes off from the Los Angeles International Airport is the place to be. “You see the coast of California all in shadow and this amazing golden light. That’s Los Angeles at its best.”', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29QNA/29QNA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 945, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29QNA/29QNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29QNA/29QNA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A With Ross Halfin, Celebrity Photographer', 'kicker': 'Q & A ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Capturing The World In Its Best Light', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T17:12:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Lee Harris', 'person': [{'firstname':