its simple charms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/travel/mafia-island-a-serene-isle-for-now-off-tanzania.html', 'snippet': 'This East African isle has built a small but passionate following among travelers drawn by its simple charms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN seen on arrival by air, Mafia Island doesn’t appear to be much more than a crescent-shaped splash of green off the eastern coast of Africa. Slightly smaller than New York City, the verdant island, 20 miles from mainland Tanzania, is densely covered in coconut trees, with nothing but green flora visible in the interior and just a few intermittent stretches of white sand breaking up the coast.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29NEXT4_SPAN/29NEXT4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29NEXT4_SPAN/29NEXT4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29NEXT4_SPAN/29NEXT4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29NEXT4_SPAN/29NEXT4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/29/travel/29NEXT4_SPAN/29NEXT4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Off Tanzania, Serene Mafia Island', 'kicker': 'Next Stop', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Serene Isle (for Now) Off Tanzania', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject',