l', 'snippet': 'Many banks have built free-checking scoreboards for people who want to avoid fees, but they’re not putting the numbers up until the end of the month, when a fee has already been assessed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You haven’t been able to turn around in recent months without hearing about one or another bank adding fees to its checking accounts or making new rules for people who want to keep their free checking. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/your-money/28money/28money-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 861, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/your-money/28money/28money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/28/your-money/28money/28money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wanted: Banking App to Monitor Balances', 'kicker': 'Your Money', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wanted: Banking App To Monitor Balances', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bankrate Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Checks and Checking Accounts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-27T19:30:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'subsection_name': 'Broker