il the food arrives. The menu at this stylish restaurant in the new Delamar Southport Hotel is even more creative than the décor. The chef, Frederic Kieffer, formerly of the much-missed Gaia in Greenwich, has created a modern version of New England cookery that makes use of many local and regional ingredients, like chilled oysters from the Thimble Islands and Cape Cod hard-shell clams.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINECT1/29DINECT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINECT1/29DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINECT1/29DINECT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tastes, and Ingredients, of New England', 'kicker': 'Connecticut Dining | Southport', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Tastes, And Ingredients, Of New England', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Artisan (Southport, Conn Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Southport (Conn)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T01:39:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Brooks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://art