ff66cb-7743-5f04-b5af-3b11f902be78'}, {'abstract': 'Bell & Whistle in Hopewell has a menu with diverse regional influences, but the gumbo is a standout.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/nyregion/at-bell-whistle-comfort-food-from-all-over-review.html', 'snippet': 'Bell & Whistle in Hopewell has a menu with diverse regional influences, but the gumbo is a standout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you find yourself in Hopewell and hungry for gumbo, Bell & Whistle is the place to go. Deeply flavored and very reasonably priced at $4, this mildly spicy stew offers the essence of the so-called holy trinity — celery, bell pepper, onions — along with chicken, andouille and crawfish in every bite.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINENJ1/29DINENJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINENJ1/29DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/29/nyregion/29DINENJ1/29DINENJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Comfort Food With a Wide Provenance', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | Hopewell', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Comfort Food With a Wide Provenance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bell & Whistle (Hopewell, NJ Restaurant)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T01:52:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karla Cook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cook', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a321dadb-48b3-5154-97af-cdd371fc163d', 'word_count': 826, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a321dadb-48b3-5154-97af-cdd371fc163d'}, {'abstract': 'The All-Star Game is a coming-out party for stars who have emerged from seemingly nowhere — like goaltender Brian Elliott of the St. Louis Blues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/28/sports/hockey/for-blues-elliott-bumps-part-of-route-to-top.html', 'snippet': 'The All-Star Game is a coming-out party for stars who have emerged from seemingly nowhere — like goaltender Brian Elliott of the St. Louis Blues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Sidney Crosby and Alex Ovechkin may not be playing, yet the N.H.L. All-Star Game is still a showcase for established stars like Pavel Datsyuk, Patrick Kane and Zdeno Chara.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/sports/y-allstar/y-allstar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/28/sports/y-allstar/y-allstar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/sports/y-allstar/y-allstar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 898, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/sports/y-allstar/y-allstar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im