The last thing Egypt needs is to pick a fight with the United States. Yet the military rulers have done just that, demonstrating contempt for civil society and an old ally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/28/opinion/egypts-assault-on-civil-society.html', 'snippet': 'The last thing Egypt needs is to pick a fight with the United States. Yet the military rulers have done just that, demonstrating contempt for civil society and an old ally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Post-Mubarak Egypt is facing profound challenges with its unfinished revolution and looming economic crisis. The last thing it needs is to pick a fight with the United States. Yet the military rulers have done just that, demonstrating contempt for civil society and an old ally.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egypt’s Assault on Civil Society', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Egypt’s Assault on Civil Society', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Republican Institute', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Democratic Institute for International Affairs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Freedom House', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LaHood, Sam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T02:19:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f17b7261-a7e9-