s://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/28/us/kevin-h-white-82-boston-mayor-during-busing-crisis-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. White served four terms as mayor, much of it during a period of economic stagnation and racial unrest over court-ordered desegregation of the city’s schools.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin H. White, a four-term mayor of Boston who came to national prominence for shepherding the city through years of racial violence and economic stagnation — and for a decadelong federal investigation into corruption in his administration — died Friday night at his home in the Beacon Hill section of Boston. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/us/28white-1/28white-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 651, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/28/us/28white-1/28white-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/28/us/28white-1/28white-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Kevin H. White, Mayor Who Led Boston in Busing Crisis, Dies at 82', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kevin H. White, Mayor of Boston During Busing Crisis, Dies at 82', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Kevin H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T04:30:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.',