ails-obamas-path-to-socialism/', 'snippet': 'Charged words at a rally in Pensacola days before the primary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PENSACOLA, Fla. — The crowd that greeted Mitt Romney, stretching from dock to dock and leaning over the balconies at the Fish House here, was treated to several cameos Saturday morning before an energetic and sunny Mr. Romney finally took the stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Romney Rally, Actor Assails Obama’s Path to ‘Socialism’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gabor, Zsa Zsa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolie, Angelina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonnell, Robert F', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Voight, Jon', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pensacola (Fla)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T17:25:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'l