edalist Rulon Gardner is 40 years old and overweight, but he believes that he can qualify to wrestle at the Summer Games in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLORADO SPRINGS — The wrestling room at the United States Olympic Training Center smelled of stale sweat and fresh expectation. Training amid dozens of Greco-Roman wrestlers was a familiar athlete with a crew cut and an overstuffed suitcase of a body. Never sculptured, his round physique had gone to flab and now aspired again to fitness. This was Rulon Gardner, the Wyoming farm boy who beat the unbeatable Russian and now had a 64-inch chest, 9 toes and seemingly 9 lives, few if any lived in moderation.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/sports/gardner1/gardner1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/29/sports/gardner1/gardner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/29/sports/gardner1/gardner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Energy, Charm and Ample Ambition', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Energy, Charm And Ample Ambition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gardner, Rulon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wrestling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T17:58:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By