m in the doctor’s office, a woman is generously showering each page of last month’s Newsweek with wet coughs. Her expression is a dutiful one, like that of a priest sprinkling holy water upon his congregation; occasionally she flips back to bestow a second layer where the first might have been too thin. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Appointment With Dread', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sedatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Xanax (Drug)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T20:45:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa Nutting', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nutting', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/969bd2f1-3fda-5204-a067-8ca2a9697237', 'word_count': 1625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/969bd2f1-3fda-5204-a067-8ca2a9697237'}, {'abstract': 'Coach John Tortorella beat the drum for the N.H.L. to recognize defenseman Dan Girardi, a fearless shot blocker.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/28/rangers-girardi-rises-from-free-agent-to-all-star/', 'snippet': 'Coach John Tortorella beat the drum for the N.H.L. to recognize defenseman Dan Girardi, a fearless shot blocker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Rangers Coach John Tortorella can always find a teachable moment. Here at the N.H.L. All-Star Weekend — where he is coach of Team Alfredsson but asserts he will do nothing on the bench except “watch, just like you” — that moment came at Friday’s media day, when 