o rest a sore ankle and a painful wrist, having conceded that his erratic play was hurting the Knicks’ cause. He missed Friday night’s game against the Miami Heat and will miss Saturday’s game in Houston.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks’ Anthony Is Resting His Ailing Body', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T20:55:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By HOWARD BECK', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'BECK', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47023312-bd13-5e80-9fd5-3b578c46fc46', 'word_count': 541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47023312-bd13-5e80-9fd5-3b578c46fc46'}, {'abstract': 'Levon Aronian is getting close to the No. 1 ranking in the world, but he does not get the attention of many of his lesser-ranked rivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/crosswords/chess/chess-levon-aronian-is-overlooked-except-at-the-board.html', 'snippet': 'Levon Aronian is getting close to the No. 1 ranking in the world, but he does not get the attention of many of his lesser-ranked rivals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Is it possible to be No. 2 in the world and be overlooked? In some respects, that is the situation facing Levon Aronian, 29. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No. 2 Overlooked, Except at the Board', 'kicker': 'Chess', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No. 2 Overlooked, Except at the Board', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aronian, Levon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chess', 'ra