: 'Mitt Romney criticizes Newt Gingrich’s record as House speaker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PANAMA CITY, Fla. — After offering the crowd gathered at a shipbuilding yard here a preview of what he would do as president — a list that covered energy production and foreign policy — Mitt Romney paused and observed, “Now I’m speaking to you today as if I’m already the candidate for president of the Republican Party. But I’m not.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Says Gingrich Should Not ‘Rewrite History’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-28T23:20:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbce74c5-8666-5753-8a59-101c1ee6912e', 'word_count': 388, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbce74c5-8666-5753-8a59-101c1ee6912e'}, {'abstract': 'After playing the snare drum in a Marine Corps band, Peter Clarke went on to start his own product and packaging design firm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/jobs/peter-clarke-of-product-ventures-from-drums-to-designs.html', 'snippet': 'After playing the snare drum in a Marine Corps band, Peter Clarke went on to start his own product and packaging design firm.', 'lead_pa