s.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/gingrich-sees-non-romney-majority-of-delegates-forming/', 'snippet': 'Despite setbacks, Mr. Gingrich sees conservatives coalescing around for the convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LUTZ, Fla. — Newt Gingrich predicted on Sunday that Mitt Romney, who is leading him in the polls in Florida by double digits, would fail to win a majority of the votes in Tuesday’s primary and would not be able to muster a majority of the delegates by the time of the Republican convention in August.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gingrich Sees ‘Non-Romney Majority’ of Delegates Forming', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservatism (US Politics)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endorsements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Republican National Convention', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cain, Herman', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perry, Rick', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tampa (Fla)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-29T18:38:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': '