icut, but the Huskies could not overtake the Fighting Irish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/sports/ncaabasketball/boatright-returns-but-uconn-falls-to-notre-dame.html', 'snippet': 'Ryan Boatright returned after an N.C.A.A. investigation and provided a boost for Connecticut, but the Huskies could not overtake the Fighting Irish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARTFORD — The freshman guard Ryan Boatright returned to the Connecticut basketball team Sunday after an N.C.A.A. investigation and scored his first points on a floater in the lane to close out the first half. The basket, which put UConn ahead by 3 points, seemed to be a bright omen for the Huskies.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YUCONN/YUCONN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 344, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YUCONN/YUCONN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 344}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YUCONN/YUCONN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YUCONN/YUCONN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YUCONN/YUCONN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Boatright Returns but Can’t Lift UConn', 'kicker': 'Notre Dame 50, UConn 48', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Boatright Returns But Can’t Lift UConn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'ran