ra this season because of that company’s financial problems. “6000 miles away,” a reference to the earthquake and tsunami in Japan last year, is being presented by the Joyce Theater Foundation.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Footnote', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Footnote', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guillem, Sylvie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-29T22:50:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cbc8d3e-168c-5168-b0ac-8a5e107665be', 'word_count': 99, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cbc8d3e-168c-5168-b0ac-8a5e107665be'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s superintendent of the new office has taken on high-profile issues, and some see it as infringing on Attorney General Eric T. Schneiderman’s territory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/nyregion/financial-services-agencys-reach-spurs-criticism-of-cuomo.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s superintendent of the new office has taken on high-profile issues, and some see it as infringing on Attorney General Eric T. Schneiderman’s territory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — Benjamin M. Lawsky is not the attorney general of New York State. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/nyregion/LAWSKY/LAWKSKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 