: 'The Police Department, with its immense powers, should not operate free from independent oversight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/opinion/the-nypd-needs-policing.html', 'snippet': 'The Police Department, with its immense powers, should not operate free from independent oversight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE Police Department has the formidable responsibility of keeping New Yorkers safe from a terrorist attack. It is entrusted with significant powers and broad discretion in how to use them. It has done an admirable job in preventing violence. But last week, we were reminded that no government entity with such powers should operate free from independent oversight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Time to Police the N.Y.P.D.', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Time To Police The N.Y.P.D.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Raymond W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T01:44:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Faiza Patel and Elizabeth Goitein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Faiza', 'middlename': Non