y-under-siege-in-europe-from-rivals.html', 'snippet': 'Research in Motion, the maker of the BlackBerry, faces a problem in Europe as businesses look for other smartphone options, including Apple and Android phones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The iPhone has taken a big bite out of the BlackBerry in a market where the older phone once dominated: business customers in North America.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/business/30Smartphone1/30Smartphone1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/business/30Smartphone1/30Smartphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/30/business/30Smartphone1/30Smartphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'BlackBerry Under Siege in Europe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'BlackBerry Under Siege In Europe', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Electronics Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'BlackBerry (Handheld Device)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Android (Operating System)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Research In Motion Ltd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T01:59:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35ca5ba9-699c-5f74-a948-7b4822800c56', 'word_count': 1064, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35ca5ba9-699c-5f74-a948-7b4822800c56'}, {'abstract': 'Here are five ways in which the Republican campaign will change as it leaves Florida.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/after-florida-a-new-tenor-for-the-g-o-p-campaign/', 'snippet': 'Here are five ways in which the Republican campaign will change as it leaves Florida.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As polls showedMitt Romney pulling far ahead ofNewt Gingrich in Florida, both campaigns have begun looking ahead to a period of campaigning that is likely to look and feel very different.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Florida, a New Tenor for the G.O.P. Campaign', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Ron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santorum, Rick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maine', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T02:00:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 's