'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/961ceeda-2b7d-582a-8083-c3f6d69eae7d'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Chris Christie said he would veto a measure to legalize same-sex marriage, but supporters of marriage equality in the State Legislature need to press on.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/opinion/moving-ahead-on-marriage-equality.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Chris Christie said he would veto a measure to legalize same-sex marriage, but supporters of marriage equality in the State Legislature need to press on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Chris Christie’s announcement last week that he would veto a measure to legalize same-sex marriage in New Jersey is maddening, but sadly predictable. He vowed to block marriage equality when he ran for office in 2009 and is now calling for a statewide referendum. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Moving Ahead on Marriage Equality', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Moving Ahead on Marriage Equality', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T02:10:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3c15537-9c3d-5db5-8b2d-dcd865091026', 'word_count': 283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3c15537-9c3d-5db5-8b2d-dcd865091026'}, {'abstract': 'Professional trampoli