 sport with few participants, but its proponents have big plans for it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/sports/defying-gravity-with-creativity-in-wall-trampoline.html', 'snippet': 'Part gymnastics, part parkour, wall trampoline is a nascent sport with few participants, but its proponents have big plans for it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'QUEBEC — One by one, five athletes hurl themselves off a wall beneath the sweeping arches of what once was the St.-Esprit church. Sixteen feet below, they land on a trampoline, snap back toward the wall and send themselves outward again.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Defying Gravity With Creativity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defying Gravity With Creativity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parkour (Sport)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'X Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trampolines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gymnastics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T02:13:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Olsen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olsen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01a1901e-1b8c-5e92-bf06-44c886f7204d', 'word_count': 1106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01a1901e-1b8c-5e92-bf06-44c886f7204d'}, {'abstract': 'After losing a three-stroke lead on the final hole and then falling in a playoff, Kyle Stanley could not control his emotions.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/29/a-tearful-response-to-a-final-hole-collapse/', 'snippet': 'After losing a three-stroke lead on the final hole and then falling in a playoff, Kyle Stanley could not control his emotions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN DIEGO – After building a five-stroke lead through 54 holes of the Farmers Insurance Open, Kyle Stanley described himself as “kind of an internal guy.” And it was true. For 71 holes, Stanley betrayed no emotion, his body language a study in stoicism.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Tearful Response to a Final-Hole Collapse', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snedeker, Brandt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stanley, Kyle (1987- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T02:13:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33371e8f-eedc-50a7-9610-116be77ff289', 'word_count': 487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33371e8f-eedc-50a7-9610-116be77ff289'}, {'abstract': 'Operating on money and equipment scrounged from the public and from Silicon Valley millionaires, a band of astronomers recently restarted the search for extraterrestrial intelligence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/science/space/seti-research-is-revived-life-out-there.html', 'snippet': 'Operating on money and equipment scrounged from the public and from Silicon Valley millionaires, a band of astronomers recently restarted the search for extraterrestrial intelligence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAT CREEK, Calif. — E.T. might be phoning, but do we care enough to take the call?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New