e Patriots arrived in Indianapolis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/sports/football/belichick-is-in-jovial-mood-as-patriots-arrive-in-indianapolis.html', 'snippet': 'The good cheer of Bill Belichick, who coaches a team known as the most buttoned-up in the N.F.L., set a relaxed tone as the Patriots arrived in Indianapolis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — When Bill Belichick coached the Giants’ defense in the 1980s, he spoke in such a monotone that the players branded him Captain Sominex. Even now, at his fifth Super Bowl as the coach of the New England Patriots, when Belichick arrives in a room, he is not expected to bring levity with him.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YPATRIOTS1/YPATRIOTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YPATRIOTS1/YPATRIOTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YPATRIOTS1/YPATRIOTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YPATRIOTS1/YPATRIOTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/30/sports/YPATRIOTS1/YPATRIOTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Playing Against Type, Belichick Is in Jovial Mood as Team Arrives', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Playing Against Type, Belichick Is in Jovial Mood as Team Arrives', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None},