nomy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/01/30/us/politics/30florida.html', 'snippet': 'A journey along Interstate 4, through central Florida, reveals despair about the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A journey along Interstate 4, through central Florida, reveals despair about the economy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/us/politics/30florida-slide-PVH3/30florida-slide-PVH3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/30/us/politics/30florida-slide-PVH3/30florida-slide-PVH3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/30/us/politics/30florida-slide-PVH3/30florida-slide-PVH3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sour Mood for Voters in Florida', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T03:47:08+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/2e36f150-4648-52c5-ab88-5e186a3fcc62', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/2e36f150-4648-52c5-ab88-5e186a3fcc62'}, {'abstract': 'As the Republican primary campaign picks up, the mood of many Florida voters was sour, focused on one thing: the state’s troubled economy. Few expect any quick solutions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/us/politics/voters-in-central-florida-want-assurances-on-economy.html', 'snippet': 'As the Republican primary campaign picks up, the mood of many Florida voters was sour, focused on one thing: the state’s troubled economy. Few expect any quick solutions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAKELAND, Fla. — Only four years ago, life certainly seemed on the upswing for Kate and Marcus Freeman, young professionals who had recently moved from Worcester, Mass., into a new house here in sun-splashed central Florida, where they hoped to enjoy the warmer weather and new jobs. He was an accountant. She would be teaching preschool. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Years of Despair Add to Uncertainty in Florida Race', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Years of Despair Add Uncertainty in Florida Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gingrich, Newt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T03:48:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'n