from the DealBook newsletter.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/morning-take-out-411/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the DealBook newsletter.', 'lead_paragraph': '5 U.S. Banks Tally Exposure to Europe’s Debt Maelstrom \xa0|\xa0 Five large American banks, including JPMorgan Chase and Goldman Sachs, have more than $80 billion of exposure to Italy, Spain, Portugal, Ireland and Greece, the most economically stressed nations in the euro currency zone, according to a New York Times analysis of the banks’ financial disclosures.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Morning Take-Out', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T13:07:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de79be1b-fad0-5bb6-b972-158ff793e93d', 'word_count': 2355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de79be1b-fad0-5bb6-b972-158ff793e93d'}, {'abstract': 'The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development has agreed to acquire a stake in a Russian stock exchange as part of an effort to encourage transparent capital markets in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/banking-organization-to-buy-stake-in-russian-stock-market/', 'snippet': 'The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development has agreed to acquire a stake in a Russian stock exchange as part of an effort to encourage transparent capital markets in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVOS, Switzerland — The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development said on Monday that it had agreed to acquire a stake in a Russian stock exchange as part of an effort to