arecki’s other movies include “The Trials of Henry Kissinger,” about you know who, and a 2005 grand jury prize winner, “Why We Fight,” about the American military industrial complex. Notably, one of this year’s jury members was Charles Ferguson, whose documentaries include “No End in Sight” and “Inside Job,” and who, like Mr. Jarecki, has a methodological gift for transforming boatloads of information into both political arguments and eminently watchable narratives. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sundance Documentaries Transform Data Into Stories', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Jason', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berg, Amy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlinger, Joe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Echols, Damien', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greenfield, Lauren', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackson, Peter', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jarecki, Eugene', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kubrick, Stanley', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Misskelley, Jessie Jr', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicholson, Jack', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Richard Milhous', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robeson, Paul', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simon, David', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sinatra, Frank', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vedder, Eddie', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T13:30:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'perso