 its image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/nyregion/police-chief-in-conn-resigns-after-bias-arrests-of-officers.html', 'snippet': 'The lawyer for Police Chief Leonard Gallo said the chief was stepping down so the town in Connecticut would not be distracted as it tried to rehabilitate its image.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The chief of the embattled Police Department in East Haven, Conn., announced on Monday that he was retiring after the arrest of four officers last week on federal charges of harassing and intimidating members of minority groups.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/nyregion/31easthaven-span/31easthaven-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/31/nyregion/31easthaven-span/31easthaven-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/nyregion/31easthaven-span/31easthaven-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/nyregion/31easthaven-span/31easthaven-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/31/nyregion/31easthaven-span/31easthaven-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'East Haven Police Chief Retiring After Charges for Officers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Police Chief to Retire After Bias Charges for 4 Officers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gall