ns.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/feeling-strain-when-violent-patients-need-care/', 'snippet': 'A rising number of registered nurses rank “on-the-job assault” as one of their three greatest safety concerns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I didn’t know much about the patient — just that he’d showed up on my floor the previous evening after some confusion about whether his room was ready. When I went into his room that morning, he was still asleep. I gently roused him while his doctor, who had followed me in, explained that he needed to do a physical exam.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling Strain When Violent Patients Need Care', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nursing and Nurses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T21:24:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Theresa Brown, R.N', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Theresa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'R.', 'middlename': 'N', 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/102cd08e-132d-52a3-9c17-da230d73e228', 'word_count': 937, 'uri': 'nyt://article/102cd08e-132d-52a3-9c17-da230d73e228'}, {'abstract': 'The soprano Angela Meade won the $50,000 prize for singers from ages 25 to 40 who have already appeared in featured roles at the Metropolitan Opera.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/beverly-sills-artist-award-announced/', 'snippet': 'The soprano Angela Meade won the $50,000 prize for singers from ages 25 to 40 who have already appeared in featured roles at the Metropolitan Opera.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The soprano Angela Meade won the Beverly Sills Artist Award, a $50,000 prize for singers from ages 25 to 40 who have already appeared in featured roles at the Metropolitan Opera, the company said on Monday. Ms. Meade, 34, made her Met debut as Elvira in Verdi’s “Ernani” four years ago and will appear again in the role on Thursday in a new run of the opera. The award was endowed by Agnes Varis, a Met managing director, and her husband, Karl Leichtman. Ms. Sills died in 2007. Previous winners include Nathan Gunn, Joyce DiDonato, Matthew Polenzani, John Relyea, Susanna Phillips and Isabel Leonard.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beverly Sills Artist Award Is Announced', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meade, Angela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sills, Beverly', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T21:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba14c53d-b608-50d7-bb3c-a11a3854796b', 'word_count': 104, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba14c53d-b608-50d7-bb3c-a11a3854796b'}, {'abstract': 'The D.G.A. Awards aren’t televised, so the pressure 