ed by the egg’s temperature at incubation. The warmer the weather, the more female baby turtles there are. (The phenomenon is called temperature-dependent sex determination.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/science/31OBTURTLE2/31OBOX2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/science/31OBTURTLE2/31OBTURTLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/31/science/31OBTURTLE2/31OBTURTLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Marine Turtles Make Up for an Early Gender Gap', 'kicker': 'Observatory', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marine Turtles Make Up For an Early Gender Gap', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Turtles and Tortoises', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gender', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T22:46:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sindya N. Bhanoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sindya', 'middlename': 'N.', 'lastname': 'Bhanoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9353ace1-8814-553f-86b1-c17f37591d33', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9353ace1-8814-553f-86b1-c17f37591d33'}, {'abstract': 'The vice president recounts what happened when the president polled his war council about whether to raid compound in Afghanistan. Mr. Biden’s advice: Don’t do it.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/from-biden-a-vivid-account-of-bin-laden-decision/', 'snippet': 'The vice president recounts what happened when the president polled his war council about whether to raid compound in Afghanistan. Mr. Biden’s advice: Don’t do it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the anguished White House debates over the war in Afghanistan, Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. argued consistently to stress counterterrorism over the more costly strategy of nation-building. It turns out, though, that Mr. Biden warned against the most sensational counterterrorism operation of the Obama presidency: the commando raid that killed Osama bin Laden.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Biden, a Vivid Account of Bin Laden Decision', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-30T22:46:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fb891e2-02de-527e-b510-eecc998dc601', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fb891e2-02de-527e-b510-eecc998dc601'}, {'abstract': "David N. Roberts, chairman of Riverdale Country School's board of trustees, and Dominic A.A. Randolph, Riverdale's head of school, sent an e-mail in response to an article about the high cost of private school tuition. Riverdale charge