, 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/world/mexico-1/mexico-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/31/world/mexico-1/mexico-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/world/mexico-1/mexico-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/world/mexico-1/mexico-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/31/world/mexico-1/mexico-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Food Crisis as Drought and Cold Hit Mexico', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Food Crisis As Drought And Cold Hit Mexico', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T02:59:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karla Zabludovsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zabludovsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fd0c43a-d581-5a94-99c6-88ac59aa8a3b', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fd0c43a-d581-5a94-99c6-88ac59aa8a3b'}, {'abstract': 'Will Celebrity Guest Solver Alan Zweibel be turned around by Doug Peterson’s grid?', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/30/zweibel/', 'snippet': 'Will Celebrity Guest Solver Alan Zweibel be turned around by Doug Peterson’s grid?', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUESDAY’S PUZZLE — One of the nice things about the Celebrity Guest Solver feature, other than giving me the opportunity to work with some truly brilliant minds, is that it gives me a bit of a break. A chance to put my feet up, if you will, and let someone else do the heavy crossword lifting for a change. It’s asking a lot, because these are busy people who obligingly take the time out of their busy schedules to solve and write about the puzzle for your entertainment. And because they usually have a book to plug.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Celebrity Guest Solver Alan Zweibel', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T03:00:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43732e79-470e-58b0-90bb-203a39c867b6', 'word_count': 1181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43732e79-470e-58b0-90bb-203a39c867b6'}, {'abstract': 'In “Russian Transport,” a relative joins a Russian-American family in Sheepshead Bay, changing the dynamic and bringing corruption.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/theater/reviews/russian-transport-starring-janeane-garofalo.html', 'snippet': 'In “Russian Transport,” a relative joins a Russian-American family in Sheepshead Bay, changing the dynamic and bringing corruption.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The standup comic and sometime actress Janeane Garofalo drops the shtick, more or less, to play a stern Russian Jewish mother in Brooklyn in “Russian Transport,” by Erika Sheffer, a new play from the New Group that opened on Monday night at the Acorn Theater.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/arts/ACORN/ACORN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/01/31/arts/ACORN/ACORN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/arts/ACORN/ACORN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 617, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/01/31/arts/ACORN/ACORN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/01/31/arts/ACORN/ACORN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Family Reunion, With a Chaser', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Family Reunion, With a Chaser', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian-Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elliott, Scott', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steele, Sarah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': '