rganization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6977364-2d38-560d-879c-84799b88b8a2', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6977364-2d38-560d-879c-84799b88b8a2'}, {'abstract': 'Eli Manning is playing in the Super Bowl on Sunday, but all the talk in Indianapolis is about his brother Peyton’s future with the Colts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/02/01/sports/even-in-a-super-bowl-week-its-still-peytons-place-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'Eli Manning is playing in the Super Bowl on Sunday, but all the talk in Indianapolis is about his brother Peyton’s future with the Colts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We have reached the point in the pre-Super Bowl wind cycle where everyone arrives in the host city and begins to take stock of it. In Indianapolis, that means cringing at a giant set of Roman numerals in Monument Circle and a fresh round of “oh my goshes” about the Peyton Manning standoff.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Even in a Super Bowl Week, It’s Still Peyton’s Place', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Even in a Super Bowl Week, It’s Still Peyton’s Place', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Penguins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indianapolis Colts', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ne