st 30 years, I have made almost every mistake a business owner can make. But I have always understood the importance of trying to do everything I could to make customers happy and encourage them to return. This might seem trite and obvious, but it really isn’t. At least not to everybody.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Doing the Math on Disappointed Customers', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customer Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Guarantees and Warranties', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T18:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Goltz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goltz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db32cd3d-4825-5edd-a6ab-23597b5a3cad', 'word_count': 941, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db32cd3d-4825-5edd-a6ab-23597b5a3cad'}, {'abstract': 'On Tuesday the board of the Venice Biennale announced that Massimiliano Gioni, the associate director of the New Museum in New York, had been appointed director of the visual arts for the 55th edition of the event, which will be held in the summer of 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/new-museums-gioni-named-director-of-visual-art-for-venice-biennale/', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday the board of the Venice Biennale announced that Massimiliano Gioni, the associate director of the New Museum in New York, had been appointed director of the visual arts for the 55th edition of the event, which will be held in the summer...', 'lead_paragraph': 'He may only be 38, but Massimiliano Gioni has quickly become a biennale veteran. He directed the Gwangju Art Biennale in South Korea two years ago; was the curator of the section called “La Zona’’ at the 50th Venice Biennale in 2003; organized “Of Mice and Men,” the fourth Berlin Biennale, in 2006; and was co-curator of the fifth edition of the traveling art biennial called Manifesta in 2004. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Museum’s Gioni Named Director of Visual Art for Venice Biennale', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Venice Biennale', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gioni, Massimiliano', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Museum of Contemporary Art', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T18:04:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d46c732-4bb6-5074-9b98-a484bcd8493e', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d46c732-4bb6-5074-9b98-a484bcd8493e'}, {'abstract': 'Roche Holdings nominated four candidates for Illumina’s board on Tuesday, seeking to add pressure on the genetic-analysis company as part of its $5.7 billion hostile bid.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/roche-names-slate-of-directors-for-illuminas-board/', 'snippet': 'Roche Holdings nominated four candidates for Illumina’s board on Tuesday, seeking to add pressure on the genetic-ana