om/2012/01/31/rust-is-his-palette-the-automotive-art-of-bo-lundvang/', 'snippet': 'A Swedish artist creates stencil art in steel, with the silhouette of a car projected against a backdrop of deeply textured rust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Long the scourge of car collectors in the Salt Belt states, rust has become a subject of aesthetic interest in recent years, with various concours adding juried categories with euphemistic names like Preservation Class. A Swedish artist, Bo Lundvang, is channeling the trend into an oxidized form of pop art, projecting desirable automobiles against a backdrop of rusted steel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rust Is His Palette: The Automotive Art of Bo Lundvang', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sweden', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T19:32:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rory Carroll', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carroll', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d04d1125-801d-59e5-b4e9-d40674fe33ca', 'word_count': 476, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d04d1125-801d-59e5-b4e9-d40674fe33ca'}, {'abstract': 'David Letterman will celebrate 30 years as a late-night television host on Wednesday night, though without much fanfare.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/30-year-milestone-for-letterman-but-little-instinct-to-look-back/', 'snippet': 'David Letterman will celebrate 30 years as a late-night television host on Wednesday night, though without much fanfare.', 'lead_paragraph': '5:12 p.m. | Updated David Letterman will celebrate 30 years as a late-night television host on Wednesday, though without much fanfare.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letterman Anniversary Is Like a Low-Key Guest', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burnett, Rob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carson, Johnny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Letterman, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T19:36:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91b83bab-c863-563f-972d-ca8ff5145213', 'word_count': 659, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91b83bab-c863-563f-972d-ca8ff5145213'}, {'abstract': 'In a bet over the Super Bowl, Andrew Cuomo put up Greek yogurt, bagels and cheesecake against the Massachusetts governor’s pies, clam chowder and chips. Have a different thought?', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/cuomo-bets-heapings-of-fermented-milk-on-the-giants/', 'snippet': 'In a bet over the Super Bowl, Andrew Cuomo put up Greek yogurt, bagels and cheesecake against the Massachusetts governor’s pies, clam chowder and chips. Have a different thought?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Certain foods