 the Giants’ chances to win the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a kinder, gentler Antrel Rolle at the Super Bowl media day, no matter how hard the contingent of reporters tried to push for something bolder.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Confident Rolle Is Out of the Prediction Game', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rolle, Antrel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T20:58:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/05e6c3bf-407e-5915-a858-f6722b3b59ac', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05e6c3bf-407e-5915-a858-f6722b3b59ac'}, {'abstract': 'The preseason game on Oct. 2 will be one of the first events at the Barclays Center, the new arena for the Nets in downtown Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/islanders-to-play-devils-in-preseason-game-at-new-arena-in-brooklyn/', 'snippet': 'The preseason game on Oct. 2 will be one of the first events at the Barclays Center, the new arena for the Nets in downtown Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps hinting that they are seriously considering alternatives to Nassau County, the Islanders will be the home team in the first N.H.L. game at the Barclays Center in Brooklyn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Islanders to Play Devils in Preseason Game at New Arena in Br