ng on Wednesday and has picked Morgan Stanley to lead the company’s long-awaited stock sale.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/facebook-plans-to-file-5-billion-i-p-o-on-wednesday/', 'snippet': 'Facebook plans to file the prospectus for its initial public offering on Wednesday and has picked Morgan Stanley to lead the company’s long-awaited stock sale.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:02 p.m. | Updated Facebook plans to file the prospectus for its initial public offering on Wednesday, according to people briefed on the matter, finally kicking off one of the most anticipated stock sales of the social networking era.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Facebook Said to Be Planning for I.P.O. Filing on Wednesday', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morgan Stanley', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T22:25:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9f0031e-e0f4-561d-b242-33ed20623759', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9f0031e-e0f4-561d-b242-33ed20623759'}, {'abstract': 'New England tight end Rob Gronkowski was wearing a sneaker on his injured left ankle Tuesday but still does not know if he will be able to play in the Super Bowl.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/gronkowski-greets-news-media-without-a-boot/', 'snippet': 'New England tight end Rob Gronkowski was wearing a sneaker on his injured left ankle Tuesday but still does not know if he will be able to play in the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — Patriots tight end Rob Gronkowski was wearing a sneaker and not a boot on his injured left ankle Tuesday when he met with the news media. Gronkowski, who was injured during the A.F.C. championship game against the Ravens, said it was not a gamesmanship ploy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gronkowski Greets News Media Without a Boot', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Super Bowl', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gronkowski, Rob', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-01-31T22:27:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Nelson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f224d812-44e2-5042-bb52-f9af93a501d2', 'word_count': 86, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f224d812-44e2-5042-bb52-f9af93a501d2'}, {'abstract': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important as well as peculiar items. Tuesday’s selection includes items on a major makeover for transportation, an intentionally silly recruiting video from Twitter, Facebook’s Sheryl Sandberg and a board member departing at Hewlett-Packard.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/01/31/todays-scuttlebot-twitter-humor-and-rethinking-the-car/', 'snippet': 'The technology reporters and editors of The New York Times scour the Web for important as well as peculi